oard of Directors ][47]\n    * [ Research & Manufacturing ][48]\n    * [ Sustainability ][49]\n    * [ Awards & Recognitions ][50]\n* [ About Us ][51]\n* [ Investors ][52]\n* [ Awards & Recognitions ][53]\n* [ Investors ][54]\n* [ Insights ][55]\n* [ Contact ][56]\n* * ## Search form\n* ### 1\n  \n  ### / 3\n  \n  ## Complete range of Pharma Packaging Solutions\n  \n  [Explore Innovations][57]\n* ### 2\n  \n  ### / 3\n  \n  ## Bilcare conferred 'Best Material Supplier' by OPPI\n  \n  [View Recognition][58]\n* ### 3\n  \n  ### / 3\n  \n  ## Proactive steps toward environmental impact\n  \n  [Learn More][59]\nWe shape Pharma brands with focus on patient care, via novel Packaging solutions\n\n## Our Responsibility\n\nMedicines manufactured in days should last throughout their shelf-life. We achieve this with\nmaterials excellence, innovation and waves of research & development\n[Explore vision & values][60]\n\n#### NYCO GmBH\n\n**Basel, Switzerland**\n[eu@bilcare.com][61]\n\n#### NYCO GmBH\n\n**Basel, Switzerland**\n[eu@bilcare.com][62]\n\n#### NYCO GmBH\n\n**Basel, Switzerland**\n[eu@bilcare.com][63]\n\n#### NYCO GmBH\n\n**Basel, Switzerland**\n[eu@bilcare.com][64]\n\n#### NYCO GmBH\n\n**Basel, Switzerland**\n[eu@bilcare.com][65]\n\n#### NYCO GmBH\n\n**Basel, Switzerland**\n[eu@bilcare.com][66]\n\n#### NYCO GmBH\n\n**Basel, Switzerland**\n[eu@bilcare.com][67]\n\n## Trusted partner across\n\n## the globe\n\nWe are known around the world for only the best in quality Pharma Packaging materials supplies and\nconsistent customer service\n\n[View locations][68]\n50000\nTonnes Annual manufacturing capacity\n1000\nQualified pharma professionals\n200\nPatents of distinctive solutions awarded\n\n## Over 40 years of Pharma Packaging excellence\n\nA history of evolution from an up-start to a reliable long-term solutions provider to meet the needs\nof Pharma companies globally\n\n1997\nCommenced Pharma packaging research with R&D center in Pune, India\n2000\nOpened new pharma packaging materials manufacturing facility in Pune, India\n2007\nBilcare Global Center of Excellence & Technology inaugurated\n2014\nAwarded the National Intellectual Property Award by Government of India\n2021\nRefocused Bilcare business operations in Americas and Europe\n\n## Enabling brand growth & patient-centered care\n\nWe create exclusive packaging with barrier properties and convenience features to protect the\nquality and integrity of pharmaceutical products at optimal cost\n\n## Pharma Packaging Innovations that are sustainable, affordable\n\n## and innovative\n\nOur aluminum foils, polymer films and anti-counterfeiting packaging solutions make us a force to\nreckon in the packaging industry and we remain an industry leading player in the blister packaging\nsolutions arena.\n\n[Explore Expertise][69]\n\n## Customer Reflections\n\nOur value system guarantees resul"}}, "page_text": "Loading... Caprihans India Limited [ [Pharma Packaging Innovation] ][1] * [ Pharma Packaging Innovations ][2] * * [ Thermoforming Blister Films ][3] * [ Duplex ][4] * [ Triplex ][5] * [ Ultra ][6] * [ Ultra Tx ][7] * [ Armour ][8] * [ Aclar ][9] * [ Excel ][10] * [ Exxtra ][11] * [ Optra ][12] * [ BAPP ][13] * [ Zymax ][14] * [ Zymax Tx ][15] * [ Zymax PDP ][16] * [ Coldforming Blister Foils ][17] * [ Venus ][18] * [ Venus PR ][19] * [ Venus SBC ][20] * [ Tropical Foil ][21] * [ Nutra Venus ][22] * [ Vento Venus ][23] * [ Lidding Blister Foils ][24] * [ Zeon ][25] * [ Zeon+ ][26] * [ Zenith ][27] * [ Zeon+ PR ][28] * [ Suppo Zenith ][29] * [ Zeon PR ][30] * [ Zeon D ][31] * [ Zeon X ][32] * [ DESALU ][33] * [ Crispak Lidding Foils ][34] * [ Crispak AP-PT ][35] * [ Crispak PL ][36] * [ Crispak PP ][37] * [ Crispak PT ][38] * [ Laminates / Sachets Foils ][39] * [ Lamiflex PAL ][40] * [ Lamiflex RAL ][41] * [ Pharma Packaging Innovation ][42] * [ Research Services ][43] * [ About Us ][44] * * [ Quality & Innovation ][45] * [ 5C's Approach ][46] * [ Board of Directors ][47] * [ Research & Manufacturing ][48] * [ Sustainability ][49] * [ Awards & Recognitions ][50] * [ About Us ][51] * [ Investors ][52] * [ Awards & Recognitions ][53] * [ Investors ][54] * [ Insights ][55] * [ Contact ][56] * * ## Search form * ### 1 ### / 3 ## Complete range of Pharma Packaging Solutions [Explore Innovations][57] * ### 2 ### / 3 ## Bilcare conferred 'Best Material Supplier' by OPPI [View Recognition][58] * ### 3 ### / 3 ## Proactive steps toward environmental impact [Learn More][59] We shape Pharma brands with focus on patient care, via novel Packaging solutions ## Our Responsibility Medicines manufactured in days should last throughout their shelf-life. We achieve this with materials excellence, innovation and waves of research & development [Explore vision & values][60] #### NYCO GmBH **Basel, Switzerland** [eu@bilcare.com][61] #### NYCO GmBH **Basel, Switzerland** [eu@bilcare.com][62] #### NYCO GmBH **Basel, Switzerland** [eu@bilcare.com][63] #### NYCO GmBH **Basel, Switzerland** [eu@bilcare.com][64] #### NYCO GmBH **Basel, Switzerland** [eu@bilcare.com][65] #### NYCO GmBH **Basel, Switzerland** [eu@bilcare.com][66] #### NYCO GmBH **Basel, Switzerland** [eu@bilcare.com][67] ## Trusted partner across ## the globe We are known around the world for only the best in quality Pharma Packaging materials supplies and consistent customer service [View locations][68] 50000 Tonnes Annual manufacturing capacity 1000 Qualified pharma professionals 200 Patents of distinctive solutions awarded ## Over 40 years of Pharma Packaging excellence A history of evolution from an up-start to a reliable long-term solutions provider to meet the needs of Pharma companies globally 1997 Commenced Pharma packaging research with R&D center in Pune, India 2000 Opened new pharma packaging materials manufacturing facility in Pune, India 2007 Bilcare Global Center of Excellence & Technology inaugurated 2014 Awarded the National Intellectual Property Award by Government of India 2021 Refocused Bilcare business operations in Americas and Europe ## Enabling brand growth & patient-centered care We create exclusive packaging with barrier properties and convenience features to protect the quality and integrity of pharmaceutical products at optimal cost ## Pharma Packaging Innovations that are sustainable, affordable ## and innovative Our aluminum foils, polymer films and anti-counterfeiting packaging solutions make us a force to reckon in the packaging industry and we remain an industry leading player in the blister packaging solutions arena. [Explore Expertise][69] ## Customer Reflections Our value system guarantees results. Here are snapshots of what customers have said about our innovative Pharma packaging solutions Bilcare is experienced in manufacturing high quality pharma packaging products, and is always open for continuous improvisation. Bilcare’s manufacturing processes and systems truly set an industry standard. Its focus on innovation and on time delivery is remarkable. The company’s remarkable facilities and manufacturing processes complement Bilcare’s competent technical and manufacturing teams. We recognise the company for its technically sound team, who have consistently displayed innovative ideas in Pharma. Bilcare has put into practice advances in technology for continuous product development. Its people and facilities are exceptional. High degree of focus on documentation of products and processes. The facilities and machinery is spectacular. Cutting edge technologies leads to supplies of high quality materials. We have experienced nothing else but the best quality from Bilcare. For years we worked with Bilcare for novel packaging ideas, use of advanced technology machines and robust quality systems. Bilcare has put in motion superior QMS related procedures and controls that allow for high quality output of manufactured materials. Bilcare R&D centre is capable of designing any and all pharma packaging solutions. An excellent team, technically equipped. World-class infrastructure for primary packaging materials manufacturing for oral solid dosages, supported with strong R&D. Bilcare’s facilities are impressive, equipped with modern technology and machinery. It's a testament to its personnel and leadership. Bilcare has some of the best people in the industry, skilled and highly knowledgeable. Focused on good manufacturing and quality. Bilcare’s Pune facility is nestled in a green, pollution-free landscape. The company has strong quality systems, supportive teams. A consistent supplier of high quality child-resistant foils. Values innovation, seen in its facilities, products, processes and approach. Bilcare as a company radiates high potential to succeed due to dedication towards quality, compliances and advanced manufacturing. Bilcare has put into practice advances in technology for continuous product development. Its people and facilities are exceptional. Bilcare facilities display a high degree of CGMP controls, whilst running a high scale production infrastructure. ## Legacy of excellence & industry leadership Bilcare is recognized globally for excellence in innovation, ingenuity, and technical achievement. [View Recognitions][70] > Best Vendor Award for ‘Packaging Material Supplier’ for the year 2017 > Global Customer Service Leadership Award in solid dose formulation packaging > Best Vendor Award for ‘Packaging Material Supplier’ for the year 2017 ## Conforming to highest standards of quality & manufacturing globally We design and implement various test methods for assuring quality of packaging materials. Learn more about quality and regulatory compliances. [Explore Manufacturing][71] ## We impact lives through our CSR Foundation Our Foundation is not an add-on but an integral part of our business strategy, which is centered around creating value for people. 2000 Minds ignited for future posibilities 100 CSR initiatives taken up till date 20 Years of spreading knowledge & happiness [Explore Foundation][