ership. Bilcare has some of the best people in the industry, skilled and highly knowledgeable. Focused on good manufacturing and quality. Bilcare’s Pune facility is nestled in a green, pollution-free landscape. The company has strong quality systems, supportive teams. A consistent supplier of high quality child-resistant foils. Values innovation, seen in its facilities, products, processes and approach. Bilcare as a company radiates high potential to succeed due to dedication towards quality, compliances and advanced manufacturing. Bilca", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "Bilcare Limited — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Specializes in pharmaceutical flexible packaging and specialty films. | Indian company specializing in pharmaceutical flexible packaging and specialty films. | Specialty pharmaceutical packaging; Clinical trial materials; Anti-counterfeiting technologies | India | India", "role_description": "Brand / Marketer", "key_products": "Specialty pharmaceutical packaging; Clinical trial materials; Anti-counterfeiting technologies"}}, "X Score": "81", "Y Score": "80", "Overall Score": "80", "Industry Category": "Others / Packaging", "Quadrant": "Leaders"}, {"Company": "DS Smith Plc", "Website": "https://www.dssmith.com", "Founded": "1940", "Headquarters": "United Kingdom", "Continent / Geography": "EU(United Kingdom)", "Operational Presence": "United Kingdom", "Ownership": "Subsidiary of International Paper", "Employees": "20", "Core Categories": "Packaging; Paper; Recycling", "Specialty Focus": "Provides flexible packaging solutions for consumer goods and industrial markets.", "Key Brands Represented": "DS Smith Tape Back; DS Smith Round Wrap; Alterplas; Coreboard/Canboard", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Brand / Marketer", "Contact Person": "Andreas Faust", "Role": "Head of Procurement, Germany and Switzerland", "Email": "press.office@dssmith.com", "LinkedIn": "https://www.linkedin.com/c