lity Report ][134] * [ Net Zero Transition Plan ][135] * [ ESG Databook ][136] * [ Task Force on Climate-Related Financial Disclosures (TCFD) ][137] * [ Taxonomie de l'UE ][138] * [ Policies ][139] * [ Our ESG Ratings ][140] * [ Circular Economy Lesson Plan ][141] * How to make your packaging circular * [ Circular Design Metrics ][142] * [ Optimize your packaging ][143] * [ 100% recyclable ][144] * [ Plastic replacement ][145] * Media * [ Our Stories ][146] * [ PPWR: The Packaging and Packaging Waste Regulation Explained ][147] * [ Wasted Paper: A Path to Better Recycling ][148] * [ Media contact ][149] * Careers * Life at DS Smith * [ Our Culture & Values ][150] * Diversity, Equity & Inclusion * [ International Women's Day ][151] * [ Gender Diversity ][152] * [ Reward, Recognition & Benefits ][153] * [ Career Development ][154] * Early Careers * [ Our Graduate Programmes ][155] * [ Our Apprenticeships ][156] * Our Team * [ Careers in Manufacturing, Operations, Production ][157] * [ Careers in Corporate functions & shared services ][158] * [ Careers in Sales, Marketing & Innovation ][159] * [ Careers in Sustainability ][160] * [ Careers in TMS Global ][161] * [ Careers in Supply Chain & Procurement ][162] * [ Careers in Information & Technology ][163] * Apply for a job * [ Application Hints & Tips ][164] * [ Locations ][165] * Offer * [ Offer for DS Smith Plc by International Paper Company ][166] * [ Search ][167] * Worldwide [DS Smith Logo] # Taking action for long-term value creation We’re taking the next step in our transformation journey to reshape our business in EMEA and to deliver for our customers at pace. [ Find out more ][168] [ ### Packaging Webinar Library Your one-stop destination for Packaging webinars. Watch anytime, anywhere. Explore our on-demand webinar library, bringing together industry-leading Packaging insights, innovations and best practices from top experts around the globe. ][169] [ ### Making Fibre Fashionable – one delivery at a time Our latest research uncovers the scale of plastic used in e-commerce clothing packaging, and sheds light on the positive impact that switching to fibre-based alternatives could have on the fashion industry, its consumers, and the planet. ][170] [ [Four recycling bins] ### UK Recycling Systems Explained The UK doesn’t have one standard system of collecting recycling and waste materials. We break down the different types. ][171] [ More stories ][172] [ More stories ][173] # Taking action for long-term value creation We’re taking the next step in our transformation journey to reshape our business in EMEA and to deliver for our customers at pace. [ Find out more ][174] [ ### Packaging Webinar Library Your one-stop destination for Packaging webinars. Watch anytime, anywhere. Explore our on-demand webinar library, bringing together industry-leading Packaging insights, innovations and best practices from top experts around the globe. ][175] [ ### Making Fibre Fashionable – one delivery at a time Our latest research uncovers the scale of plastic used in e-commerce clothing packaging, and sheds light on the positive impact that switching to fibre-based alternatives could have on the fashion industry, its consumers, and the planet. ][176] [ [Four recycling bins] ### UK Recycling Systems Explained The UK doesn’t have one standard system of collecting recycling and waste materials. We break down the different types. ][177] [ More stories ][178] [ More stories ][179] ## Our Offering Redefining Packaging for a Changing World [ Packaging Solutions ][180] [ Paper Products ][181] [ Recycling Services ][182] [ Point of Sale Display Solutions ][183] ## Our Experts The latest insights from our people [ ### What is Recyclability and what are the Benefits? By Jonathan Edmunds, Head of Recyclability, Sustainability, and Government Affairs at DS Smith ][184] [ ### PPWR: The Packaging and Packaging Waste Regulation Explained By Susana Braz, Head of Government Affairs at DS Smith ][185] [ ### Recycling Technology Innovations Revealed By Stephanie Dalton, Innovation Manager at DS Smith ][186] [ ### Innovating in Barrier Technology By Susana Aucejo, Surface & Barrier Director at DS Smith ][187] ## We care about sustainability Sustainability is core to our brand purpose of ‘Redefining Packaging for a Changing World’. Our new ‘Now and Next’ sustainability strategy focuses on the sustainability challenges we are facing today, as well as those that will impact future generations. [Find out more ][188] [ ## Packaging Solutions Partner with us for your packaging needs. More info ][189] [ ## Containerboard Explore our complete range of containerboard paper grades More info ][190] [ ## Recycling Services How we can help you waste less and recycle more. More info ][191] [ ## Investor information Results, presentations and shareholder information. More info ][192] [ ## Join DS Smith Discover your new career in Packaging, Paper and Recycling. Apply now ][193] [ ## Get in touch Contact us for sales and media enquiries. Contact us ][194] ## Redefining Packaging for a Changing World We are different because we see the opportunity for packaging to play a powerful role in the world around us. ## Who we are * [About DS Smith][195] * [About International Paper][196] * [IP & DS Smith Combination][197] * [Investors][198] * [Sustainability][199] * [Media][200] * [Careers][201] ## What we do * [Packaging solutions][202] * [Paper products][203] * [Recycling services][204] ## Get in touch * [Our locations][205] [Contact us][206] ## Follow us * [ [Follow DS Smith on LinkedIn] ][207] * [ [Follow DS Smith on Twitter] ][208] * [ [Follow DS Smith on YouTube] ][209] * [ [Follow DS Smith on Facebook] ][210] * [ [Follow DS Smith on Insta", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "DS Smith Plc — channel participant (chatgpt_recall). Verify: Provides flexible packaging solutions; primarily paper-based but includes flexible packaging. | Provides flexible packaging solutions for consu