(Worldwide Reach) ][85] * [Executive Leadership ][86] * [Get in Touch ][87] * [Digital Transformation ][88] * [Hire to Retire][89] * [Procure to Pay][90] * [Customer Collaboration][91] * [Shop Floor Digitisation][92] * [Supply Chain Optimization][93] * [Connect With Us >>][94] * [ ][95] * [News & Media][96] * [Investors][97] * [Careers][98] * [Contact Us][99] * [EPL-IMPACKT][100] * [English][101] English [ Chinese ][102] [ Spanish ][103] [ Polish ][104] [ German ][105] * [Book A Session >>][106] * [Industry][107] * [Beauty & Cosmetics][108] * [Oral Care][109] * [Food & Nutrition][110] * [Pharma & Health][111] * [Home Care][112] [Product Innovations (Print)][113] * [NEOSeam][114] * [Glitter][115] * [Glow in the dark][116] * [3D Foil][117] * [Screen Braille Effect][118] * [Lens Foil Effect][119] * [Product Innovations (Laminate)][120] * [Platina][121] * [Platina Pro][122] * [r-Platina][123] * [PlatinaME][124] * [Platina Vision][125] * [Etain][126] * [Super Titanium][127] * [Clarion][128] * [Sustainable Offerings][129] * [Vision Platina][130] * [Platina][131] * [PlatinaME][132] * [PlatinaPro][133] * [r-Platina][134] * [Organic Green Maple Leaf][135] * [Green Maple Leaf][136] * [Product Segment][137] * [Laminates][138] * [Laminated Tubes][139] * [Extruded Tubes][140] * [Caps & Closures][141] * [Dispensing Systems][142] * [Book A Session >>][143] * [Concept to Commercialization][144] [Concept to Tube][145] * [Technology & Manufacturing][146] [Co-creation][147] * [Build With Us][148] [Co-creation Gallery][149] [Process Innovation][150] * [Innovative Offerings][151] * [Print Innovations][152] * [Sustainability Innovations][153] * [Product Innovations][154] * [Download Sustainability Report >>][155] * [Product Sustainability][156] [Commitment to a better future][157] [Innovative Product Offerings][158] * [Process Sustainability][159] [People Sustainability][160] * [Partnerships][161] [Supplier Sustainability][162] * [Connect With Us >>][163] * [Leader Speak][164] [History & Timeline][165] [Techology & Innovation][166] * [Philosophy, Vision, Mission][167] [Board of Directors][168] [Awards & Achievements][169] * [EPL Global (Worldwide Reach)][170] [Executive Leadership][171] [Get in Touch][172] * [Digital Transformation][173] * [Hire to Retire][174] * [Procure to Pay][175] * [Customer Collaboration][176] * [Shop Floor Digitisation][177] * [Supply Chain Optimization][178] Ecovadis Platinum Sustainability Rating. EPL Limited Nalagarh Wins IMC Ramkrishna Bajaj National Quality Award 2024. Winner of the CII Award for Excellence in Disability Inclusion # Leading # the pack # sustainably [Discover Our Catalogue >>][179] Ecovadis Platinum Sustainability Rating. EPL Limited Nalagarh Wins IMC Ramkrishna Bajaj National Quality Award 2024. Winner of the CII Award for Excellence in Disability Inclusion ## From Gold to Platinum, A Commitment Fulfilled ## Big steps For ## lesser footprint [ Latest Sustainability Report ][180] What we do ## Pioneers in specialty packaging We create specialty packaging for the world’s leading FMCG companies. Our global expertise spans five large categories – Oral Care, Beauty & Cosmetics, Pharmaceuticals & Health, Food & Nutrition and Home Care. Our portfolio of products comprises laminates, laminated tubes, extruded tubes, caps & closures and dispensing systems/applicators. Product Category ## Everything ## Under the Sun [Beauty & Cosmetics ][181] [Oral Care ][182] [Food & Nutrition ][183] [Pharma & Health ][184] [Home Care ][185] Innovations ## Revolution ## in a tube Innovation is our lifeblood at EPL. We are constantly buzzing with ideas to make things better for our customers and in the process, leading the pack in our industry. We engage with our customers across the entire cycle from concept to commercialization, co-creating ideas, consulting on product & process, and hand-holding right through to the delivery of viable solutions. [Explore Innovative Offerings >>][186] [Explore Innovative Offerings >>][187] [Know More >>][188] The EPL Green Wave ## Big steps ## for lesser ## footprints AT EPL, we know that sustainability will dictate our very right to operate, and are committed to leading the pack in sustainable packaging. We will pioneer solutions in this area. [Know More >>][189] [rainbow] [rainbow] [rainbow] your brand story ## create ## with us EPL has world-class capabilities in customization and personalization powered by proactive investments in digital printing facilities across the world. That, combined with our design skills and our customer orientation, means that our customers can effortlessly customize their brands. [Book A Session >>][190] [Book A Session >>][191] ### Awards Select Category Sustainability Awards Tube Awards Awards to Leaders HR Awards Other Awards Filter by Year 2026 2025 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 2019 2018 2017 2016 2015 2014 2013 2009 2008 2007 2005 2003 ##### Best Workplaces™ in Philippines 2026 EPL has been recognised among the Best Workplaces™ in Philippines 2026 by Great Place To Work, reflecting our continued commitment... EPL has been recognised among the **Best Workplaces™ in Philippines 2026** by **Great Place To Work**, reflecting our continued commitment to building a strong, people-centric organisation. This recognition is grounded in the everyday workplace experience—where trust in leadership, respect, and fairness form the foundation of how our teams operate and grow. It highlights a culture that balances **high performance with care**, and **ambition with accountability**, enabling employees to contribute meaningfully while feeling valued and supported. This achievement is a testament to our teams in the Philippines, whose feedback and engagement shape a workplace culture aligned with EPL’s global standards of excellence. [Read More][192] [Read Less][193] ##### Best Workplaces for Women™ in Greater China 2026 EPL has been recognised among the Best Workplaces for Women™ in Greater China 2026 by Great Place To Work, reflecting... EPL has been recognised among the **Best Workplaces for Women™ in Greater China 2026** by **Great Place To Work**, reflecting our commitment to fostering an inclusive and equitable workplace. This recognition highlights EPL’s focus on creating an environment where women are empowered to grow, contribute, and lead, supported by structured practices that enable fairness and opportunity. It underscores the importance of embedding inclusion into everyday decisions, experiences, and systems across the organisation. This achievement is a testament to our teams in Greater China, whose collective efforts continue to shape a workplace culture grounded in respect, equity, and sustained progress. [Read More][194] [Read Less][195] ##### India’s Best Workplaces™ in Manufacturing 2026 – Top 25 (Large Category) EPL has been recognised among the Top 25 India’s Best Workplaces™ in Manufacturing 2026 – Large Category, by Great... EPL has been recognised among the **Top 25 India’s Best Workplaces™ in Manufacturing 2026 – Large Category**, by **Great Place To Work**, underscoring our commitment to building a strong, people-centric manufacturing culture. This recognition reflects EPL’s focus on creating an environment where operational excellence is complemented by trust, fairness, and employee engagement. It highlights our efforts to foster a workplace where teams are empowered, capabilities are continuously developed, and performance is driven through collaboration and accountability. This achievement reinforces EPL’s commitment to shaping manufacturing workplaces that are not only high-performing, but also inclusive, resilient, and aligned with global standards of organisational excellence. [Read More][196] [Read Less][197] ##### CII National HR Excellence Awards – Significant Achievement Category EPL’s Wada Unit has been honoured with the CII HR Excellence Award under the Significant Achievement category at the CII National HR Excellence Awards,... EPL’s **Wada Unit** has been honoured with the **CII HR Excellence Award** under the **Significant Achievement category** at the **CII National HR Excellence Awards**, one of the most respected recognitions in the field of human resources. This category recognises organisations that have demonstrated measurable progress in strengthening HR systems and implementing impactful people practices as part of their excellence journey. The recognition highlights Wada’s focused approach towards **employee engagement, capability building, and continuous improvement**, supported by a strong emphasis on **diversity and inclusion** as a core pillar of its people strategy. This achievement reinforces EPL’s commitment to fostering a **high-performance, inclusive, and people-centric culture**, aligned with global standards of HR excellence. [Read More][198] [Read Less][199] ##### Best Workplaces™ in Greater China 2025 – Medium Category EPL has been recognised among the Best Workplaces™ in Greater China 2025 – Medium Category by Great Place To Work,... EPL has been recognised among the **Best Workplaces™ in Greater China 2025 – Medium Category** by **Great Place To Work**, reflecting our continued focus on building a strong and inclusive workplace culture across the region. This recognition highlights EPL’s commitment to fostering an environment grounded in **trust, respect, and fairness**, where employees are empowered to contribute, grow, and perform at their best. It underscores our efforts to balance operational excellence with people-centric practices that support engagement, collaboration, and sustained performance. This achievement is", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "Essel Propack / EPL Limited — channel participant (seed_file). Verify: Manufactures laminated tubes and laminates, which are flexible packaging. | Brand / Marketer; web_confirmed_flex_pack_player | Laminated Tubes (PBL/ABL); Extruded Tubes; Laminates; Caps & Closures; Dispensing Systems & Applicators | Colgate-Palmolive; Unilever; Procter & Gamble; GlaxoSmithKline; Pantene | India | Mumbai, Maharashtra, India", "role_description": "Brand / Marketer", "key_products": "Laminated Tubes (PBL/ABL); Extruded Tubes; Laminates; Caps & Closures; Dispensing Systems & Applicators"}}, "X Score": "82", "Y Score": "75", "Overall Score": "78", "Industry Category": "Others / Packaging", "Quadrant": "Leaders"}, {"Company": "Ester Industries Ltd.", "Website": "https://esterindustries.com", "Founded": "1985", "Headquarters": "Gurugram, India", "Continent / Geography": "APAC(India)", "Operational Presence": "India", "Ownership": "Public", "Employees": "540", "Core Categories": "Polyester Films (BOPET); Specialty Polymers; Recycling Solutions (rPET); Engineering Plastic Compounds", "Specialty Focus": "Brand / Marketer; web_confirmed_flex_pack_player", "Key Brands Represented": "Ester EX Retort Film; Ester XU (PA66) ESTOPLAST; Ester Masterbatch Specialty Polymers", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Brand / Marketer", "Contact Person": "J.K. Bajaj", "Role": "Head of Procurement", "Email": "info@ester.in", "LinkedIn": "https://www.linkedin.com/company/ester-industries-ltd", "Office No.": "+91-124-2656100", "Country Code": "IN", "Region Code": "APAC", "Summary": "Ester Industries Ltd. — channel participant (seed_file). Verify: Produces BOPET films used in flexible packaging.", "Data Sources": "google_ai; openai_sdk_residual", "_crawl": {"founded_year": 1985}, "Data Confidence": "High", "Quality Score": "4", "commercial_role": "Brand / Marketer", "verify_confidence": "90", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "esterindustries.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "esterindustries.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "[ [Ester Logo] ][1]\n×\n\n### Search by Page Name\n\nSearch\n* [About us][2]\n  \n  ### About us\n  \n  \n  For over 40 years, Ester Industries Limited has been dedicated to driving customer satisfaction\n  through continuous innovat