n dividend ][47]\n  * [IEPF][48]\n  * [Codes and policies][49]\n  * [Intimation to stock exchanges][50]\n  * [Board meetings][51]\n  * [General meetings][52]\n  * [Annual return][53]\n  * [ESOP][54]\n  * [Institutional and analyst meeting][55]\n  * [Related party transaction][56]\n  * [Annual Secretarial Compliance Report][57]\n  * [Scheme of arrangement][58]\n  * [Corporate governance report][59]\n  * [MOA and AOA][60]\n  * [Disclosure under Reg 46 of SEBI LODR][61]\n* [Media][62]\n  \n  ### Media\n  \n  \n  Catch latest updates from Ester’s innovations in films and specialty materials. Explore news,\n  announcements, and industry insights.\n  * [Events][63]\n  * [Media center][64]\n* [Careers][65]\n  \n  ### Careers\n  \n  \n  Build with a team driving innovation in specialty polymers and polyester films. Explore roles that\n  grow your expertise and impact.\n  * [Life @ Ester][66]\n  * [Current Opening][67]\n[Search]\n×\n\n### Search by Page Name\n\nSearch\n[Contact Us][68]\n\n## Discover a Complete Range of Ester Offerings\n\nThoughtfully made products that fit seamlessly into your world\n\n[Explore now ][69]\n\n## Catch Up with Our Latest Announcements\n\nGet the inside view on the newest trends and game-changing updates in the polymer world.\n\n[Read more ][70]\n\n## Pioneering Progress Since Day One\n\nGet to know the people and passion behind our journey of growth and innovation.\n\n[Explore now ][71]\n\n## What’s new at Ester\n\nStay tuned for the latest updates and smart innovations.\n\n[Read more ][72]\nProduct portfolio Result Announcements Our history Ester updates\n\n## Business verticals\n\n[Explore ][73]\n\n## Polyester films\n\nPolyester films, made from polyethene terephthalate (PET), are widely used for their strength,\ntransparency, and resistance to moisture and chemicals. Commonly found in packaging, insulation, and\nelectronics, offering durability and flexibilit"}}, "page_text": "[ [Ester Logo] ][1] × ### Search by Page Name Search * [About us][2] ### About us For over 40 years, Ester Industries Limited has been dedicated to driving customer satisfaction through continuous innovation, advanced development, and trusted partnerships. * [Overview][3] * [Mission Vision][4] * [Research & Development][5] * [Awards & Certifications][6] * [Leadership team][7] * [Business Verticals][8] ### Business Verticals Innovative material solutions powering industries worldwide – from high-performance packaging films to sustainable recycled polymers and specialty chemical formulations. [Overview ][9] * [Overview][10] * [Polyester Films][11] * [Recycling Solutions][12] * [Speciality Solutions][13] * [Lidding & Sealable Films][14] * [Barrier Films][15] * [PCR & Sustainable Films ][16] * [Decorative, Visual & Brand Enhancement Films][17] * [Label Films][18] * [Bottle Grade Chips][19] * [Film/Sheet Grade Chips][20] * [Textile Grade Chips][21] * [Textile & Industrial Polymers][22] * [LMC Solutions][23] * [Packaging Solutions][24] * [Thermoforming & Sheet Polymers][25] * [Masterbatch Solutions][26] * [Applications][27] ### Applications At Ester Industries, our advanced polyester films, specialty chemicals, and engineered polymer solutions are designed to meet the rigorous demands of diverse global industries. [Overview ][28] * [Overview][29] * [Food and Beverages][30] * [Home & Personal Care][31] * [Industrial Packaging][32] * [Textile Industry][33] * [Carpet Industry][34] * [Graphics, Printing and Security][35] * [Sustainability][36] * [Investors][37] ### Investors Delivering value through growth, innovation, and operational excellence. Track our performance, strategy, and long-term outlook. * [Financial Information][38] * [Committees of the board][39] * [Shareholding pattern][40] * [CSR][41] * [Board of Directors][42] * [Shareholder's information][43] * [Governance and regulatory information][44] * [Important update for shareholders][45] * [Investor queries][46] * [TDS on dividend ][47] * [IEPF][48] * [Codes and policies][49] * [Intimation to stock exchanges][50] * [Board meetings][51] * [General meetings][52] * [Annual return][53] * [ESOP][54] * [Institutional and analyst meeting][55] * [Related party transaction][56] * [Annual Secretarial Compliance Report][57] * [Scheme of arrangement][58] * [Corporate governance report][59] * [MOA and AOA][60] * [Disclosure under Reg 46 of SEBI LODR][61] * [Media][62] ### Media Catch latest updates from Ester’s innovations in films and specialty materials. Explore news, announcements, and industry insights. * [Events][63] * [Media center][64] * [Careers][65] ### Careers Build with a team driving innovation in specialty polymers and polyester films. Explore roles that grow your expertise and impact. * [Life @ Ester][66] * [Current Opening][67] [Search] × ### Search by Page Name Search [Contact Us][68] ## Discover a Complete Range of Ester Offerings Thoughtfully made products that fit seamlessly into your world [Explore now ][69] ## Catch Up with Our Latest Announcements Get the inside view on the newest trends and game-changing updates in the polymer world. [Read more ][70] ## Pioneering Progress Since Day One Get to know the people and passion behind our journey of growth and innovation. [Explore now ][71] ## What’s new at Ester Stay tuned for the latest updates and smart innovations. [Read more ][72] Product portfolio Result Announcements Our history Ester updates ## Business verticals [Explore ][73] ## Polyester films Polyester films, made from polyethene terephthalate (PET), are widely used for their strength, transparency, and resistance to moisture and chemicals. Commonly found in packaging, insulation, and electronics, offering durability and flexibility in various industrial applications. [Explore ][74] ## Recycling solutions rPET helps reduce plastic waste by reprocessing PET into new materials. Through our patented rPET technology, we do mechanical recycling of PET flakes to convert them into high quality rPET chips with quality as good as that of virgin chips. This sustainable approach supports the circular economy by giving PET a second life. [Explore ][75] ## Speciality solutions Specialty solutions are designed to meet the increasing demands of industries requiring high-performance materials for a range of applications. These versatile materials are essential for bonding, encapsulation, coating, additives, and compounding, serving key sectors such as textiles, packaging, carpets, food and beverages, aerospace, automotive, and electronics. [Explore ][76] 01 Polyester films 02 Recycling solutions 03 Speciality solutions ABOUT US # Customer Satisfaction through Innovation, Development, and Partnership Backed by 40+ years of industry expertise, Ester manufactures Polyester Films and Specialty Polymers. Polyester Films find applications primarily in flexible packaging, while Specialty Polymers cater to niche areas including rigid packaging, textiles, and more. We take pride in offering complete solutions to our customers, even for their most demanding needs. We also partner with our customers to derive a sustainable competitive advantage through customized development projects. Innovation and Sustainability are at the core of Ester’s endeavors and fundamental to its strategy and vision. Besides manufacturing world-class products and solutions, we also pay close attention to our activities towards protecting the environment, which is reflected not only in what we produce but also in how we produce. What sets Ester apart is not just the extent or distinction of its offering, it is the commitment demonstrated by its employees towards customers and their needs. While Ester is headquartered in the National Capital Region of India (Gurgaon), the company operates state-of-the-art manufacturing facilities at Khatima and Sitarganj (rPET) in Uttarakhand, along with a modern BOPET film manufacturing facility at Chandanvelly, Ranga Reddy district, Telangana (Hyderabad region). These facilities enable Ester to deliver high-quality Polyester Films, rPET and Specialty Polymer solutions to customers across diverse industries and markets. We have a global presence, supplying a large customer base in 50+ countries across Europe, the Americas, Africa, the Indian subcontinent, the Far East, Asia Pacific, and the Middle East. Through our manufacturing excellence, innovation-led approach, and customer-centric philosophy, we continue to create sustainable value for all stakeholders. ## 54+ ### Patents Backed by 54+ patents, across different jurisdictions, driving continuous innovation. ## 40+ ### Years of Expertise Delivering trust with over 40 years of industry expertise. ## 50+ ### Countries Serving global markets with exports to 50+ countries. ## 70+ ### Innovative Products Explore our portfolio of 70+ innovative products. ## 54+ ### Patents Backed by 54+ patents, across different jurisdictions, driving continuous innovation. ## 40+ ### Years of Expertise Delivering trust with over 40 years of industry expertise. ## 50+ ### Countries Serving global markets with exports to 50+ countries. ## 70+ ### Innovative Products Explore our portfolio of 70+ innovative products. ## Applications [Explore Applications][77] [Food and Beverages] Food & Beverages High-performance solutions designed for safe, compliant, and efficient food and beverage packaging. Food and Beverages [ ][78] [Home & Personal Care] Home & Personal Care Advanced solutions that support premium aesthetics, barrier performance, and reliable functionality. Home & Personal Care [ ][79] [Industrial Packaging] Industrial Packaging Durable, high-strength solutions that enhance protection and performance in industrial packaging applications. Industrial Packaging [ ][80] [Industrial Packaging] Textile Industry Innovative solutions enabling lightweight, resilient, and performance-driven textile applications. Textile Industry [ ][81] [Industrial Packaging] Carpet Industry Specialty solutions that enhance backing strength, durability, and performance in carpet manufacturing. Carpet Industry [ ][82] [Industrial Packaging] Graphics, Printing & Security High-clarity, dimensionally stable solutions tailored for vibrant printing, specialty graphics, and document applications. Graphics, Printing & Security [ ][83] Sustainability ## Committed to Walking the Path of a Sustainable Future We’re working toward a greener future through conscious action and continuous innovation. [Be part of a sustainable future today ][84] Sustainability Practices CSR Our Commitment to Our People [Collaborative Culture] Leadership Trust [Continuous Learning] Employee Value [Diversity & Inclusion] Fair Practices [Employee Well-Being] Workplace Pride [Sustainability Focus] Team Spirit Careers ## Join Team Ester Grow your career while learning about polymers and cutting-edge innovations in the world of materials science. [ Life@Ester ][85] [ Work With Us ][86] ## Your Strategic Partner for ## Sustainable Solutions ### Recognition & Milestones Celebrated innovations that set new benchmarks in the industry. ### Our Mission Leading the way in polymer innovation through integrated solutions. ### Social Responsibility Building business success with a focus on ethics, sustainability, and community impact. ### For Investors Committed to driving progress through innovation, sustainability, and global expansion. ## Hop into the world of Ester Get the scoop on our latest product drops, expert decor advice, and a daily lift of Ester positivity. To know more, follow us on Instagram. [ As HIPLEX 2026 comes to a close, we would like to [As HIPLEX 2026 comes to a close, we would like to thank everyone who visited the Ester Industries booth and made the event truly memorable. From meaningful conversations and valuable connections to insightful discussions on polyester, packaging and sustainable solutions, the four days were filled with opportunities to connect, collaborate and look ahead. Thank you for being a part of our HIPLEX journey. We look forward to taking these conversations forward. #HIPLEX2026 #HIPLEX #EsterIndustries #SpecialityPolymers #Sustainability] ][87] [ A look back at Day 2 at HIPLEX Expo! From engagin [A look back at Day 2 at HIPLEX Expo! From engaging conversations to valuable connections, Day 2 was filled with insightful discussions on the future of polyester, packaging and sustainable solutions. Here are a few moments from the day, where innovation met collaboration. 📍 Hall 4 | Stand No. 4D-04 If you’re at HIPLEX today, we’d love to connect. Visit us and explore our range of speciality polymers and sustainable solutions. #HIPLEX2026 #HIPLEX #EsterIndustries #SpecialityPolymers #Sustainability] ][88] [ We're live at HIPLEX 2026! Come meet the Ester te [We're live at HIPLEX 2026! Come meet the Ester team at Stall 4D-04 and discover our innovative Polyester Film and rPET solutions. We look forward to connecting, exchanging ideas, and exploring new opportunities with customers, partners, and industry peers over the next four days. #HIPLEX2026 #EsterIndustries #PolyesterFilms #rPET #SustainablePackaging] ][89] [ Just 1 day to go! The wait is almost over. Tomorr [Just 1 day to go! The wait is almost over. Tomorrow, we'll be at HIPLEX 2026, showcasing Ester's innovative Polyester Film and rPET solutions designed to support more sustainable, high-performance packaging. Visit us to explore material innovations, discuss evolving industry needs, and discover opportunities to collaborate. See you tomorrow at HIPLEX 2026! #HIPLEX2026 #PolyesterFilms #rPET #SustainablePackaging #PackagingInnovation] ][90] [ We're pleased to share that Vai", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "Ester Industries Ltd. — channel participant (seed_file). Verify: Produces BOPET films used in flexible packaging. | Brand / Marketer; web_confirmed_flex_pack_player | Polyester Films (BOPET); Specialty Polymers; Recycling Solutions (rPET); Engineering Plastic Compounds | Ester EX Retort Film; Ester XU (PA66) E