 [ Operational Efficiency ][48] * [ OT Cybersecurity ][49] * [ Life Safety & Security ][50] * [ Workforce Excellence ][51] [ Businesses ][52] * [ Building Automation ][53] * [ Industrial Automation ][54] * [ Process Automation & Technology ][55] [ View All Solutions → ][56] Honeywell Forge AI-Powered, enterprise-level outcomes. [Explore Honeywell Forge][57] [Vertical abstract red background with gradient tones and glowing accents, suitable for corporate visuals, digital assets, and design layouts. ] * * Americas * * [Brazil - Portuguese ][58] * * [Canada - English ][59] * [Canada - French ][60] * * [Mexico - Spanish ][61] * * [United States - English ][62] * APAC * * [Australia - English ][63] * * [Japan - Japanese][64] * * [Malaysia - English ][65] * * [Republic of Korea - Korean][66] * * [Singapore - English ][67] * Europe * * [Czech Republic - Czech][68] * * [Denmark - English ][69] * * [France - French ][70] * * [Germany - German][71] * * [Italy - Italian][72] * * [Netherlands - Dutch][73] * [Netherlands - English ][74] * * [Poland - Polish][75] * * [Romania - Romanian][76] * [Romania - English ][77] * * [Spain - English ][78] * [Spain - Spanish ][79] * * [United Kingdom - English ][80] * META * * [Saudi Arabia - Arabic][81] * [Saudi Arabia - English ][82] * * [Turkey - English ][83] * [Turkey - Turkish][84] * * [United Arab Emirates - Arabic][85] * [United Arab Emirates - English ][86] * India * * [India - English ][87] * China * * [China - Chinese ][88] * [Contact][89] * [Support][90] You are browsing the product catalog for You are viewing the overview and resources for [Sign in][91] to view parts associated with your account 01 [A striking modern skyscraper showcases a geometric design and reflective glass, rising high in the city skyline.] ## Connections that drive true transformation. Real progress happens when the right things come together: expertise and data, insights and human ingenuity, the physical and the digital. At Honeywell Technologies, we make these connections real, turning isolated intelligence into coordinated action. [Multiple gas storage tanks are lined up, showcasing safety ladders and railings for secure access.] ## Expertise earned over a century. For over a century, we’ve tackled the most pressing challenges in industries where failure has real consequences: In refineries, hospitals, data centers, buildings and manufacturing plants. [A construction worker wearing a safety vest and helmet ascends a spiral staircase, emphasizing safety on site.] ## Intelligence set in motion. Across the globe, companies run their most critical operations on our technologies. Today, we harness the intelligence inside them, turning individual assets into synchronized systems that continuously learn, adapt — and amplify human potential. [Honeywell C300 product image] ## Autonomy grounded in partnership. Autonomy isn't a switch we flip. It's a journey taken together. We build on the control systems customers already rely on, adding intelligence that learns from their operations, proposes improvements, and acts only with their approval. ## Connections that drive true transformation. Real progress happens when the right things come together: expertise and data, insights and human ingenuity, the physical and the digital. At Honeywell Technologies, we make these connections real, turning isolated intelligence into coordinated action. ## Expertise earned over a century. For over a century, we’ve tackled the most pressing challenges in industries where failure has real consequences: In refineries, hospitals, data centers, buildings and manufacturing plants. ## Intelligence set in motion. Across the globe, companies run their most critical operations on our technologies. Today, we harness the intelligence inside them, turning individual assets into synchronized systems that continuously learn, adapt — and amplify human potential. ## Autonomy grounded in partnership. Autonomy isn't a switch we flip. It's a journey taken together. We build on the control systems customers already rely on, adding intelligence that learns from their operations, proposes improvements, and acts only with their approval. Industries ### Tangible results for operations where failure is never an option. [ Buildings ][92] [ Chemicals & Materials ][93] [ Data Centers ][94] [ Healthcare ][95] [ Heavy Industry ][96] [ Hospitality ][97] [ Life Sciences ][98] [ LNG ][99] [ Low-Carbon Energy ][100] [ Manufacturing ][101] [ Oil & Gas ][102] [ Utilities ][103] [ Back to Brand ][104] Outcomes ## Outcomes Designed to Drive Autonomy [ [Professional team members discuss technical data on multiple monitors within a modern corporate industrial control facility.] ### Asset Management Improve performance and value for critical assets throughout their lifecycle ][105] [ [Solar Panels on Industrial Rooftop Supporting Clean Energy Innovation] ### Energy Innovation Innovation for the next era of energy ][106] [ [A team of engineers collaborates in a high-tech Honeywell control room, analyzing complex industrial data displays on a multi-screen workstation.] ### Operational Efficiency Turn data into decisions that drive results ][107] [ [A close-up view of server racks in a data center, featuring blue illuminated lights and a sleek design.] ### OT Cybersecurity Enhance the cyber posture of operations ][108] [ [A worker stands on a platform, inspecting equipment in an industrial space filled with pipes and machinery.] ### Safety & Security Safety and security that work together ][109] [ [An industrial operator in safety gear communicates via two-way radio while inspecting piping at a refinery facility.] ### Workforce Excellence Empower every worker to excel ][110] 01 - 03 / 09 Customer Stories ## See our Solutions in Action [A technician assembles electronic components, showcasing precision in a manufacturing environment filled with parts.] [A technician assembles electronic components, showcasing precision in a manufacturing environment filled with parts.] ## Automating Quality Infrastructure with TrackWise Digital Learn how two companies, Biovac and Inspiration Healthcare Group modernized their quality control work flows with Honeywell's Trackwise Digital. [ View Customer Story ][111] [A stunning aerial shot of a modern industrial facility, featuring intricate machinery and vibrant neon blue lighting.] [A stunning aerial shot of a modern industrial facility, featuring intricate machinery and vibrant neon blue lighting.] ## Strengthening a legacy refinery's connected future Motor Oil partnered with Honeywell to design an OT cybersecurity approach for a complex refinery environment, built over five decades. [ View Customer Story ][112] [Exterior of modern building with glass facade entrance, paved walkway, and illuminated aruba.it sign on the wall.] [Exterior of modern building with glass facade entrance, paved walkway, and illuminated aruba.it sign on the wall.] ## Aruba Global Cloud Data Center Honeywell’s integrated fire and security solution helps ensure the integrity of Italy’s largest data center. [ View Customer Story ][113] Previous slide Next slide Pause slideshow Insights & News ### Innovation, Insights and News * [ [Honeywell Technologies logo in white centered on a red gradient background with stylized graphic elements.] Press Release ### Honeywell Technologies Launches As Independent, Pure-Play Automation Company Following ### Completion of Honeywell Aerospace Spin-Off Marks completion of Honeywell’s plan to create three independent, focused market leaders. ][114] * [ [Aerial view of illuminated storage tanks at an industrial petrochemical facility at dusk.] Press Release ### Honeywell and MIT Find Digital Technologies can Help Increase Energy Supply, Reduce Energy ### Production Cost by Tens of Billions Annually Honeywell analysis and MIT Center for Sustainability Science and Strategy modeling project annual savings of up to $225 billion in production costs for oil-based fuels, $80 billion in LNG alone, by 2050, using AI-enabled technologies. ][115] * [ [A Notifier by Honeywell fire alarm control panel displaying a normal status on a white wall panel with various safety switches and indicators.] Press Release ### Honeywell Expands Fire Portfolio with Advanced Smoke Control and Connected Life Safety ### Innovations Honeywell announced a major expansion of its fire and life safety portfolio, introducing the next generation of smoke control capabilities within its NOTIFIER INSPIRE platform alongside a suite of new cloud-connected innovations. ][116] * [ [Large fleet of airplanes parked in line on an airport runway during a vibrant sunset, showcasing aviation scale and symmetry.] Press Release ### Honeywell Board of Directors Approves Spin-Off of Honeywell Aerospace Honeywell announced that its Board of Directors has formally approved the planned spin-off of Honeywell Aerospace. ][117] * [ [A senior couple stands at a resort reception desk with luggage, interacting with a staff member in a warm, naturally lit tropical lobby.] Press Release ### Honeywell Launches New Hospitality Solutions to Power the Connected Hotel Honeywell launched a new generation of connected hospitality solutions designed to bring greater visibility, control and efficiency across hotel operations while elevating the guest experience. ][118] * [ [honeywell-uop-ecofining-", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "Honeywell International Inc. (Aclar / barrier films) — channel participant (seed_file). Verify: Produces Aclar barrier films used in pharmaceutical flexible packaging. | Brand / Marketer; web_confirmed_flex_pack_player | Aclar barrier films; moisture barrier protection; thickness gauges; thermoforming capabilities | Aclar | United States | Charlotte, NC, USA", "role_description": "Brand / Marketer", "key_products": "Aclar barrier films; moisture barrier protection; thickness gauges; thermoforming capabilities"}}, "X Score": "80", "Y Score": "75", "Overall Sc