ls][148]\n  * [Sustainable label films][149]\n"}}, "page_text": "[[Sustainable Packaging Solutions - Klöckner Pentaplast]][1] [language select][EN][2][FR][3] * [About us ][4] * [Innovation][5] * [Excellence][6] * [Our history][7] * [60 years of kp][8] * [CEO and management team][9] * [Risk management systems][10] * [Certifications][11] * [Governance and ethics][12] * [Tax Strategy][13] * [Sustainability][14] * [Our Strategy][15] * [Our 2021-2025 Strategy][16] * [Reports and disclosure][17] * [External Engagement][18] * [Blog][19] * [News and events][20] * [Events calendar][21] * [Our stories][22] * [Press releases][23] * [Careers][24] * [Recruitment Pledge][25] * [Application tips][26] * [Interview tips][27] * [Recruitment process][28] * [Frequently asked questions][29] * [Apprenticeship][30] * [Investors][31] * [Investor Registration][32] * [Financial results][33] * [Investor information][34] * [Debt information][35] * [Company presentation][36] * [Contact us][37] * [Contact us][38] * [Our locations][39] [[search]][40] * [About us][41] * [Innovation][42] * [Excellence][43] * [Our history][44] * [60 years of kp][45] * [CEO and management team][46] * [Risk management systems][47] * [Certifications][48] * [Governance and ethics][49] * [Tax Strategy][50] * [Sustainability][51] * [Our Strategy][52] * [Our 2021-2025 Strategy][53] * [Reports and disclosure][54] * [External Engagement][55] * [Blog][56] * [News and events][57] * [Events calendar][58] * [Our stories][59] * [Press releases][60] * [Careers][61] * [Recruitment Pledge][62] * [Application tips][63] * [Interview tips][64] * [Recruitment process][65] * [Frequently asked questions][66] * [Apprenticeship][67] * [Investors][68] * [Investor Registration][69] * [Financial results][70] * [Investor information][71] * [Debt information][72] * [Company presentation][73] * [Contact us][74] * [Contact us][75] * [Our locations][76] * Our products * [Pharma and nutraceutical][77] * [Pharmaceutical packaging films][78] * [Sustainable rigid films][79] * [Barrier rigid films][80] * [Mono rigid films][81] * [Specialty rigid films][82] * [BlisterPro services][83] * [Nutraceutical packaging films][84] * [kpEnhance RM1][85] * [kpEnhance][86] * [kpEnhance QRF][87] * [Medical device][88] * [Sustainable rigid films][89] * [Mono rigid films][90] * [Specialty rigid films][91] * [Consumer packaging][92] * [General thermoforming films][93] * [Static control films][94] * [PCR films for sustainability][95] * [Speciality films][96] * [Food packaging][97] * [By pack type][98] * [By market][99] * [By material][100] * [By sustainable solution][101] * [Innovation][102] * [Labels][103] * [Sustainable label films][104] * [Shrink sleeves][105] * [Pressure - Sensitive Labels][106] * [Roll sleeves][107] * [Capsules][108] * [Battery][109] * [Cards and graphics][110] * [Cards][111] * [Sustainable Card Films][112] * [Card Core][113] * [Card Overlay][114] * [Foil][115] * [Graphics][116] * [Sustainable Films][117] * [Print films][118] * [Box films][119] * [Stationery films][120] * [Home, building and construction][121] * [Construction][122] * [Tape films][123] * [Cooling tower films][124] * [Decorative films][125] * [Color Concept][126] * [2D][127] * [3D][128] * [Flooring films][129] * [Pharma and nutraceutical][130] * [Pharmaceutical packaging films][131] * [Nutraceutical packaging films][132] * [Medical device][133] * [Sustainable rigid films][134] * [Mono rigid films][135] * [Specialty rigid films][136] * [Consumer packaging][137] * [General thermoforming films][138] * [Static control films][139] * [PCR films for sustainability][140] * [Speciality films][141] * [Food packaging][142] * [By pack type][143] * [By market][144] * [By material][145] * [By sustainable solution][146] * [Innovation][147] * [Labels][148] * [Sustainable label films][149] * [Shrink sleeves][150] * [Pressure - Sensitive Labels][151] * [Roll sleeves][152] * [Capsules][153] * [Battery][154] * [Cards and graphics][155] * [Cards][156] * [Graphics][157] * [Home, building and construction][158] * [Construction][159] * [Tape films][160] * [Cooling tower films][161] * [Decorative films][162] * [Flooring films][163] # Sustainable packaging solutions ## We are a global leader in recycled content products and high-barrier protective packaging. ## Sustainable packaging solutions ## We are a global leader in recycled content products and high-barrier protective packaging. [Contact us][164] [Launch Recite Me assistive technology] * [ Home ][165] * Klöckner Pentaplast [ [Future-focused 2027 roadmap highlighting sustainable plastic packaging development, circular economy goals, and business growth] INSIGHTS ### Why recyclability is becoming a commercial imperative for plastic packaging 24 Jul 2026 As the UK packaging industry prepares for the introduction of Recyclability Assessment Methodology (RAM) 2027, packaging design is increasingly becoming a commercial issue as much as a sustainability one. Read more Read more ][166] [ [Person pointing at a blister pack of pills on a clipboard during a medical consultation.] INSIGHTS ### Understanding PPWR: What It means for Pharmaceutical & Medical Device packaging 24 Jun 2026 Sustainability expectations across Europe are evolving rapidly, and one of the most significant developments impacting the packaging industry is the EU Packaging and Packaging Waste Regulation (PPWR). Read more Read more ][167] [ [EPR and the US market overview highlighting packaging compliance, recycling policies, and producer responsibility legislation] INSIGHTS ### Designing for the future: EPR, recyclability, and packaging performance in the US 21 Jul 2026 Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR) is no longer a future consideration in the United States. It is simply reality. Read more Read more ][168] ## What we do We innovate, design and manufacture for sustainable solutions that our customers use to package and protect products in daily situations around the globe such as [blister packaging][169] for pharmaceutical products. And we understand our obligation and responsibility to champion a circular economy where plastics are a source of valuable raw material, especially in the [medical device packaging][170] industry. [[Pharma and medical] ## Pharma and medical ][171] [[Consumer packaging] ## Consumer packaging ][172] [[Food packaging] ## Food Packaging ][173] [[Labels] ## Labels ][174] [[Cards and graphics] ## Cards and graphics ][175] [[Home, building and construction] ## Home, building and construction ][176] ## Our innovations [ [Our Sustainability Report] Sustainability Report ### Our Sustainability Report Our Investing in Better sustainability report is here. We have continued to strive for a sustainable future, making us stronger, and allowing the business to make substantial progress against our three objectives: Close the Loop, Work Smarter and Act Responsibly. Read more Read more ][177] [ [eco-friendly secure medical devices packaging] New Product ### kpNext® MDR1 sustainable medical device films kpNext^{®} MDR1 is an advanced copolyester film that offers medical device manufacturers the same best-in-class performance, clarity, and protection as traditional packaging films with the added benefit of being 100% compatible with the #1 PET recycling stream. kpNext® MDR1 kpNext® MDR1 ][178] [ [Picture showing a transparent PET food packaging tray with chicken inside] New Product ### kp Elite® Nova kp Elite® Nova is the lightest MAP tray design in its class, helping customers reduce total cost of ownership without sacrificing quality. Its unique ribbing design ensures strength and maintains barrier properties. kp Elite® Nova kp Elite® Nova ][179] ## Our locations [Page Title] ## Your career at kp. Want to join our team? Here at kp, we are actively seeking enthusiastic, motivated, and talented individuals to play a vital role in shaping our future. Do you see yourself thriving in a dynamic environment, where you can maximise your potential? We invite you to explore the exciting opportunities we offer. Join our team today! Find out more and apply via our careers page. [Visit our careers page][180] ## Your career at kp. Want to join our team? [[A man wearing an helmet and working in production site]][181] Careers ## Sustainability at kp [[Sustainability at kp]][182] ## Sustainability at kp We believe in the sustainable protection of everyday needs. It’s why we do what we do; it’s why we exist. Our purpose is to be the leader in sustainable rigid and flexible plastic solutions that improve lives, communities and health, while protecting the planet. [Sustainability][183] [ ### Careers at kp Here at kp, we are actively seeking enthusiastic, motivated, and talented individuals to play a vital role in shaping our future. Do you see yourself thriving in a dynamic environment, where you can maximise your potential? Find out more and apply via our careers page. Careers Careers ][184] [ ### For investors Visit our investor relations pages for financial results, company presentations and contact details. Investors Investors ][185] [ ### Who we are We are a plastics manufacturer purpose driven to deliver the sustainable protection of everyday needs. Founded in 1965, we have 27 plants in 16 countries, and employ over 5,000 people, committed to serving customers worldwide. About us About us ][186] ## News [ July 16, 2026 Dutch TV programme explores sustainable food packaging at Klöckner Pentaplast site Klöckner Pentaplast (kp) Food Packaging is featured in a recent episode of the Dutch television programme Doe Maar Duurzaam ('Just Be Sustainable'), which focuses on sustainability challenges and developments across industry. ][187] [ June 24, 2026 Klöckner Pentaplast expands kp Infinity® range with recyclable trays designed to help reduce food and packaging waste Klöckner Pentaplast has expanded its kp Infinity® portfolio with the launch of a new fruit tray range designed specifically for packed fresh fruit. ][188] [ June 22, 2026 Klöckner Pentaplast announces leadership transition Klöckner Pentaplast today announced that Michael Zacka, a current member of the Company's Board of Directors, has been appointed Interim Chief Executive Officer, effective June 22, 2026. ][189] [Press releases][190] ## Upcoming events Find us at these upcoming trade shows and fairs 23-24 September 2026 Medical Technology Ireland 6-8 October 2026 CPhI Milan 2026 7-9 November 2026 Süffa 2026 16-19 November 2026 Compamed [Events calendar][191] Follow us * [[social media icon]][192] * [[social media icon]][193] * [[social media icon]][194] * [[social media icon]][195] Contact us Klöckner Pentaplast Group Capital House, 4th Floor, 25 Chapel Street London NW1 5DH United Kingdom [Contact information][196] Legal * [Legal disclosure][197] * [Terms and conditions of use][198] * [Privacy policy][199] * [Terms of delivery and payment][200] * [Terms of purchase][201] * [Modern Slavery Act Transparency Statement][202] * [kp Turkey: Bilgi Toplumu Hizmetleri][203] * [kpA Health Insurance-Machine Readable Files][204] * [Cookie Settings][205] Copyright® Klöckner Pentaplast 2026 | kp and other kp marks are registered or proprietary marks of Klöckner Pentaplast [1]: https://www.kpfilms.com/en/ [2]: https://www.kpfilms.com/en/ [3]: https://www.kpfilms.com/fr/ [4]: https://www.kpfilms.com/en/about-us/ [5]: /en/about-us/innovation.php [6]: /en/about-us/excellence.php [7]: /en/about-us/our-history.php [8]: /en/about-us/60-years-of-kp/ [9]: /en/about-us/ceo-management-team.php [10]: /en/about-us/risk-management-systems.php [11]: /en/about-us/Certifications.php [12]: /en/about-us/governance-ethics.php [13]: /en/about-us/tax-strategy.php [14]: https://www.kpfilms.com/en", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "Klöckner Pentaplast Group — channel participant (seed_file). Verify: Manufacturer of films for flexible packaging applications. | Brand / Marketer; web_confirmed_flex_pack_player | Pharmaceutical and nutraceutical blister packs; Medical device films; Food packaging trays; Consumer packaging wraps; Labels and graphics; Building and construction films | United Kingdom; Germany; United States; Switzerland; India | Gordonsville, Virginia, USA, Kl", "role_description": "Brand / Marketer", "key_products": "Pharmaceutical and nutraceutical blister packs; Medical device films; Food packaging trays; Consumer packaging wraps; Labels and graphics; Building and construction films"}}, "X Score": "79", "Y Score": "78", "Overall Score": "78", "Industry Category": "Others / Packaging", "Quadrant": "Leaders"}, {"Company": "Uflex Ltd.", "Website": "https://www.uflexltd.com", "Founded": "1985", "Headquarters": "India", "Continent / Geography": "APAC(India)", "Operational Presence": "India; United Arab Emirates; United States; Mexico; Egypt; Poland", "Ownership": "Public", "Employees": "12000", "Core Categories": "Flexible packaging films, pouches, laminates, and packaging machinery", "Specialty Focus": "One of the largest flexible packaging companies globally, producing films, pouches, and laminates.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Brand / Marketer", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "", "Email": "enquiry@uflexltd.com", "LinkedIn": "https://www.linkedin.com/company/uflex-ltd", "Office No.": "+91 120 4012345", "Country Code": "IN", "Region Code": "APAC", "Summary": "Uflex Ltd. — channel participant (chatgpt_recall). Verify: Major flexible packaging manufacturer producing films, pouches, and laminates.", "Data Sources": "google_ai; openai_sdk_residual", "_crawl": {"founded_year": 1985}, "Data Confidence": "High", "Quality Score": "4", "commercial_role": "Brand / Marketer", "verify_confidence": "100", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "uflexltd.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "uflexltd.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "×\n\n[UFlex Limited is named a Top Employer 2026 in India]\nToggle navigation [Pay online][1]\n[[UFlex Ltd]][2]\n[Pay online][3]\n* [Home][4]\n* [About us][5]\n  * [Company profile][6]\n  * [Vision & mission][7]\n  * [Values][8]\n  * [CMD's profile][9]\n  * [Board of directors][10]\n  * [Board committees][11]\n  * [Key management][12]\n  * [Subsidiaries & associates][13]\n  * [Milestones][14]\n* [Our businesses][15]\n  * [Packaging films][16]\n  * [Flexible packaging][17]\n  * [Aseptic packaging][18]\n  * [Chemicals][19]\n  * [Holography][20]\n  * [Engineering][21]\n  * [Printing cylinders][22]\n* [Investors][23]\n  * Investor relations\n    * [Investor Presentations & Updates][24]\n    * [Governance structure][25]\n    * [Quarterly earnings reports][26]\n    * [Grievance redressal][27]\n    * [Contact details of KMPs ][28]\n    * [Credit ratings][29]\n    * [Shareholders communication][30]\n    * [Financials][31]\n    * [Stock price data][32]\n    * [Company release][33]\n    * [Extract of annual return][34]\n    * [Business responsibility report][35]\n    * [Secretarial compliance report][36]\n    * [Memorandum & Articles of Association][37]\n  * Communication kit\n    * [Policies][38]\n    * [New Announcements ][39]\n    * [Shareholding pattern][40]\n    * [Unpaid / unclaimed dividend][41]\n    * [Transfer of shares to IEPF][42]\n    * [Registrar][43]\n    * [Compliance reports][44]\n    * [Reconciliation of Share Capital Audit Report][45]\n* [Sustainability][46]\n  * [Sustainability practices][47]\n  * [Social sustainability][48]\n  * [Environmental sustainability][49]\n* Hall of fame\n  * [Awards][50]\n  * [Recognition / accreditation][51]\n* Media centre\n  * [Press coverage][52]\n  * [Press release][53]\n  * Media gallery\n    * [Video gallery][54]\n    * [Photo gallery][55]\n  * [Press contact][56]\n  * [Visit our blog][57]\n* Careers\n  * [Why UFlex?][58]\n  * [Learning & development][59]\n  * [Choose your path][60]\n  * [Vox populi][61]\n  * [Because you matter][62]\n  * [UFlex program][63]\n  * [Current openings][64]\n* [Contact us][65]\n  * [Global presence][66]\n  * [Contact form][67]\n[ [One-Stop-Shop for Flexible Packaging Solutions] ][68]\n[ [Packaging Films Business] ][69]\n[ [Chemicals Business] ][70]\n[ [Aseptic Liquid Packaging Business] ][71]\n[ [Holography Business] ][72]\n[ [Flexible Packaging Business] ][73]\n[ [Printing Cylinders Business] ][74]\n[ [Engineering Business] ][75]\n[ [Flexible Packaging Business] ][76]\n[ [Flexible Packaging Business] ][77]\n[ [Businesses Product Portfolio] ][78]\n[ [Manufacturing Facilities at Strategic Locations] ][79]\n\nAnnouncement\n\n**1.** \"Special Window for Re-lodgement of Transfer Requests of Physical Shares” [Click here][80]\nfor more details.     2. “Saksham Niveshak – A 100 Day Drive to Facilitate Dividend Claims and KYC\nUpdates by IEPFA” [Click here][81] for more details.\n\n# About us\n\nUFlex is India’s largest multinational flexible packaging and solutions company. Our packaging\nexcellence has positioned us as a preferred packaging solutions company amongst global brands\nworldwide. Over the last three decades, we have earned an irreproachable reputation by defining the\ncontours of the packaging industry in India and overseas. As a leading name among packaging\nsolutions companies, we assist our customers by offering world-class packaging solutions that\npreserve freshness and extend shelf-life of food and other packed products. Owing to our qualitative\napproach, we are recognized as a pre-eminent player amongst flexible packaging companies in India.\nSince our inception in 1985, we have turned into a multi-billion company by focusing on trust, value\ncreation for customers, quality innovation and customer satisfaction.\n\n[Read More][82]\n\n \n\n[About us] [[UFlex Limited Corporate Video]][83]\n\n**Trust:** We ensure trust remains at the core at every point of service and customer interaction.\nWe take stringent steps to provide consistent quality to earn our customer's faith.\n\n**Quality Innovation:**We embrace quality innovation in our work style. Our efforts ar"}}, "page_text": "× [UFlex Limited is named a Top Employer 2026 in India] Toggle navigation [Pay online][1] [[UFlex Ltd]][2] [Pay online][3] * [Home][4] * [About us][5] * [Company profile][6] * [Vision & mission][7] * [Values][8] * [CMD's profile][9] * [Board of directors][10] * [Board committees][11] * [Key management][12] * [Subsidiaries & associates][13] * [Milestones][14] * [Our businesses][15] * [Packaging films][16] * [Flexible packaging][17] * [Aseptic packaging][18] * [Chemicals][19] * [Holography][20] * [Engineering][21] * [Printing cylinders][22] * [Investors][23] * Investor relations * [Investor Presentations & Updates][24] * [Governance structure][25] * [Quarterly earnings reports][26] * [Grievance redressal][27] * [Contact details of KMPs ][28] * [Credit ratings][29] * [Shareholders communication][30] * [Financials][31] * [Stock price data][32] * [Company release][33] * [Extract of annual return][34] * [Business responsibility report][35] * [Secretarial compliance report][36] * [Memorandum & Articles of Association][37] * Communication kit * [Policies][38] * [New Announcements ][39] * [Shareholding pattern][40] * [Unpaid / unclaimed dividend][41] * [Transfer of shares to IEPF][42] * [Registrar][43] * [Compliance reports][44] * [Reconciliation of Share Capital Audit Report][45] * [Sustainability][46] * [Sustainability practices][47] * [Social sustainability][48] * [Environmental sustainability][49] * Hall of fame * [Awards][50] * [Recognition / accreditation][51] * Media centre * [Press coverage][52] * [Press release][53] * Media gallery * [Video gallery][54] * [Photo gallery][55] * [Press contact][56] * [Visit our blog][57] * Careers * [Why UFlex?][58] * [Learning & development][59] * [Choose your path][60] * [Vox populi][61] * [Because you matter][62] * [UFlex program][63] * [Current openings][64] * [Contact us][65] * [Global presence][66] * [Contact form][67] [ [One-Stop-Shop for Flexible Packaging Solutions] ][68] [ [Packaging Films Business] ][69] [ [Chemicals Business] ][70] [ [Aseptic Liquid Packaging Business] ][71] [ [Holography Business] ][72] [ [Flexible Packaging Business] ][73] [ [Printing Cylinders Business] ][74] [ [Engineering Business] ][75] [ [Flexible Packaging Business] ][76] [ [Flexible Packaging Business] ][77] [ [Businesses Product Portfolio] ][78] [ [Manufacturing Facilities at Strategic Locations] ][79] Announcement **1.** \"Special Window for Re-lodgement of Transfer Requests of Physical Shares” [Click here][80] for more details. 2. “Saksham Niveshak – A 100 Day Drive to Facilitate Dividend Claims and KYC Updates by IEPFA” [Click here][81] for more details. # About us UFlex is India’s largest multinational flexible packaging and solutions company. Our packaging excellence has positioned us as a preferred packaging solutions company amongst global brands worldwide. Over the last three decades, we have earned an irreproachable reputation by defining the contours of the packaging industry in India and overseas. As a leading name among packaging solutions companies, we assist our customers by offering world-class packaging solutions that preserve freshness and extend shelf-life of food and other packed products. Owing to our qualitative approach, we are recognized as a pre-eminent player amongst flexible packaging companies in India. Since our inception in 1985, we have turned into a multi-billion company by focusing on trust, value creation for customers, quality innovation and customer satisfaction. [Read More][82] [About us] [[UFlex Limited Corporate Video]][83] **Trust:** We ensure trust remains at the core at every point of service and customer interaction. We take stringent steps to provide consistent quality to earn our customer's faith. **Quality Innovation:**We embrace quality innovation in our work style. Our efforts are aligned towards developing responsible packaging solutions that meet the customer’s business goals. We are dedicated to revolutionising food packaging sentiment in India and abroad with our value-added innovations. **Value creation for customers:** We strive to persistently work towards developing leading-edge packaging designs to provide additional value to our customer's products. Whether it is food packaging or manufacturing packaging applications for other sectors, we excel by creating value for customers at every step. Our expertise in food packaging has placed us as the most preferred food packaging manufacturers in India. **Customer Satisfaction:**We believe in sharing long-lasting relationships with our customers. At all times, we make sure not to lose sight for minute details for common good. With a belief in manufacturing and providing cutting-edge packaging solutions, we have grown from strength to strength. We have an extensive range of manufacturing capacity of packaging films, flexible packaging, printing, and other value-added packaging applications that cater to our clients spread across 140 countries. We enjoy a formidable market presence, thereby becoming India’s largest flexible packaging manufacturer and one of the most reliable **flexible packaging companies in India.** Our commitment to the industry is visible in our all-out efforts to provide technical know-how and thereby establish thought leadership. With more than thirty years of experience in polymer technology, we have mastered flexible packaging solutions that meet our client's flexible packaging requirements. [Read Less][84][View More][85] ### Our businesses [Packaging Films Business] ##### Packaging films UFlex is India’s largest end to end flexible packaging solutions company serving as a one stop shop for all flexible packaging needs. [VIEW MORE][86] [Chemicals Business] ##### Chemicals UFlex’s Chemicals Business is a leading manufacturer of Liquid Inks, Adhesives and Speciality Coatings. [VIEW MORE][87] [Aseptic Liquid Packaging Business] ##### Aseptic liquid packaging Asepto is the Aseptic Liquid Packaging Brand from the House of UFlex Limited. [VIEW MORE][88] [Holography Business] ##### Holography UFlex is one of the world’s leading organizations providing brand protection and anti-counterfeiting solutions to its customers. [VIEW MORE][89] [Flexible Packaging Business] ##### Flexible packaging UFlex is the largest Flexible Packaging Exporter with manufacturing capacity of over 80000 TPA. [VIEW MORE][90] [Cylinders Business] ##### Printing cylinders UFlex Printing Cylinders Business has a State-of-the-art manufacturing facility for producing Rotogravure Cylinders, Flexo Plates & Sleeves [VIEW MORE][91] [Engineering Business] ##### Engineering Engineering Business of UFlex has grown to be the manufacturing major of top of the line packaging, printing and allied machines [VIEW MORE][92] ### Investors UFlex is a leading Indian Multinational focusing on innovation to create differentiation, proximity to customers and holistic end-to-end flexible packaging solutions. All efforts at the organization are aimed at augmenting the shareholders’ value. [View More][93] ### New innovation [Up to 100% PCR Film ‘Asclepius™’] #### [ Asclepius™ (Upto 100% PCR Film)][94] UFlex’ upto 100% PCR polymer content BOPET film offers substantial reduction in carbon footprint and comes with higher sustainability levels and significantly lower net energy requirement for production when compared to virgin BOPET grades. The film is marketed under the brand name Ascelpius™. [Film for ISRO] #### [Satellite Thermal Insulation Film for ISRO][95] UFlex developed specialised Satellite Thermal Radiation Insulation Film for Indian Space Programme by Indian Space Research Organization (ISRO). [RELAM 250] #### [RELAM 250 (MLP Recycling Machine)][96] The RELAM250 machine is designed to recycle industrial plastic flexible waste into granulated products that can be used for various economically valuable moulded products. RELAM 250 offers ease of handling of any combination or mixture of multi layered plastic without the need for separation. [4D Bags with Handle] #### [4D Bags (Re-closable with Handle ) ][97] UFlex’ 4D bags are brick shaped bags on all sides with a handle. UFlex’ 4D Bags re-closable and can stand or lie on its belly. The innovative 4D bags combine the stand-ability and shelf prominence rigid with functionality of flexible packaging. It is an ideal packaging solution for granular products like Rice, Coffee, Tea, Detergents, Pet food etc. [Printing of MICR Instruments] #### [Printing of MICR Instruments (IBA Certified Partner)][98] MICR, (Magnetic Ink Character Recognition) instruments requires special printing system with overt and covert features for bank cheques, legal tenders and various other negotiable documents. UFlex is Indian Banks’ Association (IBA) certified partner for printing of MICR instruments. [Kraftika By Flexitube] #### [Kraftika (Eco-friendly Paper tube with Reduced Plastic)][99] Kraftika is an Eco-friendly Paper based tube that involves replacing of plastic with a virgin kraft paper by upto 70% thereby reducing plastic input at source. KRAFTIKA is best suited for packaging of Oral Care, Cosmetics including Face Wash, gets, cream etc. [Flexgreen Inline Gloss Coating – HRK9542] #### [HRK9542 (Flexgreen Inline Gloss Coating)][100] HRK9542 - Flexgreen Inline Gloss Coating is a UV LED coating for inline applications for gravure jobs, especially on paperfoil laminates substrate and laminated board for sheetfed printing. The coating is applied to impart glossy and smooth appearance, apart from their visual effects and offers good processing, high reactivity and a good flow-out. [Asepto Premium Foil Stamping Effects] #### [Asepto Premium (Foil Stamping Effects)][101] Asepto Premium gives brands a great opportunity to increase their product lines without contemplating about creating an urbane look for the packs. Asepto Premium foil stamping effect redefines the making of carton packs into an art form with luxurious shiny finish which is a classy way to present aseptic liquid packs on the shelves. [[Click to View More about Sustainability]][102] #### Sustainability ### UFlex news [Apoorvshree Chaturvedi, Director, Global Operations, UFlex Group] #### Media interview Mr. Apoorvshree Chaturvedi, Director – Global Operations, UFlex Group, spoke to Packaging Europe at Interpack 2026 about UFlex’s efforts in sustainable packaging. 07/05/2026 [View More][103] [Apoorvshree Chaturvedi, Director, Global Operations, UFlex Group] #### Media interview Mr. Apoorvshree Chaturvedi, Director – Global Operations, UFlex Group, shares his strategic vision for building a globally competitive and sustainability-led packaging company, in an exclusive interaction with WhatPackaging?. 10/04/2026 [View More][104] [Jeevaraj Pillai, Director - Sustainability, President - Flexible Packaging and New Product Development, UFlex Limited] #### Media coverage At the Indian INDIAN INSTITUTE OF PACKAGING - IIP’s 6th International Summit, Mr. Jeevaraj Pillai, Whole Time Director, President – Flexible Packaging and New Product Development, and Director – Sustainability, UFlex Limited, emphasized that innovation in packaging must be anchored in responsibility. 16/03/2026 [View More][105] [UFlex Jt. President, Packaging Films Business Ashish Saxena] #### Media coverage Mr. Ashish Saxena, Joint President – Packaging Films Business, UFlex Limited, talks about UFlex’s industry-first heat-sealable polyester film that is designed for high performance in packaging applications. 25/02/2026 [View More][106] [Parwez Izhar, Executive Vice President, Printing Cylinders Business, UFlex Limited] #### Media coverage In an interview with THE PACKMAN, Mr. Parwez Izhar, Executive Vice President – Printing Cylinders Business, UFlex Limited, shared how UFlex’s", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "Uflex Ltd. — channel participant (chatgpt_recall). Verify: Major flexible packaging manufacturer producing films, pouches, and laminates. | One of the largest flexible packaging companies globally, producing films, pouches, and laminates. | Flexible packaging films, pouches, laminates, and packaging machinery | India; United Arab Emirates; United States; Mexico; Egypt; Poland | India", "role_description": "Brand / Marketer", "key_products": "Flexible packaging films, pouches, laminates, and packaging machinery"}}, "X Score": "79", "Y Score": "76", "Overall Score": "78", "Industry Category": "Others / Packaging", "Quadrant": "Leaders"}, {"Company": "Aluflexpack AG", "Website": "https://aluflexpack.com", "Founded": "1982", "Headquarters": "Reinach, Switzerland", "Continent / Geography": "EU(Switzerland)", "Operational Presence": "Switzerland", "Ownership": "Subsidiary of Constantia Flexibles", "Employees": "1700", "Core Categories": "Flexible packaging; High-barrier flexible packaging; Aluminum foil, plastic, and paper-based substrate conversion; Coffee & Tea; Pharmaceuticals; Dairy; Pet Food; Confectionery; Other Foods & Beverages / Non-Food", "Specialty Focus": "Brand / Marketer; extra_from_market_reports", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Brand / Marketer", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "", "Email": "info.ch@aluflexpack.com", "LinkedIn": "https://www.linkedin.com/company/aluflexpack-ag", "Office No.": "+41 62 765 2520", "Country Code": "CH", "Region Code": "EU", "Summary": "Aluflexpack AG — channel participant (seed_file). Verify: Specializes in high-barrier flexible packaging, converting aluminum foil, plastic, and paper substrates.", "Data Sources": "google_ai; openai_sdk_residual", "_crawl": {"founded_year": 1982}, "Data Confidence": "High", "Quality Score": "4", "commercial_role": "Brand / Marketer", "verify_confidence": "95", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "aluflexpack.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "aluflexpack.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "[Skip to content][1]\n[ ][2] Group\n* [Pharma][3]\n* [Consumer][4]\n[ Search ][5] Toggle mobile navigation\n* [ Consumer Products ][6]\n* [ Pharma Products ][7]\n* [ Career ][8]\n* [ Innovation Open Submenu: Innovation ][9]\n  Innovation [To Innovation][10]\n  * Innovation\n  * * [Research & development][11]\n      Research & development\n      \n      The R&D focuses on performing flexible packaging solutions for our customers and their needs\n      of a circular economy.\n* [ Sustainability Open Submenu: Sustainability ][12]\n  Sustainability\n  \n  Our mission is to rethink flexible packaging every day.\n  \n  [To Sustainability][13]\n  * Sustainability\n  * * [PPWR ready.][14]\n      PPWR ready.\n      \n      Understanding the regulatory framework shaping packaging in the EU\n    * [ESG Commitments][15]\n      ESG Commitments\n      \n      Our environmental, social, and governance (ESG) targets for a more sustainable future.\n    * [Corporate sustainability][16]\n      Corporate sustainability\n      \n      We collect and monitor key data on our sustainability performance and transparently share\n      these with all stakeholders.\n    * [Product sustainability][17]\n      Product sustainability\n      \n      Turning global challenges into more sustainable and recyclable packaging solutions.\n    * [Value chain collaboration][18]\n      Value chain collaboration\n      \n      Collaboration throughout the value chain is an important component of a comprehensive approach\n      to sustainability.\n    * [Health, safety, security and environment][19]\n      Health, safety, security and environment\n      \n      We promote the constant development of Health & Safety at work.\n    * [Regulatory affairs][20]\n      Regulatory affairs\n      \n      Ensuring safety and compliance in packaging, while promoting recycling and shaping industry\n      standards.\n    * [Independent assessments and external recognition][21]\n      Independent assessments and external recognition\n      \n      Corporate environmental reporting, ratings, and external recognition of our achievements.\n* [ Newsroom ][22]\n* [ Search ][23]\n* [ About us ][24]\n* [ Suppliers ][25]\n* [ Locations ][26]\n* [ Downloads ][27]\n* [ Webinars on Demand ][28]\n* [ Press Corner ][29]\n* [ Contact ][30]\n\n# We rethink packaging every day.\n\nWe are Constantia Flexibles, a global leader in consumer and pharmaceutical flexible packaging.\n\n[Find out more][31]\n\n## Pharma Business\n\nTogether with our partners, we protect health and ensure the safety of patients and their loved\nones.\n\n[About Pharma][32]\n\n## Consumer Business\n\nWe aim to provide people with the highest benefit daily at the lowest impact on the environment.\n\n[About Consumer][33]\n\n## People Passion Packaging\n\nBased on the guiding principle of People Passion Packaging, we globally manufacture tailor-made\nflexible packaging solutions.\n\n## We Design for Recycling\n\nWith more than 110 years of experience in flexible packaging, we know that high‑quality and visually\nappealing packaging is only part of the story. Today, packaging also needs to work within modern\nrecycling systems and meet evolving customer expectations.\n\n\nThat’s why we apply Design for Recycling principles across our development processes. Our\n**Ecolutions portfolio** includes flexible packaging solutions engineered to support established\nrecycling streams wherever possible. These products are designed to perform strongly, protect goods,\nand be handled more efficiently at end‑of‑life within available infrastructure.\n \n\nBy continuously improving material choices, design features, and production technologies, we help\ncustomers move toward packaging that aligns with the requirements of tomorrow’s markets.\n\n[ [PPWR ready banner] ][34]\n\nJobs & Career\n\n## Your career at Constantia Flexibles\n\nNo matter if you want to start or to further develop in your career, Constantia Flexibles offers\nmeaningful jobs that contribute to a better tomorrow, creating packaging solutions that protect\ngoods and the environment and save liv"}}, "page_text": "[Skip to content][1] [ ][2] Group * [Pharma][3] * [Consumer][4] [ Search ][5] Toggle mobile navigation * [ Consumer Products ][6] * [ Pharma Products ][7] * [ Career ][8] * [ Innovation Open Submenu: Innovation ][9] Innovation [To Innovation][10] * Innovation * * [Research & development][11] Research & development The R&D focuses on performing flexible packaging solutions for our customers and their needs of a circular economy. * [ Sustainability Open Submenu: Sustainability ][12] Sustainability Our mission is to rethink flexible packaging every day. [To Sustainability][13] * Sustainability * * [PPWR ready.][14] PPWR ready. Understanding the regulatory framework shaping packaging in the EU * [ESG Commitments][15] ESG Commitments Our environmental, social, and governance (ESG) targets for a more sustainable future. * [Corporate sustainability][16] Corporate sustainability We collect and monitor key data on our sustainability performance and transparently share these with all stakeholders. * [Product sustainability][17] Product sustainability Turning global challenges into more sustainable and recyclable packaging solutions. * [Value chain collaboration][18] Value chain collaboration Collaboration throughout the value chain is an important component of a comprehensive approach to sustainability. * [Health, safety, security and environment][19] Health, safety, security and environment We promote the constant development of Health & Safety at work. * [Regulatory affairs][20] Regulatory affairs Ensuring safety and compliance in packaging, while promoting recycling and shaping industry standards. * [Independent assessments and external recognition][21] Independent assessments and external recognition Corporate environmental reporting, ratings, and external recognition of our achievements. * [ Newsroom ][22] * [ Search ][23] * [ About us ][24] * [ Suppliers ][25] * [ Locations ][26] * [ Downloads ][27] * [ Webinars on Demand ][28] * [ Press Corner ][29] * [ Contact ][30] # We rethink packaging every day. We are Constantia Flexibles, a global leader in consumer and pharmaceutical flexible packaging. [Find out more][31] ## Pharma Business Together with our partners, we protect health and ensure the safety of patients and their loved ones. [About Pharma][32] ## Consumer Business We aim to provide people with the highest benefit daily at the lowest impact on the environment. [About Consumer][33] ## People Passion Packaging Based on the guiding principle of People Passion Packaging, we globally manufacture tailor-made flexible packaging solutions. ## We Design for Recycling With more than 110 years of experience in flexible packaging, we know that high‑quality and visually appealing packaging is only part of the story. Today, packaging also needs to work within modern recycling systems and meet evolving customer expectations. That’s why we apply Design for Recycling principles across our development processes. Our **Ecolutions portfolio** includes flexible packaging solutions engineered to support established recycling streams wherever possible. These products are designed to perform strongly, protect goods, and be handled more efficiently at end‑of‑life within available infrastructure. By continuously improving material choices, design features, and production technologies, we help customers move toward packaging that aligns with the requirements of tomorrow’s markets. [ [PPWR ready banner] ][34] Jobs & Career ## Your career at Constantia Flexibles No matter if you want to start or to further develop in your career, Constantia Flexibles offers meaningful jobs that contribute to a better tomorrow, creating packaging solutions that protect goods and the environment and save lives. Explore our job opportunities and learn more about us. [Career at Constantia][35] ## Explore our culture At Constantia Flexibles, we are passionate about what we do and want to play a part in making tomorrow’s world a better place. Find out more about our culture, our core values and whom do we seek on board. [ Learn more ][36] ## Job openings Join us and unwrap your talent! [ Apply ][37] Newsroom ## The latest news from Constantia Flexibles Group News ### What defines Low Carbon Aluminum, and how can it support measurable Scope 3 emission reductions? Key insights of Packaging Europe’s Sustainability Perspectives podcast by Gratiani Tscheppen | May 18, 2026 [ Read Article ][38] Group News ### PERPETUA ALTA among the finalists of De Gouden Noot July 31, 2026 [ Read Article ][39] Group News ### Constantia Pirk achieves ISCC PLUS certification July 20, 2026 [ Read Article ][40] Group News ### Croatia plants achieve AA rating at BRCGS audit July 17, 2026 [ Read Article ][41] [ Go to News ][42] [Back to main navigation][43] * [Company][44] * [About Constantia Flexibles][45] * [Vision & mission][46] * [Management][47] * [Quality][48] * [Locations][49] * [Markets & solutions][50] * [Consumer packaging][51] * [Pharma packaging][52] * [Ecolutions][53] * [Sustainability][54] * [Sustainability overview][55] * [ESG commitments][56] * [Corporate sustainability][57] * [Product sustainability][58] * [Value chain collaboration][59] * [External recognition][60] * [News & insights][61] * [News][62] * [Press][63] * [Downloads][64] * [Webinars on Demand][65] * [Careers & contact][66] * [Career][67] * [Suppliers][68] * [Contact][69] * [Newsletter][70] * [ Social media Facebook ][71] * [ Social media LinkedIn ][72] * [ Social media Youtube ][73] * [ Social media Instagram ][74] © 2026 Constantia Flexibles ## Learn more about our other departments: * [ Visit CFlex Constantia Flexibles Pharma ][75] * [ Visit CFlex Constantia Flexibles Consumer ][76] * [Legal imprint][77] * [General terms & conditions][78] * [Privacy Policy][79] * [Contact][80] * [Newsletter][81] For full functionality of this page it is necessary to enable JavaScript. Here are the [instructions how to enable JavaScript in your web browser][82] [1]: #main [2]: / [3]: https://pharma.cflex.com/ [4]: https://consumer.cflex.com/ [5]: /search/ [6]: https://consumer.cflex.com/products [7]: https://pharma.cflex.com/products/ [8]: /career/ [9]: /innovation/ [10]: /innovation/ [11]: /innovation/research-development/ [12]: /sustainability/ [13]: /sustainability/ [14]: /sustainability/ppwr/ [15]: /sustainability/esg-commitments/ [16]: /sustainability/corporate-sustainability/ [17]: /sustainability/product-sustainability/ [18]: /sustainability/value-chain-collaboration/ [19]: /sustainability/health-safety-security-and-environment/ [20]: /sustainability/regulatory-affairs/ [21]: /sustainability/external-recognition/ [22]: /newsroom/ [23]: /search/ [24]: /about-us/ [25]: /suppliers/ [26]: /locations/ [27]: /downloads/ [28]: /webinars-on-demand/ [29]: /press-corner/ [30]: /contact/ [31]: /sustainability/ [32]: https://pharma.cflex.com/ [33]: https://consumer.cflex.com/ [34]: /sustainability/ppwr/ [35]: https://career.cflex.com [36]: /career/ [37]: https://career.cflex.com [38]: /newsroom/what-defines-low-carbon-aluminum-and-how-can-it-support-measurable-scope-3-emission- reductions/ [39]: /newsroom/perpetua-alta-among-the-finalists-of-de-gouden-noot/ [40]: /newsroom/constantia-pirk-achieves-iscc-plus-certification/ [41]: /newsroom/croatia-plants-achieve-aa-rating-at-brcgs-audit/ [42]: /newsroom/ [43]: #page [44]: /about-us/ [45]: /about-us/ [46]: /about-us/vision-mission/ [47]: /about-us/management/ [48]: /about-us/quality/ [49]: /locations/ [50]: https://consumer.cflex.com/products/ [51]: https://consumer.cflex.com/products/ [52]: https://pharma.cflex.com/products/ [53]: https://consumer.cflex.com/applications/ecolutions/ [54]: /sustainability/ [55]: /sustainability/ [56]: /sustainability/esg-commitments/ [57]: /sustainability/corporate-sustainability/ [58]: /sustainability/product-sustainability/ [59]: /sustainability/value-chain-collaboration/ [60]: /sustainability/external-recognition/ [61]: /newsroom/ [62]: /newsroom/ [63]: /press-corner/ [64]: /downloads/ [65]: /webinars-on-demand/ [66]: /career/ [67]: /career/ [68]: /suppliers/ [69]: /contact/contact-form/ [70]: /newsletter/ [71]: https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61579055555796 [72]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/constantia-flexibles/ [73]: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCvMXfhj0CQCSQXg3wcsRGlg [74]: https://www.instagram.com/constantiaflexibles [75]: https://pharma.cflex.com/ [76]: https://consumer.cflex.com/ [77]: /legal-imprint/ [78]: /general-terms-conditions/ [79]: /privacy-policy/ [80]: /contact/ [81]: /newsletter/ [82]: http://www.enable-javascript.com", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "Aluflexpack AG — channel participant (seed_file). Verify: Specializes in high-barrier flexible packaging, converting aluminum foil, plastic, and paper substrates. | Brand / Marketer; extra_from_market_reports | Flexible packaging; High-barrier flexible packaging; Aluminum foil, plastic, and paper-based substrate conversion; Coffee & Tea; Pharmaceuticals; Dairy; Pet Food; Confectionery; Other Foods & Beverages / Non-Food | Switzerland | Reinach, Switzerland", "role_description": "Brand / Marketer", "key_products": "Flexible packaging; High-barrier flexible packaging; Aluminum foil, plastic, and paper-based substrate conversion; Coffee & Tea; Pharmaceuticals; Dairy; Pet Food; Confectionery; Other Foods & Beverages / Non-Food"}}, "X Score": "79", "Y Score": "74", "Overall Score": "76", "Industry Category": "Others / Packaging", "Quadrant": "Leaders"}, {"Company": "Constantia Flexibles Group GmbH", "Website": "https://cflex.com", "Founded": "1912", "Headquarters": "Vienna, Austria", "Continent / Geography": "EU(Austria)", "Operational Presence": "Austria", "Ownership": "Private (One Rock Capital Partners)", "Employees": "8500", "Core Categories": "flexible packaging; film-based packaging solutions", "Specialty Focus": "Brand / Marketer; web_confirmed_flex_pack_player", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Brand / Marketer", "Contact Person": "Thomas Glossner; Marc Rademacher", "Role": "Executive Vice President Procurement; Executive Vice President Consumer Commercial", "Email": "office@cflex.com", "LinkedIn": "https://www.linkedin.com/company/constantia-flexibles", "Office No.": "+43 1 888 5640", "Country Code": "AT", "Region Code": "EU", "Summary": "Constantia Flexibles Group GmbH — channel participant (seed_file). Verify: Major flexible packaging manufacturer.", "Data Sources": "google_ai; openai_sdk_residual", "_crawl": {"founded_year": 1912}, "Data Confidence": "High", "Quality Score": "4", "commercial_role": "Brand / Marketer", "verify_confidence": "95", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "cflex.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "cflex.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "[Skip to content][1]\n[ ][2] Group\n* [Pharma][3]\n* [Consumer][4]\n[ Search ][5] Toggle mobile navigation\n* [ Consumer Products ][6]\n* [ Pharma Products ][7]\n* [ Career ][8]\n* [ Innovation Open Submenu: Innovation ][9]\n  Innovation [To Innovation][10]\n  * Innovation\n  * * [Research & development][11]\n      Research & development\n      \n      The R&D focuses on performing flexible packaging solutions for our customers and their needs\n      of a circular economy.\n* [ Sustainability Open Submenu: Sustainability ][12]\n  Sustainability\n  \n  Our mission is to rethink flexible packaging every day.\n  \n  [To Sustainability][13]\n  * Sustainability\n  * * [PPWR ready.][14]\n      PPWR ready.\n      \n      Understanding the regulatory framework shaping packaging in the EU\n    * [ESG Commitments][15]\n      ESG Commitments\n      \n      Our environmental, social, and governance (ESG) targets for a more sustainable future.\n    * [Corporate sustainability][16]\n      Corporate sustainability\n      \n      We collect and monitor key data on our sustainability performance and transparently share\n      these with all stakeholders.\n    * [Product sustainability][17]\n      Product sustainability\n      \n      Turning global challenges into more sustainable and recyclable packaging solutions.\n    * [Value chain collaboration][18]\n      Value chain collaboration\n      \n      Collaboration throughout the value chain is an important component of a comprehensive approach\n      to sustainability.\n    * [Health, safety, security and environment][19]\n      Health, safety, security and environment\n      \n      We promote the constant development of Health & Safety at work.\n    * [Regulatory affairs][20]\n      Regulatory affairs\n      \n      Ensuring safety and compliance in packaging, while promoting recycling and shaping industry\n      standards.\n    * [Independent assessments and external recognition][21]\n      Independent assessments and external recognition\n      \n      Corporate environmental reporting, ratings, and external recognition of our achievements.\n* [ Newsroom ][22]\n* [ Search ][23]\n* [ About us ][24]\n* [ Suppliers ][25]\n* [ Locations ][26]\n* [ Downloads ][27]\n* [ Webinars on Demand ][28]\n* [ Press Corner ][29]\n* [ Contact ][30]\n\n# We rethink packaging every day.\n\nWe are Constantia Flexibles, a global leader in consumer and pharmaceutical flexible packaging.\n\n[Find out more][31]\n\n## Pharma Business\n\nTogether with our partners, we protect health and ensure the safety of patients and their loved\nones.\n\n[About Pharma][32]\n\n## Consumer Business\n\nWe aim to provide people with the highest benefit daily at the lowest impact on the environment.\n\n[About Consumer][33]\n\n## People Passion Packaging\n\nBased on the guiding principle of People Passion Packaging, we globally manufacture tailor-made\nflexible packaging solutions.\n\n## We Design for Recycling\n\nWith more than 110 years of experience in flexible packaging, we know that high‑quality and visually\nappealing packaging is only part of the story. Today, packaging also needs to work within modern\nrecycling systems and meet evolving customer expectations.\n\n\nThat’s why we apply Design for Recycling principles across our development processes. Our\n**Ecolutions portfolio** includes flexible packaging solutions engineered to support established\nrecycling streams wherever possible. These products are designed to perform strongly, protect goods,\nand be handled more efficiently at end‑of‑life within available infrastructure.\n \n\nBy continuously improving material choices, design features, and production technologies, we help\ncustomers move toward packaging that aligns with the requirements of tomorrow’s markets.\n\n[ [PPWR ready banner] ][34]\n\nJobs & Career\n\n## Your career at Constantia Flexibles\n\nNo matter if you want to start or to further develop in your career, Constantia Flexibles offers\nmeaningful jobs that contribute to a better tomorrow, creating packaging solutions that protect\ngoods and the environment and save liv"}}, "page_text": "[Skip to content][1] [ ][2] Group * [Pharma][3] * [Consumer][4] [ Search ][5] Toggle mobile navigation * [ Consumer Products ][6] * [ Pharma Products ][7] * [ Career ][8] * [ Innovation Open Submenu: Innovation ][9] Innovation [To Innovation][10] * Innovation * * [Research & development][11] Research & development The R&D focuses on performing flexible packaging solutions for our customers and their needs of a circular economy. * [ Sustainability Open Submenu: Sustainability ][12] Sustainability Our mission is to rethink flexible packaging every day. [To Sustainability][13] * Sustainability * * [PPWR ready.][14] PPWR ready. Understanding the regulatory framework shaping packaging in the EU * [ESG Commitments][15] ESG Commitments Our environmental, social, and governance (ESG) targets for a more sustainable future. * [Corporate sustainability][16] Corporate sustainability We collect and monitor key data on our sustainability performance and transparently share these with all stakeholders. * [Product sustainability][17] Product sustainability Turning global challenges into more sustainable and recyclable packaging solutions. * [Value chain collaboration][18] Value chain collaboration Collaboration throughout the value chain is an important component of a comprehensive approach to sustainability. * [Health, safety, security and environment][19] Health, safety, security and environment We promote the constant development of Health & Safety at work. * [Regulatory affairs][20] Regulatory affairs Ensuring safety and compliance in packaging, while promoting recycling and shaping industry standards. * [Independent assessments and external recognition][21] Independent assessments and external recognition Corporate environmental reporting, ratings, and external recognition of our achievements. * [ Newsroom ][22] * [ Search ][23] * [ About us ][24] * [ Suppliers ][25] * [ Locations ][26] * [ Downloads ][27] * [ Webinars on Demand ][28] * [ Press Corner ][29] * [ Contact ][30] # We rethink packaging every day. We are Constantia Flexibles, a global leader in consumer and pharmaceutical flexible packaging. [Find out more][31] ## Pharma Business Together with our partners, we protect health and ensure the safety of patients and their loved ones. [About Pharma][32] ## Consumer Business We aim to provide people with the highest benefit daily at the lowest impact on the environment. [About Consumer][33] ## People Passion Packaging Based on the guiding principle of People Passion Packaging, we globally manufacture tailor-made flexible packaging solutions. ## We Design for Recycling With more than 110 years of experience in flexible packaging, we know that high‑quality and visually appealing packaging is only part of the story. Today, packaging also needs to work within modern recycling systems and meet evolving customer expectations. That’s why we apply Design for Recycling principles across our development processes. Our **Ecolutions portfolio** includes flexible packaging solutions engineered to support established recycling streams wherever possible. These products are designed to perform strongly, protect goods, and be handled more efficiently at end‑of‑life within available infrastructure. By continuously improving material choices, design features, and production technologies, we help customers move toward packaging that aligns with the requirements of tomorrow’s markets. [ [PPWR ready banner] ][34] Jobs & Career ## Your career at Constantia Flexibles No matter if you want to start or to further develop in your career, Constantia Flexibles offers meaningful jobs that contribute to a better tomorrow, creating packaging solutions that protect goods and the environment and save lives. Explore our job opportunities and learn more about us. [Career at Constantia][35] ## Explore our culture At Constantia Flexibles, we are passionate about what we do and want to play a part in making tomorrow’s world a better place. Find out more about our culture, our core values and whom do we seek on board. [ Learn more ][36] ## Job openings Join us and unwrap your talent! [ Apply ][37] Newsroom ## The latest news from Constantia Flexibles Group News ### What defines Low Carbon Aluminum, and how can it support measurable Scope 3 emission reductions? Key insights of Packaging Europe’s Sustainability Perspectives podcast by Gratiani Tscheppen | May 18, 2026 [ Read Article ][38] Group News ### PERPETUA ALTA among the finalists of De Gouden Noot July 31, 2026 [ Read Article ][39] Group News ### Constantia Pirk achieves ISCC PLUS certification July 20, 2026 [ Read Article ][40] Group News ### Croatia plants achieve AA rating at BRCGS audit July 17, 2026 [ Read Article ][41] [ Go to News ][42] [Back to main navigation][43] * [Company][44] * [About Constantia Flexibles][45] * [Vision & mission][46] * [Management][47] * [Qual