e/gloss flexible packaging][13]\n      * [Compostable flexible packaging][14]\n      * [Recyclable flexible packaging][15]\n      * [Stick pack film laminations][16]\n      * [Lidding films][17]\n      * [Peel and reseal rollstock][18]\n      * [Shrink bands][19]\n      * [HFFS and VFFS rollstock][20]\n      * [Inno-Lok^{®} pre-zippered rollstock][21]\n      * [Laser die-cut window rollstock][22]\n      * [Paper flexible packaging][23]\n      * [High burst strength flexible packaging][24]\n      * [Child-resistant flexible packaging][25]\n    * Premade pouches\n      * [Stand-up pouches][26]\n      * [Zipper pouches][27]\n      * [Slider pouches][28]\n      * [Laser-scored pouches][29]\n      * [Flat-bottom pouches][30]\n      * [Spouted pouches][31]\n      * [Pouches with handles][32]\n      * [Matte and gloss pouches][33]\n      * [Compostable pouches][34]\n      * [Recyclable pouches][35]\n    * [Labels][36]\n      * [Shrink sleeves][37]\n      * [Stretch sleeves][38]\n      * [Roll-fed labels][39]\n      * [Poly bags][40]\n      * [Cold-seal packaging][41]\n      * [GreenStream™ sustainable packaging][42]\n        * [GreenStream™ Compostable][43]\n        * [GreenStream™ Paper][44]\n        * [GreenStream™ Recyclable][45]\n    * [Poly bags][46]\n    * [Cold-seal packaging][47]\n    * [GreenStream sustainable packaging][48]\n* Capabilities\n  * [Package design and consultation][49]\n  * [In-house prepress services][50]\n  * [HD flexographic printing][51]\n  * [Extrusion and adhesive lamination][52]\n  * [Finishing][53]\n* Markets\n  * [Overview][54]\n  * [Snack food packaging][55]\n  * [Cookie & bakery product packaging][56]\n  * [Coffee & beverage packaging][57]\n  * [Pet food packaging][58]\n  * [Confectionery packaging][59]\n  * [Health & wellness packaging][60]\n  * [Medical & electronics cleanroom packaging][61]\n  * [Aerospace packaging][62]\n* [Technology][63]\n* [Sustainability][64]\n  * [GreenStream™ products][65]\n  * [Solar-powered manufacturing][66]\n  * [Internal recycling facility][67]\n* Resources\n  * [News][68]\n  * [Learning center][69]\n  * [Flexible packaging calculator][70]\n  * [Premade pouches glossary][71]\n  * [Flexible packaging films glossary][72]\n* [About][73]\n  * [Our companies][74]\n  * [Careers][75]\n  * [Contact us][76]\n* [Contact][77]\nSearch this site\nSubmit the form below\n\n### Inspired Packaging for Today's Lifestyles\n\n### MEET THE NEW C-P. MORE CAPABILITIES THAN EVER BEFORE.\n\n## Sustainable Packaging\n\nMinimizing impact on our environment.\n\n[Learn more][78]\n\n## Medical & Electronics Cleanroom Packaging\n\nHigh specification materials for sterile applications.\n\n[Learn more][79]\n\n## Food Packaging\n\nBarrier and breathable materials to protect and delight.\n\n[Learn More][80]\n\n## Consumer-friendly Recloseable Packaging\n\nOffering convenience and multi-serve capabilities.\n\n[Learn More][81]\n\n## Health & Wellness Packaging\n\nEmbracing and prioritizing products that promote well-being.\n\n[Learn More][82]\n[\n**Sustainable Packaging** ][83]\n[\n**Medical & Electronics Cleanroom Packaging** ][84]\n[\n**Food\nPackaging** ][85]\n[\n**Consumer-friendly Recloseable Packaging** ][86]\n[\n**Health & Wellness Packaging** ][87]\n\n#### Limitless packaging possibilities\n\nYou’ll get the best of both worlds: The capabilities of a large flexible packaging supplier,\ncombined with the agility and dedicated service typical of a small converter.\n\n#### State-of-the-art technology\n\nHD flexographic printing. Matte and gloss printing effects. Leading reclose technology. In-house\nlaser scoring, pouch converting, Inno-Lok® pre-zippered rolls"}}, "page_text": "[Skip to content][1] [[C-P Flexible Packaging]][2] [ Primary Menu ☰ ][3] * Products * [Cleanroom Packaging][4] * [Polyethylene cleanroom packaging][5] * [Nylon cleanroom packaging][6] * [PCTFE cleanroom packaging][7] * [Antistatic cleanroom packaging][8] * [High-strength cleanroom packaging][9] * [Dual layer cleanroom packaging][10] * [Consumer Packaging][11] * Printed rollstock * [High-barrier flexible packaging][12] * [Matte/gloss flexible packaging][13] * [Compostable flexible packaging][14] * [Recyclable flexible packaging][15] * [Stick pack film laminations][16] * [Lidding films][17] * [Peel and reseal rollstock][18] * [Shrink bands][19] * [HFFS and VFFS rollstock][20] * [Inno-Lok^{®} pre-zippered rollstock][21] * [Laser die-cut window rollstock][22] * [Paper flexible packaging][23] * [High burst strength flexible packaging][24] * [Child-resistant flexible packaging][25] * Premade pouches * [Stand-up pouches][26] * [Zipper pouches][27] * [Slider pouches][28] * [Laser-scored pouches][29] * [Flat-bottom pouches][30] * [Spouted pouches][31] * [Pouches with handles][32] * [Matte and gloss pouches][33] * [Compostable pouches][34] * [Recyclable pouches][35] * [Labels][36] * [Shrink sleeves][37] * [Stretch sleeves][38] * [Roll-fed labels][39] * [Poly bags][40] * [Cold-seal packaging][41] * [GreenStream™ sustainable packaging][42] * [GreenStream™ Compostable][43] * [GreenStream™ Paper][44] * [GreenStream™ Recyclable][45] * [Poly bags][46] * [Cold-seal packaging][47] * [GreenStream sustainable packaging][48] * Capabilities * [Package design and consultation][49] * [In-house prepress services][50] * [HD flexographic printing][51] * [Extrusion and adhesive lamination][52] * [Finishing][53] * Markets * [Overview][54] * [Snack food packaging][55] * [Cookie & bakery product packaging][56] * [Coffee & beverage packaging][57] * [Pet food packaging][58] * [Confectionery packaging][59] * [Health & wellness packaging][60] * [Medical & electronics cleanroom packaging][61] * [Aerospace packaging][62] * [Technology][63] * [Sustainability][64] * [GreenStream™ products][65] * [Solar-powered manufacturing][66] * [Internal recycling facility][67] * Resources * [News][68] * [Learning center][69] * [Flexible packaging calculator][70] * [Premade pouches glossary][71] * [Flexible packaging films glossary][72] * [About][73] * [Our companies][74] * [Careers][75] * [Contact us][76] * [Contact][77] Search this site Submit the form below ### Inspired Packaging for Today's Lifestyles ### MEET THE NEW C-P. MORE CAPABILITIES THAN EVER BEFORE. ## Sustainable Packaging Minimizing impact on our environment. [Learn more][78] ## Medical & Electronics Cleanroom Packaging High specification materials for sterile applications. [Learn more][79] ## Food Packaging Barrier and breathable materials to protect and delight. [Learn More][80] ## Consumer-friendly Recloseable Packaging Offering convenience and multi-serve capabilities. [Learn More][81] ## Health & Wellness Packaging Embracing and prioritizing products that promote well-being. [Learn More][82] [ **Sustainable Packaging** ][83] [ **Medical & Electronics Cleanroom Packaging** ][84] [ **Food Packaging** ][85] [ **Consumer-friendly Recloseable Packaging** ][86] [ **Health & Wellness Packaging** ][87] #### Limitless packaging possibilities You’ll get the best of both worlds: The capabilities of a large flexible packaging supplier, combined with the agility and dedicated service typical of a small converter. #### State-of-the-art technology HD flexographic printing. Matte and gloss printing effects. Leading reclose technology. In-house laser scoring, pouch converting, Inno-Lok® pre-zippered rollstock, cold seal application, and the list goes on. #### Service built around your needs You’ll have access to vendor-managed inventory (VMI), safety stock programs, ongoing plant-floor support, dedicated field support engineers, and more. [Packaging for cleanroom and consumer markets] ## Many packaging products, one supplier We’re your one-stop-shop for flexible packaging — enabling you to consolidate packaging suppliers. Fewer suppliers means lower transportation costs and less time spent coordinating vendor relationships. [Explore products][88] ## From concept to prototype in 2 weeks or less With our in-house product development team, our clients get tremendous speed to market. Because we are fully integrated — with graphics, prepress, state-of-the-art plate making, and almost every finishing platform in-house — you get greater control throughout the process. [ Explore capabilities][89] [concept-to-prototype] [concept-to-prototype] [sustainability] [sustainability] ## To us, sustainability is more than a buzzword For brands that require recyclable packaging, we have mono-material, all-PE packaging products suitable for store drop-off programs. For brands wanting to source recycled materials, we offer PET with up to 90% post-consumer recycled (PCR) resin and PE with up to 44% PCR resin. From source reduction to compostability, we have solutions. [Our commitment to sustainability][90] ## Six decades of experience We’ve been at this for 60 years, and we’ve seen trends come and go, printing technology evolve, and even our own portfolio of capabilities expand. We've mastered all things flexible packaging, and we aim to be your packaging problem solver. [Learn more about us][91] [six-decades-of-experience] [six-decades-of-experience] [about-us] [about-us] ## We don't guess what you need We work closely with your company to develop custom packaging that fits within your budget, meets your performance requirements, and achieves your brand vision. And we don’t wait for packaging issues to arise — we have field tech engineers on your plant floor asking your team what’s working, what’s not, and refining our process accordingly. [Learn about our customer-centric process][92] Latest resources [Access the learning center][93] [Garlock/C-P Wins Flexographic Technical Association Sustainability Excellence Award for Die-Cut Rollstock Using Compostable Materials] [ ### Garlock/C-P Wins Flexographic Technical Association Sustainability Excellence Award for Die-Cut ### Rollstock Using Compostable Materials ][94] Garlock/C-P’s conventional DCRS product is a patented technology that combines paper and film using polyethylene extrudate to create a bag with a window. [Read more][95] [Garlock/C-P Announces Strong Integration Progress Following Company Merger] [ ### Garlock/C-P Announces Strong Integration Progress Following Company Merger ][96] Garlock/C-P today announced significant progress in integrating operations, strengthening customer support functions, and optimizing the manufacturing footprint of Garlock Flexibles and C-P Flexible Packaging following their merger in October 2025. [Read more][97] [Preferred Packaging Launches GreenStream® Fiber Trays: A New Standard in Sustainable Meal Packaging] [ ### Preferred Packaging Launches GreenStream® Fiber Trays: A New Standard in Sustainable Meal ### Packaging ][98] C-P’s Norcross, GA division introduces GreenStream® fiber trays—PFAS-free, compostable, and curbside recyclable packaging designed for sustainable ready and prepared meals. [Read more][99] [[C-P Flexible Packaging]][100] * [About us][101] * [Contact][102] * [Careers][103] [ [LinkedIn] ][104] [ [Facebook] ][105] [Phone Number] [800-815-0667][106] ** Headquarters ** 15 Grumbacher Road York, PA 17406 [ [BRCGS] ][107] [ [SQF] ][108] [ [AIB] ][109] © 2026 C-P Flexible Packaging. All rights reserved. | [Privacy Policy][110] [1]: #content [2]: https://www.cpflexpack.com/ [3]: #primary-nav [4]: # [5]: /products/bags/cleanroom-bags [6]: /products/bags/nylon-bag/ [7]: https://www.cleanroomfilm.com/materials [8]: https://www.cleanroomfilm.com/materials [9]: https://www.cleanroomfilm.com/materials [10]: https://www.cleanroomfilm.com/materials [11]: # [12]: https://www.cpflexpack.com/products/printed-rollstock/high-barrier-flexible-packaging/ [13]: https://www.cpflexpack.com/products/printed-rollstock/matte-gloss-packaging/ [14]: https://www.cpflexpack.com/products/printed-rollstock/compostable-flexible-packaging/ [15]: https://www.cpflexpack.com/products/printed-rollstock/recyclable-flexible-packaging/ [16]: https://www.cpflexpack.com/products/printed-rollstock/stick-pack-film-laminations/ 