ange of customers.\n\n[ [Detpak] ][2]\n[ [PaperPak] ][3]\n[ [Detmold Medical] ][4]\nDismiss Detmold Group information\n* Detmold Group\n* [LinkedIn][5]\n* [Contact Us][6]\n\n#### CHANGING STORES WILL CLEAR YOUR CART\n\nDo you want to continue?\n\nNO KEEP CART YES, CLEAR CART\n\n## ADD A NEW STORE\n\nClose\nStore Name (Max 28 Characters) *\nAddress Name/Nickname *\nShop/Unit/Level/Suite\nStreet Address *\nSuburb/City *\nState/Region *\nPostcode *\nCountry *\nCategory * Select category\nDelivery Instructions\nCancel Add Store\n* [ Our Story ][7]\n  \n  [ Our Story ][8]\n  \n  The Detmold Group employs 3,000 people, with representatives in 17 countries, manufacturing\n  facilities in 7 of those countries, and produces over 22,000 different food and retail packaging\n  products.\n  * [ Company Overview ][9]\n  * [ Vision & Values ][10]\n  * [ Latest News ][11]\n  \n  Dismiss menu\n* [ Our Brands ][12]\n  \n  [ Our Brands ][13]\n  \n  Our brands provide our customers with a comprehensive range of packaging solutions to suit their\n  business needs.\n  * [ Detpak ][14]\n  * [ Paperpak ][15]\n  * [ Detmold Medical ][16]\n  * [ Cup & Carry ][17]\n  \n  Dismiss menu\n* [ Innovation ][18]\n  \n  [ Innovation ][19]\n  \n  LaunchPad is our centre for innovation. Our innovation is driven by our entrepreneurial spirit and\n  is at the heart of everything we do as a Group.\n  * [ About ][20]\n  * [ Case Studies ][21]\n  \n  Dismiss menu\n* [ Global Network ][22]\n  \n  [ Global Network ][23]\n  \n  From the original factory in Adelaide, South Australia, the Group now operates in 17 countries and\n  continues to grow.\n  * [ Quality & Accreditations ][24]\n  * [ Supply Chain ][25]\n  * [ Manufacturing ][26]\n  \n  Dismiss menu\n* [ Careers ][27]\n  \n  [ Careers ][28]\n  \n  As a global business, there is a world of diverse opportunities available within the Detmold\n  Group.\n  * [ Current Opportunities ][29]\n  \n  Dismiss menu\n* [ Environment ][30]\n  \n  [ Environment ][31]\n  \n  The Detmold Group’s approach to the environment is all encompassing. As a company with an\n  environmental focus, we are constantly striving for improvements and innovations to sustain our\n  environment.\n  * [ Sustainability Objectives ][32]\n  * [ Sustainability ][33]\n  * [ Community ][34]\n  * [ PFAS Statement ][35]\n  \n  Dismiss menu\n* [ More... ][36]\nGo\n\nRecommended pages\n\nDo you mean\n\nSee all results\nDismiss search\n\nDetpak Is Now Manufacturing in the United States\n\nWe are investing locally to give national customers greater supply confidence, faster response and\nreduced operational risk.\n\n[ Learn More About our Expansion in the U.S. ][37]\n\n## We're an Employer of Choice\n\n[ Employer of Choice Award ][38] [ Careers ][39]\n\n## Detmold Group announce plans for a new global headquarters\n\n[ Read More ][40]\n\n2025 - 2050 Sustainability Goals\n\nDiscover our new targets, designed to create a positive impact for our people, partners, and our\nplanet\n\n[ Learn more ][41]\n\nSupply Chain\n\n[ Find out more ][42]\n\nGlobal Footprint\n\n[ Learn more ][43]\n\nManufacturing\n\n[ Learn more ][44]\n\n## Global innovators in sustainable paper and board packaging solutions.\n\nEstablished in 1948, the Detmold Group is an Australian family-owned and operated business,\nsupplying some of the world’s largest and most iconic food and retail brands.\n\n[ LEARN ABOUT OUR 2025-2050 COMMITMENTS SUSTAINABILITY GOALS ][45]\n\n[ LAUNCHPAD DISCOVER INNOVATION ][46]\n\n\n[ [Detpak] ][47]\n[ [Paperpak] ][48]\n\n[ Working at Detmold ][49]\n\n[ Quality & Accreditations ][50]\n\n## Our Customers\n\nBuilding strategic partnerships with stakeholders and establishing strong relationships with\ncustomers is part of our commitment to quality, service and efficiency.\n\n[McDonalds]\n[Subway]\n[Detmold Group Customer Logo Jurlique]\n[Detmold Group Customer Logo Dicos]\n[Zambrero]\n\n[OUR ST"}}, "page_text": "**Cookies** We use cookies to enhance your experience on our w