ly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Brand / Marketer", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "", "Email": "communications@ororagroup.com", "LinkedIn": "https://www.linkedin.com/company/orora-limited", "Office No.": "+61 3 9116 1711", "Country Code": "AU", "Region Code": "APAC", "Summary": "Orora Limited — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Australian packaging company offering flexible packaging solutions, fits criteria.", "Data Sources": "google_ai; openai_sdk_residual", "_crawl": {"founded_year": 2013}, "Data Confidence": "High", "Quality Score": "4", "commercial_role": "Brand / Marketer", "verify_confidence": "90", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "ororagroup.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "ororagroup.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "[ ][1]\n1. [About us][2]\n2. [What We Do][3]\n3. [Investors][4]\n4. [Sustainability][5]\n5. [News][6]\n1. [Careers][7]\n2. [Contact][8]\n\n# Packaging is our passion\n\n## [ASX: ORA][9] [$1.515][10]\n\n### -0.025 | 1.6234    13 Aug 8:00 AM AEST\n\n#### ORORA LIMITED\n\n[ Manage your shares ][11]\nAbout us\n\n## We are a global leader in the design, manufacture and decoration of glass bottles and aluminium\n## cans. Innovation and sustainability are at the heart of what we do, and we are proud to work with\n## some of the best-known drinks brands in the world. \n* ### What we do\n  \n  #### Our Products and Expertise \n  \n  We are a leading producer of unique packaging solutions, with a special focus on the global\n  beverage industry.  \n  \n   \n  \n  [ Learn more ][12]\n* ### Investors\n  \n  #### Investor Centre\n  \n  Find ASX announcements, presentations, reports, share price details, and important information to\n  help manage your shareholdings.\n  \n  [ Learn more ][13]\n* ### Sustainability\n  \n  #### Our Promise to the Future \n  \n  We care about making a difference. Our approach to sustainability is embedded across our business\n  and central to our journey. It’s our promise to the future.  \n  \n  [ Learn more ][14]\n\nAbout\n\n## Our Businesses\n* [\n  \n  ### Glass\n  \n  ### Our global glass network spans seven manufacturing and four decoration sites, servicing the\n  ### high-end luxury wine and spirits through to mainstream wine and beer.\n  \n  Learn more ][15]\n* [\n  \n  ### Cans\n  \n  ### Leading the industry with unparalleled production and decoration capability, our aluminium\n  ### cans network spans six manufacturing sites across Australia and New Zealand.  \n  \n  Learn more ][16]\n\nNews\n\n## The latest from Orora\n* [\n  1 July 2026\n  \n  ## Recognising the team behind Orora's Asahi and Helio success\n  \n  innovation|sustainability|products|\n  Read more\n  ][17]\n* [\n  26 June 2026\n  \n  ## Tahlia Graetz named Rising Star at 2026 PKN Women in Packaging Awards\n  \n  innovation|\n  Read more\n  ][18]\n* [\n  19 June 2026\n  \n  ## Celebrating the 2026 Graduates of Women in Leadership at Orora\n  \n  sustainability|\n  Read more\n  ][19]\n\n[Read more][20]\n* ### Careers\n  \n  #### Join our team\n  \n  Working at Orora is an opportunity to be part of a diverse and dynamic team. We’re looking for\n  problem solvers and collaborative thinkers who are passionate about making a difference. \n  \n   \n  \n  [ Learn more ][21]\n\n## Get in touch\n\n[Contact us now][22]\n[ Orora ][23]\nSitemap\n\n### HOME\n* [Home][24]\n* [What we do][25]\n* [News][26]\n* [Investors][27]\n* [Sustainability][28]\n\n### COMPANY\n* [About][29]\n* [Careers][30]\n* [Contact][31]\n\n### CONNECT\n* [ LinkedIn][32]\n* [ YouTube][33]\n\n© Orora Packaging Australia Pty Ltd 2026\n1. [Media Centre][34]\n2. [Terms of Use][35]\n3. [Terms of Trade][36]\n4. [Privacy Policy][37]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /about\n[3]: /what-we-do\n[4]: /investors\n[5]: /sustainability\n[6]: /news\n[7]: /careers\n[8]: /contact-us\n[9]: https://www2.asx.com.au/markets/company/ORA\n[10]: https://www2.asx.com.au/markets