n further – from early ideas to reliable, day-to-day operations. Move with confidence and keep consumers coming back for more. [ Learn more⁠ ][175] ## Featured The content couldn’t be loaded. Please refresh the page or try again later. ### How we can help you Delivering food processing and packaging solutions and support across the full value chain, we ensure the highest standards in food safety and operational performance while actively working to reduce your environmental footprint. [ [Women with orange handbag, holding Tetra Prisma Aseptic carton package] ][176] #### Packaging #### [Packaging][177] [ Learn more⁠ ][178] [ [Operators with tablet, processing plant] ][179] #### Integrated solutions & equipment #### [Integrated solutions & equipment][180] [ Learn more⁠ ][181] [ [Tetra Pak operators, maintenance service on filling machine] ][182] #### Services #### [Services][183] [ Learn more⁠ ][184] [ [White carton packages, Tetra Pak carton package portfolio] ][185] #### Product innovation #### [Product innovation][186] [ Learn more⁠ ][187] [ [Automated production line, automation solutions] ][188] #### Automation and digital solutions #### [Automation and digital solutions][189] [ Learn more⁠ ][190] ### Where we support you [cow icon] [ Dairy ][191] From white milk and flavoured milk to yoghurt and cream, tap into evolving consumer trends with a partner that can help you stay ahead in the dairy industry. [ice cream icon] [ Ice Cream ][192] From recipes and diverse flavours to product testing and new formats, we cover all aspects of ice cream production for small and large-scale needs. [Powder icon] [ Powder ][193] Discover integrated solutions, expertise and equipment for ingredient and nutritional powders and powdered food and drinks. [Beverage carton icon] [ Food supplement and nutrition ][194] This high-margin category includes products that provide additional nutrients to both healthy consumers and those with dietary restrictions or medical conditions. [beverage icon] [ Juice, Nectar & Still drinks ][195] Whether it’s adding fruit chunks, probiotics or more, we help you meet the latest consumer trends with a wide range of offerings. [cutlery icon] [ Food ][196] Get expert advice and optimised processing and packaging solutions for fruits, vegetables, baby food, ready-made dishes, and more. [chef's hat icon] [ New Food ][197] Explore how we’re advancing the potential of new food processes such as biomass, precision fermentation, and meat cultivation. [cheese icon] [ Cheese ][198] Harness our decades of industrial cheesemaking expertise, covering spreadable, fresh, semihard, whey, and beyond. [sprout icon] [ Plant-based products ][199] Access our global network of ingredient suppliers, state-of-the-art production lines, and packaging options for oats, soya, peas, nuts rice, and more. [beverage glass icon] [ Other beverages ][200] Whether it’s carbonated soft drinks, tea, or any other beverage, we have the know-how to help you compete successfully. [sustainability reports] ### Explore our latest ### Sustainability Report We remain committed to driving more secure and sustainable food systems, while mitigating climate impacts and improving the livelihoods of people across the world. Discover more about our progress and achievements in 2025 in our latest report. [ Explore the report⁠ ][201] ### Discover Tetra Pak [ [Tetra Park workers smiling and talking] ][202] #### Who we are We’re here to make food safe and available. It’s why we provide advanced food production systems. [ Learn more about us⁠ ][203] [ [three young people] ][204] #### Come work with us Curious about a career in the food industry? Joining Tetra Pak means becoming a valued part of a global community of dedicated experts. Together, we're working to expand food access worldwide by redefining the possibilities within food packaging and processing. [ Explore careers at Tetra Pak⁠ ][205] [hand holding a mobile phone] ### Contact Tetra Pak Any questions or queries about our company, our product and solution offerings, career opportunities or our sustainability approach? We are happy to answer your questions – please feel free to reach out [ Contact us⁠ ][206] *Where adequate collection, sorting and recycling infrastructures are in place, at scale. [ [Tetra Pak. Protects What's Good] ][207] * [ Contact Us ][208] * [ Tetra Laval Group ][209] * [ Legal and Privacy Information ][210] * [ Tetra Laval Code of Business Conduct ][211] * [ Cookie Policy ][212] * [ 沪ICP备17056308号-1 ][213] * [ © Tetra Pak International S.A. ][214] * [ Accessibility ][215] * [ FAQ ][216] [ Go to Top ][217] [1]: #skip-main-content-anchor [2]: https://www.tetrapak.com [3]: https://www.tetrapak.com/contact-us [4]: https://www.tetrapak.com/about-tetra-pak/careers [5]: https://www.tetrapak.com/about-tetra-pak/news-and-events/newsroom [6]: https://www.tetrapak.com/suppliers [7]: # [8]: https://www.tetrapak.com/my-tetra-pak [9]: #skip-nav-anchor [10]: https://www.tetrapak.com/contact-us [11]: https://www.tetrapak.com/about-tetra-pak/careers [12]: https://www.tetrapak.com/about-tetra-pak/news-and-events/newsroom [13]: https://www.tetrapak.com/suppliers [14]: # [15]: https://www.tetrapak.com/my-tetra-pak [16]: https://www.tetrapak.com/solutions [17]: https://www.tetrapak.com/solutions/categories [18]: https://www.tetrapak.com/solutions/categories/dairy [19]: https://www.tetrapak.com/solutions/categories/cheese-whey [20]: https://www.tetrapak.com/solutions/categories/food [21]: https://www.tetrapak.com/solutions/categories/juice-nectar-and-still-drinks [22]: https://www.tetrapak.com/solutions/categories/plant-based [23]: https://www.tetrapak.com/solutions/categories/powder [24]: https://www.tetrapak.com/solutions/categories/ice-cream [25]: https://www.tetrapak.com/solutions/categories/new-food [26]: https://www.tetrapak.com/solutions/categories/other-beverages [27]: https://www.tetrapak.com/solutions/categories/food-supplement-and-nutrition [28]: https://www.tetrapak.com/solutions/packaging [29]: https://www.tetrapak.com/solutions/packaging/packages [30]: https://www.tetrapak.com/solutions/packaging/packaging-material [31]: https://www.tetrapak.com/solutions/packaging/openings-and-closures [32]: https://www.tetrapak.com/solutions/packaging/differentiate [33]: https://www.tetrapak.com/solutions/product-innovation [34]: https://www.tetrapak.com/solutions/product-innovation/from-idea-to-market [35]: https://www.tetrapak.com/solutions/product-innovation/product-development-centres [36]: https://www.tetrapak.com/solutions/product-innovation/food-development-centres [37]: https://www.tetrapak.com/solutions/integrated-solutions-equipment [38]: https://www.tetrapak.com/solutions/integrated-solutions-equipment/design-and-build-plants [39]: https://www.tetrapak.com/solutions/integrated-solutions-equipment/processing-equipment [40]: https://www.tetrapak.com/solutions/integrated-solutions-equipment/filling-machines [41]: https://www.tetrapak.com/solutions/integrated-solutions-equipment/downstream-e", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "Tetra Pak International S.A. — channel participant (seed_file). Verify: Produces packaging materials including flexible packaging components, though primarily cartons. | Brand / Marketer; web_confirmed_flex_pack_player | Packaging material; Processing equipment; Packaging equipment; Closures; Filling machines | Switzerland | Pully, Switzerland", "role_description": "Brand / Marketer", "key_products": "Packaging material; Processing equipment; Packaging equipment; Closures; Filling machines"}}, "X Score": "74", "Y Score": "73", "Overall Score": "74", "Industry Category": "Others / Packaging", "Quadrant": "Leaders"}, {"Company": "Printpack, Inc.", "Website": "https://www.printpack.com", "Founded": "1956", "Headquarters": "USA", "Continent / Geography": "NA(United States)", "Operational Presence": "United States", "Ownership": "Private", "Employees": "3,200+", "Core Categories": "Flexible packaging (bags, pouches, wraps); Specialty rigid packaging (plastic containers, trays); Healthcare packaging (sterilizable pouches, forming films)", "Specialty Focus": "Produces flexible packaging for food, beverage, and personal care markets.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Brand / Marketer", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "", "Email": "CorpRecruiting@Printpack.com", "LinkedIn": "https://www.linkedin.com/company/printpack", "Office No.": "(404) 460-7000", "Country Code": "US", "Region Code": "NA", "Summary": "Printpack, Inc. — channel participant (chatgpt_recall). Verify: Printpack is a well-known flexible packaging converter producing bags, pouches, and wraps.", "Data Sources": "google_ai; openai_sdk_residual", "_crawl": {"founded_year": 1956}, "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Brand / Marketer", "verify_confidence": "95", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "printpack.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "printpack.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "** [ [Printpack] ][1] **\n* Company\n  \n  Company\n  \n  Why Printpack\n  \n  We are committed to Preserving and Enhancing People’s Lives™ by delivering a superior customer\n  experience, impactful insights, expert services, and industry-leading packaging.\n  \n  [Our Process][2]\n  \n  About Us\n  \n  [Overview][3] [History][4] [Associations][5] [Vendor Relations][6] [Printpack Packaging\n  Institute][7]\n  \n  Our Purpose\n  \n  [Mission and Vision][8] [Core Values][9] [Community Support][10] [Diversity and Communities][11]\n  [Locations][12]\n  [\n  [Careers]\n  \n  **Careers**\n  \n  Our founder attributed Printpack’s success to its people. Join our team to make an impact. Search\n  our current job openings today!\n  \n  ][13] [\n  [Internships]\n  \n  **Internships**\n  \n  As an intern at Printpack, the possibilities are endless. You'll walk away with hands-on\n  experience and skills.\n  \n  ][14]\n* What We Do\n  \n  What We Do\n  \n  What We Do\n  \n  At Printpack, we are industry leaders in flexible and specialty rigid packaging. We combine your\n  vision with our unique capabilities, knowledge of consumer trends, and a wide range of product\n  offerings in a variety of markets to enhance your brand and drive success.\n  \n  [Learn More][15]\n  \n  Capabilities\n  \n  [Our Process][16] [Flexible Packaging][17] [Digital Printing][18] [Healthcare Packaging][19]\n  [Specialty Rigid Packaging][20] [Enhancement Options][21]\n  \n  Services\n  \n  [Graphics and Prepress][22] [Analytical Lab][23] [Field Service Team][24] [Innovation\n  Sessions][25]\n  [\n  [Awards and Recognition]\n  \n  **Awards & Recognition**\n  \n  Our Awards and Recognition represent the pinnacle of achievement for our dedicated innovators\n  throughout the company who collaborate with our customers to produce packaging excellence.\n  \n  ][26] [\n  [Packaging Formats]\n  \n  **Packaging Formats**\n  \n  We take pride in developing various packaging formats and tailoring effective solutions that fit\n  our customers’ specific market needs.\n  \n  ][27]\n* Markets\n  \n  Markets\n  \n  Our Markets\n  \n  We develop custom packaging solutions for over 20 food and non-food markets. By collaborating with\n  our customers, we ensure their specific product requirements are reflected in quality packaging\n  products.\n  \n  [Markets Overview][28]\n  \n  Our Core Food Markets\n  \n  [Confectionery][29] [Fresh Produce][30] [Pet Care][31] [Snacks][32]\n  \n  Our Core Non-Food Markets\n  \n  [Healthcare][33]\n  [\n  [Innovation Sessions]\n  \n  **Innovation Sessions**\n  \n  Our innovation process helps brands recognize and resolve critical problems and capitalize on\n  opportunities.\n  \n  ][34] [\n  [Packaging Trends]\n  \n  **Packaging Trends**\n  \n  Learn how social and environmental events create massive opportunities for brands to capitalize on\n  current trends and what that means for their packaging.\n  \n  ][35] [\n  [Sustainability]\n  \n  **Sustainability**\n  \n  We are committed to helping our customers reach their sustainability goals with a dedicated\n  sustainable packaging portfolio, Printpack Preserve™.\n  \n  ][36]\n* Sustainability\n  \n  Sustainability\n  \n  Printpack Preserve™\n  \n  Now, more than ever before, brands in all categories are being challenged to use packaging and\n  processes that reduce emissions, minimize waste, and consume fewer natural resources. With\n  Printpack Preserve™, we have sustainable packaging solutions and dedicated expertise to support\n  our customers and lessen our impact on the environment.\n  \n  [Sustainability Overview][37]\n  \n  Sustainability Initiatives\n  \n  [Our Commitment][38] [Printpack Preserve™ Sustainable Structures][39] [Our Sustainability\n  Partners][40]\n  \n  Sustainable Materials\n  \n  [Recycled Content][41] [Recyclable Paper][42] [Recyclable Plastics][43]\n  [\n  [Sustainable Blogs]\n  \n  **Sustainable Blogs**\n  \n  Dive into our latest sustainable packaging articles and announcements.\n  \n  ][44]\n* Resources\n  \n  Resources\n  \n  Get Inspired\n  \n  We have all the tools needed to elevate your brand, including thought leaders"}}, "page_text": "** [ [Printpack] ][1] ** * Company Company Why Printpack We are committed to Preserving and Enhancing People’s Lives™ by delivering a superior customer experience, impactful insights, expert services, and industry-leading packaging. [Our Process][2] About Us [Overview][3] [History][4] [Associations][5] [Vendor Relations][6] [Printpack Packaging Institute][7] Our Purpose [Mission and Vision][8] [Core Values][9] [Community Support][10] [Diversity and Communities][11] [Locations][12] [ [Careers] **Careers** Our founder attributed Printpack’s success to its people. Join our team to make an impact. Search our current job openings today! ][13] [ [Internships] **Internships** As an intern at Printpack, the possibilities are endless. You'll walk away with hands-on experience and skills. ][14] * What We Do What We Do What We Do At Printpack, we are industry leaders in flexible and specialty rigid packaging. We combine your vision with our unique capabilities, knowledge of consumer trends, and a wide range of product offerings in a variety of markets to enhance your brand and drive success. [Learn More][15] Capabilities [Our Process][16] [Flexible Packaging][17] [Digital Printing][18] [Healthcare Packaging][19] [Specialty Rigid Packaging][20] [Enhancement Options][21] Services [Graphics and Prepress][22] [Analytical Lab][23] [Field Service Team][24] [Innovation Sessions][25] [ [Awards and Recognition] **Awards & Recognition** Our Awards and Recognition represent the pinnacle of achievement for our dedicated innovators throughout the company who collaborate with our customers to produce packaging excellence. ][26] [ [Packaging Formats] **Packaging Formats** We take pride in developing various packaging formats and tailoring effective solutions that fit our customers’ specific market needs. ][27] * Markets Markets Our Markets We develop custom packaging solutions for over 20 food and non-food markets. By collaborating with our customers, we ensure their specific product requirements are reflected in quality packaging products. [Markets Overview][28] Our Core Food Markets [Confectionery][29] [Fresh Produce][30] [Pet Care][31] [Snacks][32] Our Core Non-Food Markets [Healthcare][33] [ [Innovation Sessions] **Innovation Sessions** Our innovation process helps brands recognize and resolve critical problems and capitalize on opportunities. ][34] [ [Packaging Trends] **Packaging Trends** Learn how social and environmental events create massive opportunities for brands to capitalize on current trends and what that means for their packaging. ][35] [ [Sustainability] **Sustainability** We are committed to helping our customers reach their sustainability goals with a dedicated sustainable packaging portfolio, Printpack Preserve™. ][36] * Sustainability Sustainability Printpack Preserve™ Now, more than ever before, brands in all categories are being challenged to use packaging and processes that reduce emissions, minimize waste, and consume fewer natural resources. With Printpack Preserve™, we have sustainable packaging solutions and dedicated expertise to support our customers and lessen our impact on the environment. [Sustainability Overview][37] Sustainability Initiatives [Our Commitment][38] [Printpack Preserve™ Sustainable Structures][39] [Our Sustainability Partners][40] Sustainable Materials [Recycled Content][41] [Recyclable Paper][42] [Recyclable Plastics][43] [ [Sustainable Blogs] **Sustainable Blogs** Dive into our latest sustainable packaging articles and announcements. ][44] * Resources Resources Get Inspired We have all the tools needed to elevate your brand, including thought leadership blogs, award-winning packaging highlights, standard output packaging calculator tools, a packaging spec finder, and more. [Get Inspired][45] Information Centers [Awards & Recognition][46] [Frequently Asked Questions][47] [Our Blogs][48] Helpful Resources [X-ccelerator - Client Portal][49] [Pearl Library - Graphics][50] [ [Flexible Packaging Standard Calculator] **Flexible Packaging Standard Calculator** Convert standard packaging values in our comprehensive flexible packaging conversion tool. ][51] [ [Standard Packaging Structures Spec Finder] **Standard Packaging Structures Spec Finder** Find your recommended packaging structure with our packaging spec finder calculator. ][52] * [Careers][53] [Contact Us][54] # The Leader in Flexible & Specialty Rigid Packaging With our advanced printing methods, focus on sustainability, and extensive manufacturing and converting capabilities, we take your packaging to the next level. [Contact Us][55] [What We Offer][56] [Existing Customer?][57] ## Trusted by Leading Brands For more than 70 years, we’ve been at the forefront of packaging, delivering superior customer experiences fueled by impactful market insights, innovative sustainable packaging products, and rapidly scalable services that ensure our customers’ products stand out on the grocery shelves. 70+ ##### Years of Experience 3k ##### Associates 16 ##### Manufacturing Plants 150 ##### Iconic Brands Supported [Why-Printpack_puppy_petmarket_04.17.26] ## Why Printpack? [Best-In-Class Customer Service] #### Best-In-Class Customer Service We develop a true understanding of the customer as an organization and as individuals to build custom packaging solutions for their brand. [Innovative Solutions] #### Innovative Solutions We work with brands to create packaging that drives progress and achieves a competitive advantage in an ever-changing market. [Powerful Supply Chain Expertise] #### Powerful Supply Chain Expertise We’ll partner with you to design a customer-centric order and inventory management program to ensure your packaging supply chain runs smoothly, efficiently and transparently - every day. [Experts in Multiple Packaging Formats] #### Experts in Multiple Packaging Formats We help brands deliver custom, leading-edge package designs that stand out on the shelf in a wide variety of markets. [Learn About Our Process][58] ## Our Key Capabilities Printpack leads the packaging industry in manufacturing capabilities while delivering a best-in-class customer experience. We are committed to Preserving and Enhancing People’s Lives through sustainability, efficient processes, and providing quality products to our customers and consumers. [Our-Key-Capabilities_Flexible_12.5.25_768px] [Trusted Manufacturing Capabilities in Flexible Packaging] #### Flexible Packaging Our vertically integrated manufacturing approach includes flexographic, rotogravure, and digital printing, along with extrusion and adhesive lamination capabilities. [Our-Key-Capabilities_Rigid_12.5.25] [Specialty Rigid Packaging Innovations] #### Specialty Rigid Packaging Our specialty rigid packaging includes barrier co-extrusion and thermoforming capabilities. [Our Key Capabilities_Medical_6.11.26] [Medical Packaging] #### Healthcare Packaging Our healthcare packaging includes header bags, peelable pouches, and forming films that protect the integrity of medical devices and equipment. [pp-value-added-services_graphics-and-prepress] [pp-value-added-services_graphics-and-prepress_mobile] [Analytical Lab - Analytical Services Facility] [Analytical Lab - Analytical Services Facility] [Field Service Team] [Field Service Team] [Printpack’s Innovation Process] [Printpack’s Innovation Process] ## Value-Added Services ### Graphics and Prepress We offer a multitude of the latest prepress technologies for exceptional print quality. Improved color saturation, ink transfer, image highlight detail, and expanded tonal range are just a few of the ways we can improve the visual impact of your package. [Learn More][59] ### Analytical Lab Our Analytical Services Facility has a state-of-the art analytics lab, a pilot plant equipped with converting and packing machinery, and a full-service machine shop. Need pre-commercial assessment? Lifecycle analysis? Market testing? At Printpack we specialize in bringing your innovative concepts to life. [Learn More][60] ### Field Service Team The subject matter experts who make up our Field Service Team come from many manufacturing arenas. They bring years of experience in printing, extrusion, adhesive laminating, and more. These specialists often go above and beyond the call of duty during technical service work such as scheduled visits, material disposition, and troubleshooting your machinery lines. [Learn More][61] ### Innovation Sessions Printpack’s innovation process helps brands recognize and resolve critical problems and capitalize on opportunities. With innovation, brands can drive progress and achieve a competitive advantage in an ever-changing market. [Learn More][62] [Sustainability banner PRINTPACK WEBSITE HOMEPAGE] [Printpack Preserve] ## Sustainability We believe that the use of sustainable materials for packaging is the future. With our dedicated Sustainability Team, Printpack helps empower brands to align with consumer sentiment, comply with regulations, and stand out as a sustainability leader. In developing Printpack Preserve™ packaging structures which include recycled content, recyclable plastic, and paper, and with over 100 How2Recycle pre-qualified structures, we are committed to helping our customers not only improve their speed to market but also meet their sustainability goals. [Our Sustainability Initiatives][63] [Recycled content packaging] ##### Circular and Renewable Content [Curbside Recyclable Paper] ##### Curbside Recyclable Paper [Recyclable Polyethylene] ##### Recyclable Plastics * Best-In-Class Customer Service * Reliability * Proactivity * Scale Up * Market Insights * Sustainability * Speed and Agility * World-Class Supply Chain Expertise * Packaging Innovation * Continuous Excellence ## Our Customers Love Us [Quotes] “Everyone was respectful and patient, and they communicated and taught until we knew, and we could sell it.” [Printpack Snack Customer] ###### — Printpack Snack Customer [Quotes] “They’re very high quality, they’re very capable and they have a fantastic Innovation Center. They’re on the leading edge.” [Printpack Fresh Produce Customer] ###### — Printpack Fresh Produce Customer [Quotes] “Printpack is one of the few suppliers that have actual representatives that are onsite with them, which speaks to the strategic aspect of their relationship.” [Printpack Pet Care Customer] ###### — Printpack Pet Care Customer [Quotes] “After that first order Printpack got 100% of our business. There were some who questioned that, but when good business relationships come along you keep them intact. It was like one big family. We got in plenty of jams, and Printpack got us out.” [Printpack Confectionery Customer] ###### — Printpack Confectionery Customer ## Trending Packaging News [View More Blogs][64] #### Printpack Marks 70 Years of Innovation by Winning the Most FPA Awards in 2026 ATLANTA, GA — Printpack is proud to announce that on March 19, 2026, the Flexible Packaging Association (FPA) awarded the company four Flexible Packaging Achievement Awards, the most of&n... [Learn More][65] #### What 70 Years in Packaging Tells Us About What You’ll Face Next [icon date] July 28, 2026 The packaging industry doesn’t stand still, and neither do the pressures on your business. Supply chains tighten. Consumer expectations shift. Regulations close in. What […] [Learn More][66] #### Printpack Marks Sustainability Progress in New Report ATLANTA, GA — Printpack, a leading privately held flexible and specia", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "Printpack, Inc. — channel participant (chatgpt_recall). Verify: Printpack is a well-known flexible packaging converter producing bags, pouches, and wraps. | Produces flexible packaging for food, beverage, and personal care markets. | Flexible packaging (bags, pouches, wraps); Specialty rigid packaging (plastic containers, trays); Healthcare packaging (sterilizable pouches, forming films) | United States | USA", "role_description": "Brand / Marketer", "key_products": "Flexible packaging (bags, pouches, wraps); Specialty rigid packaging (plastic containers, trays); Healthcare packaging (sterilizable pouches, forming films)"}}, "X Score": "76", "Y Score": "70", "Overall Score": "73", "Industry Category": "Others / Packaging", "Quadrant": "Leaders"}, {"Company": "Ahlstrom", "Website": "https://ahlstrom.com", "Founded": "1851", "Headquarters": "seed_file", "Continent / Geography": "", "Operational Presence": "", "Ownership": "Publicly traded", "Employees": "7000", "Core Categories": "Fiber-based materials, specialty papers, nonwovens", "Specialty Focus": "Brand / Marketer; web_confirmed_flex_pack_player", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly d