ourth quarter performance despite challenging environment][11]\n[Amcor announces key leadership appointments to accelerate growth]\n\n## Amcor announces key leadership appointments to accelerate growth\n\n[Read more: Amcor announces key leadership appointments to accelerate growth][12]\n[Amcor achieves cleanroom certification in Puerto Rico]\n\n## Amcor achieves cleanroom certification in Puerto Rico\n\nThe certification expands the Amcor global cleanroom thermoforming network, strengthening its\ncommitment to healthcare packaging.\n\n[Read more: Amcor achieves cleanroom certification in Puerto Rico][13]\n[Amcor introduces recycle-ready dip cup packaging to help brands meet sustainability regulations]\n\n## Amcor introduces recycle-ready dip cup packaging to help brands meet sustainability regulations\n\n[Read More: Amcor introduces recycle-ready dip cup packaging to help brands meet sustainability\nregulations][14]\n[Amcor’s Q3 FY26 earnings results in line with expectations, demonstrating resilience in a\nchallenging environment.]\n\n## Amcor’s Q3 FY26 earnings results in line with expectations, demonstrating resilience in a\n## challenging environment.\n\n[Read more: Amcor’s Q3 FY26 earnings results in line with expectations, demonstrating resilience in\na challenging environment.][15]\n[Apex™ jars help pasta sauce brands reduce costs and improve performance]\n\n## Apex™ jars help pasta sauce brands reduce costs and improve performance\n\n[Read more: Apex™ jars help pasta sauce brands reduce costs and improve performance][16]\n\n\"With our global reach, innovative capabilities and exceptional talent, we are transforming the\nindustry and how the world sees packaging.\"\n\nPeter Konieczny, Amcor CEO\n\n## Our market segments\n\n### As a global leader in packaging solutions for consumer and healthcare products, our\n### industry-leading innovation capabilities, global scale and technical expertise help our\n### customers grow and meet the needs of millions of consumers every day.\n\n[\n\nAgriculture & horticulture\n\n][17]\n[\n\nAnimal & pet care\n\n][18]\n[\n\nBeauty & personal care\n\n][19]\n[\n\nBeverages\n\n][20]\n[\n\nBuilding & construction\n\n][21]\n[\n\nDIY\n\n][22]\n[\n\nFood\n\n][23]\n[\n\nFood service\n\n][24]\n[\n\nGarden & outdoor\n\n][25]\n[\n\nHealthcare\n\n][26]\n[\n\nHome care\n\n][27]\n[\n\nSpecialty cartons\n\n][28]\n[\n\nTechnical applications\n\n][29]\n[Image]\n\n## Explore Berry products. Continue your search here.\n\nUnlock our expanded portfolio of innovative, high-performance packaging.\n\n[View products: Explore Berry products. Continue your search here.][30]\n\n## Equipment and services\n\n### With extensive innovation capabilities and platforms, material science expertise and specialized\n### tooling, design and multi-component assembly capabilities, we deliver solutions to our\n### customers’ complex challenges.\n\n## Amcor around the globe\n\n### With a presence in over 40 countries, we bring global capabilities to local customers and\n### provide local access to global brands.\n\n[+400 locations]\n\n+\n\nlocations\n\n[+75,000 colleagues]\n\n+\n\ncolleagues\n\n[+40 countries]\n\n+\n\ncountries\n\n[US$ 23 billion in annualized sales]\n\nUS$\n\nbillion in annualized sales\n\n\n\n## Events and conferences\n\n### As a global packaging leader, we connect with customers, investors, suppliers and other\n### stakeholders at events and conferences worldwide.\n\n[See all events][31]\n[Products][32][Agriculture & Horticulture][33][Animal & Pet Care][34][Beauty & Personal\nCare][35][Beverages][36][Building & Construction][37][DIY][38][Food][39][Food Service][40][Garden &\nOutdoors][41][Healthcare][42]"}}, "page_text": "You need to enable JavaScript to run this app. [ [Amcor Logo Transparent Navigation bar] ][1][Skip to main content][2] * [Products][3] * [Sustainability][4] * [Investors][5] * [Careers][6] * [Insights][7] * [News][8] * [About][9] * [Contact][10] # Global Packaging Solutions [FY26 results: Stro