Desk\n\n[\n\nDISCLOSURES UNDER REGULATION 46 OF THE LODR\n\n][92] [\n\nTDS ON DIVIDEND\n\n][93]\n[INVESTOR SERVICES][94] [\n\nINTEGRATED GOVERNANCE REPORT\n\n][95] [MEMORANDUM AND ARTICLES OF ASSOCIATION][96] [CORPORATE GOVERNANCE REPORT][97] [E VOTING][98]\n[FINAL DEMAND CUM FORFEITURE NOTICE][99] [INVESTOR FORMS][100] [POSTAL BALLOTS][101] [RECONCILIATION\nOF SHARE CAPITAL AUDIT REPORT][102] [SHARES TRANSFERRED TO IEPF DEMAT AC][103] [UNCLAIMED\nDIVIDEND][104]\n[Events][105] [Submit an Enquiry][106]\n\n[BSE Tracker |][107] [NSE Tracker][108]\n\nThis website uses cookies to ensure you get the best experience on our website.\n\nReject All Cookies\nAccept All Cookies\n[ ][109] [ ][110]\n[ ][111] [ ][112]\n[ ][113] [ ][114]\n[ ][115] [ ][116]\n\nGarware Hi-Tech Films, a global leader with over 90 years of legacy, epitomizes technology,\ninnovation, and excellence in Suncontrol Window Films, Paint Protection Films and Polyester Films.\nOur Suncontrol Window Films are revolutionizing spaces by enhancing cooling efficiency across\nresidential, commercial, and automotive sectors, while driving substantial energy savings. At the\nforefront of automotive protection, our Paint Protection Films have set industry standards with\npioneering technology and unmatched resilience. Our Speciality Films (BOPET) represents the pinnacle\nof innovation, setting benchmarks across diverse applications from shrink films to thermal films to\nlidding films to liner films. In Architecture business, our films showcase unparalleled excell"}}, "page_text": "[×][1] [Home][2] ## Sun Control Films [Home][3] ## Products ## Safety Glazing [ Ice Cool Shield SG ][4] [ Ice Cool Elite SG ][5] [ Artic Cool SG ][6] [ Artic Cool Shield SG ][7] [ Sunroof / Moonroof ][8] [ Rooftop ][9] ## Gold [ Arctic Cool ][10] [ Arctic Cool Shield ][11] [ Icecool Elite ][12] [ Icecool Shield ][13] [ Instacool ][14] [ Instacool Shield ][15] ## Silver [ Classic Lite ][16] [ Classic Lite Shield ][17] [ Cool Vision Shield ][18] [ Glaze QDP Lite ][19] [ Glaze QDP Lite Shield ][20] [ NF Lite ][21] ## Bronze [ International Lite ][22] [ International Smoke Lite ][23] [ International SRC ][24] [ Solar Lite ][25] [ Solarlite Shield ][26] [ Fronty Plus ][27] [ Fronty ][28] [Blogs][29] ## Paint Protection Films [Home][30] ## Product [ Titanium PPF ][31] [ Premium PPF ][32] [ Glaze PPF ][33] [ Plus PPF ][34] [ Matte PPF ][35] [ Black PPF ][36] [ White PPF ][37] [ Coloured PPF ][38] [ Protect PPF ][39] [Blogs][40] [Influencers][41] [GICI][42] [Locate Us][43] ## Garware Detailing Solutions [Home][44] ## Product [ Graphene Coating ][45] [ Ceramic Coating ][46] [Blogs][47] ## Architectural Films [Home][48] ## Products ## Platina [ Spectrally Selective Films ][49] [ Deco Vista Film ][50] [ IR Rejection Film ][51] [ Defendo Charcoal Film ][52] [ 7 Mil Safety Film ][53] [ 8 Mil Safety Film ][54] ## Premium [ HP Film ][55] [ 4 Mil Safety Film ][56] [ Whiteboard Film ][57] [ Writable Film ][58] [ Antigraffity Film ][59] ## Classic [ Reflective Film ][60] [ Privacy Film ][61] [ Designer Film ][62] ## Experience Center [ Commercial ][63] [ Office Cabin ][64] [ Exterior Facade ][65] [ Glass Door or Glass Railing ][66] [Blogs][67] [Explore][68] [ROI Calculator][69] ## Garware Home Solutions [Home][70] ## Product [ Spectra Glaze 70 Exterior ][71] [ Spectra Glaze 70 Interior ][72] [ Dual Reflect Pro Charcoal 45 ][73] [ Dual Reflect Pro Charcoal 25 ][74] [ Secure Guard 4 Mil ][75] [ Secure Plus 7 Mil ][76] [ Ultima Heat Rejection Grey 70 ][77] [ Optima Heat Rejection Black 60 ][78] [ Dual Reflect Pro Charcoal 15 ][79] [ Ultima Heat Rejection Natural 70 ][80] [Blogs][81] ## Industrial Film [Home][82] ## Products [ Shrink PET Films ][83] [ Lidding ][84] [ Liner ][85] [ Electrical & Electronics ][86] [ Metallized Films ][87] [ Graphics ][88] [ Thermal ][89] [ Packaging ][90] [Blogs][91] ## Investor Desk [ DISCLOSURES UNDER REGULATION 46 OF THE LODR ][92] [ TDS ON DIVIDEND ][93] [INVESTOR SERVICES][94] [ INTEGRATED GOVERNANCE REPORT ][95] [MEMORANDUM AND ARTICLES OF ASSOCIATION][96] [CORPORATE GOVERNANCE REPORT][97] [E VOTING][98] [FINAL DEMAND CUM FORFEITURE NOTICE][99] [INVESTOR FORMS][100] [POSTAL BALLOTS][101] [RECONCILIATION OF SHARE CAPITAL AUDIT REPORT][102] [SHARES TRANSFERRED TO IEPF DEMAT AC][103] [UNCLAIMED DIVIDEND][104] [Events][105] [Submit an Enquiry][106] [BSE Tracker |][107] [NSE Tracker][108] This website uses cookies to ensure you get the best experience on our website. Reject All Cookies Accept All Cookies [ ][109] [ ][110] [ ][111] [ ][112] [ ][113] [ ][114] [ ][115] [ ][116] Garware Hi-Tech Films, a global leader with over 90 years of legacy, epitomizes technology, innovation, and excellence in Suncontrol Window Films, Paint Protection Films and Polyester Films. Our Suncontrol Window Films are revolutionizing spaces by enhancing cooling efficiency across residential, commercial, and automotive sectors, while driving substantial energy savings. At the forefront of automotive protection, our Paint Protection Films have set industry standards with pioneering technology and unmatched resilience. Our Speciality Films (BOPET) represents the pinnacle of innovation, setting benchmarks across diverse applications from shrink films to thermal films to lidding films to liner films. In Architecture business, our films showcase unparalleled excellence, offering superior UV protection and energy efficiency, advancing both comfort and sustainable solutions for future generations. ## Businesses [Image 1] [ Sun Control FilmsImprove your car’s engine longevity and driving comfort by blocking sunlight and managing heat dispersion. ][117] [Image 4] [ Paint Protection FilmsPreserve your car’s look for years to come with a self-healing, scratch-resistant invisible film. ][118] [Image 3] [ Architectural FilmsOptimize indoor energy use with secure window films that preserve your view. ][119] [Image 2] [ Industrial FilmsHighly customisable, eco-friendly protective films suitable for packaging labels and shrink films. ][120] ## Technological Leadership [Technological Leadership] ### Technological Leadership * World's No. 1 Vertically Integrated 'Chip to Film' Manufacturing Company* * Top company in the world to have patented the manufacturing of base Industrial film * Manufactured by its Unique Deep Dyeing Technology in Sun control films * Leading Window Film Manufacturer Operating From A Single World-Class Facility* * Top Exporter Awards for 40 years from PLEXCOUNCIL * Winner of CII Technology & Innovation Award ### 90 Years of Legacy [EXPLORE][121] Our commitment to the vision of our honourable and respected founder the Late Padma Bhushan Dr. Bhalchandra Garware, has been central to our growth as an organization. His dedication to serving our partners and customers with diligence, dynamism, and competence continues to guide us. This vision, along with our core values, is instrumental in our success, establishing us as trusted manufacturers of Industrial films in the world. ### Shaping the Future Our inspirations, leaders and motivators. [EXPLORE][122] ## Making a Mark Our achievements speak for the quality of our products and the trust we’ve established over the years. > [Award Icon 5] Winner of CII Technology & Innovation Award [Award Icon 6] Copious Safety Awards [Award Icon 7] Export Award by Plexcouncil for Industrial film [Award Icon 8] Top Exporter Awards for 4 Decades ## Going Beyond Boundaries We have a commanding global presence and are recognized as one of the top companies in the world for producing premium quality dyed Industrial films. [Garware Presence In The World] ## Events [ [Road Safety] ##### Road Safety & Sustainable Mobility 23rd - 24th April 2026 | Delhi ][123] [ [Events of Paint Protection Film] ##### Garware Application Studio April - 2026 ][124] [ [Events of Paint Protection Film] ##### Events of Paint Protection Film February - 2026 | Delhi ][125] [EXPLORE][126] ## Pillars of Strength [Integrity Icon 1] #### Integrity We are ethical in our conduct and always do the right thing, even when no one’s watching. [Customer-centric Icon 2] #### Customer-centric We always deliver excellent products, services and experiences to our customers to create loyalty and advocacy. [Quality-focused Icon 3] #### Quality-focused Our relentless focus on quality helps us make industry-leading products. [Innovative Icon 4] #### Innovative Our passion to excel in all aspects of our business leads us to find newer and better solutions. ## Garware Community Centres GHFL has set up community centres in N-7, CIDCO, Aurangabad and Waluj village, Gangapur in order to raise awareness amongst all age groups by conducting social, cultural, educational, and sports awareness activities that enable the comprehensive development of an entire community. The centres are registered under the Bombay Public Trust Act 1950 as Charitable Public Trust. [EXPLORE][127] [Garware Community Centres] [Garware Sustainability] ## An Unwavering Resolve Sustainability! While we’re constantly giving back to society, we are also aware of the misuse of resources in our industry. We have, therefore, established an R&D team that is constantly developing sustainable ways to utilise, recycle, and reuse material. [EXPLORE][128] ## Become A Partner Be a part of one of the most proactive, dynamic, and tech-savvy teams in our field. [LET'S CONNECT][129] [[Garware Hitech Films Logo White]][130] [Polyester Films (BOPET)][131] [Paint Protection Films][132] [Architectural Films][133] [Sun Control Films][134] [Garware Detailing Solutions][135] [Garware Home Solutions][136] [Privacy Policy][137] [Terms and Conditions][138] Copyright © 2024 Garware Hi-Tech Films. All rights reserved. [[Facebook Icon]][139] [[Twitter Icon]][140] [[LinkedIn Icon]][141] [[Instagram Icon]][142] [[Youtube Icon]][143] Copyright © 2024 Garware Hi-Tech Films. All rights reserved. [1]: javascript:void(0) [2]: https://www.garwarehitechfilms.com [3]: https://www.garwarehite