] * [Protection films for deep drawing][15] * [Protection films for coated metal][16] * [Protection films for plastic sheets][17] * [Protection films for plastic profiles][18] * [Protection films for glass][19] * [Protection films for carpets][20] * [Protection films for furniture & interior design][21] * [Protection Films Automotive][22] **Protection Films Automotive** Our automotive protective films protect sensitive surfaces on and in the automobile from damage – from production to handover to the new owner. [Show all][23] * [Car paint][24] * [Surfaces Exterior][25] * [Surfaces Interior][26] * [Agricultural Films][27] **Agricultural Films** Whether you’re a farmer or contractor, we have the right film solution for everyone. From cultivation to harvesting and transport, your precious yield is guaranteed protection. We also offer protective solutions to amateur gardeners via the DIY market. [Show all][28] * [Agricultural Stretch Films][29] * [Silage Films][30] * [Greenhouse Films][31] * [Perforated Stretch Films][32] * [Banana Farming Solutions][33] * [Protection during transportation][34] **Protection during transportation** With our protection solutions for use during transportation, your goods arrive safely at their destination whilst also additionally being protected on site during handling and storage, whatever their size or structure. [Show all][35] * [Stretch Films ][36] * [Stretch Hoods][37] * [Cargo Films][38] * [Container Liner][39] * [Films for Dunnage Bags][40] * [Cover sheets][41] * [Films for dust & dirt protection][42] * [Films for online & mail ordering][43] * [Stretch Films ][44] **Stretch Films ** Our Stretch Film portfolio offers you the optimal securing of your loading units – time saving, reliable and cost-effective. [Show all][45] * [Hand Stretch Films][46] * [Machine Stretch Films][47] * [Coreless Machine Stretch][48] * [Pre-Stretch Films][49] * [Perforated stretch films][50] * [Coreless MiniStretch][51] * [Laminating Films][52] **Laminating Films** Whether as a sealing medium, interlayer in a laminate, printing film, for use in a non-food or food application or whether you are searching for a classic or mono-material version, you will find the right solution in our range of laminating films. [Show all][53] * [Classical Lamination Films][54] * [PE- & PP films for mono-material solutions][55] * [Barrier Films][56] * [Printing Films][57] * [MDO Films][58] * [Laminating Films for Tube Laminates][59] * [Film solutions for rigid packaging][60] * [Label Films][61] **Label Films** Our label film range has the right film for you when it comes to the production of labels including speciality films and award-winning sustainable solutions. [Show all][62] * [Classical Label Films][63] * [Sustainable Label Film Solutions][64] * [Special Label Film Applications][65] * [Process & Carrier Films][66] **Process & Carrier Films** Whether as a carrier film or a layered component our process films complement your project perfectly because, as the name suggests, they are designed to ensure your processes operate as smoothly and efficiently as possible. [Show all][67] * [Carrier films for coating][68] * [Room-temperature laminating Films][69] * [Films for siliconization][70] * [Thermoplastic hot melt adhesive Films][71] * [Packaging Films][72] **Packaging Films** Whether as primary or secondary packaging for the food sector or online mail order business, we have the right film solution for you. Our packaging films are characterised by ideal process efficiency and reliable processing properties. [Show all][73] * [Shrink Films][74] * [Automated Films][75] * [FFS solutions][76] * [Banding Films][77] * [Cling Films][78] * [Bag-in-box Films][79] * [Films for online & mail ordering][80] * [Solutions for construction & renovation][81] **Solutions for construction & renovation** Whether it’s a construction site or a renovation project, with our self-adhesive and non-adhesive film solutions for covering and insulation purposes, along with additional painter and decorator supplies, with us you will always make the right choice. [Show all][82] * [Masking Films – self-adhesive][83] * [Masking Films – non adhesive][84] * [Construction Films][85] * [PA Premium Film for Covering][86] * [Vapour Barrier Films][87] * [Painter & Stuccoer Supplies][88] * [Fluff-to-Film Garbage bag][89] * [Industries][90] **Industries** Always the right film solution, no matter what industry you are in, that is our guarantee. That is exactly why we don’t just produce high-quality films, but rely on in-depth knowledge and understanding of their areas of application and the necessary standards required. Get an idea now of where our films are already being used with precision. [Show all][91] * [Construction][92] * [Processing Industry][93] * [Agricultural & Horticulture][94] * [Medicine & Pharmaceuticals][95] * [Hygiene & Cosmetics][96] * [Food & Pet Food][97] * [Logistics & Shipping][98] * [Mobility & Automotive Solutions][99] * [House & Home][100] * [Subgroups][101] * [POLIFILM GROUP][102] **POLIFILM GROUP** We are an internationally focused family business and global leader in the manufacturer of extruded and protective film solutions which we have successfully expanded through decades of experience as well as modern technologies to include recycling and the establishment of circular cycles. [Show all][103] * [Locations][104] * [Our certifications][105] * [Sustainability][106] * [Association memberships][107] * [Career][108] * [Events][109] * [Press][110] * [POLIFILM PROTECTION][111] **POLIFILM PROTECTION** For over 50 years, we have been developing self-adhesive film solutions for the temporary protection of high-quality surfaces. Our global production, distribution, and partner network ensure optimal product availability and proximity to customers. [Show all][112] * [How we work][113] * [Our quality managment][114] * [Our application engineering & development][115] * [Sustainability PROTECTION][116] * [Locations PROTECTION][117] * [Association memberships][118] * [Upcoming Events][119] * [PERFORMANCE FILMS][120] **PERFORMANCE FILMS** Five product segments, four production sites, two sales areas – one goal: PE & PP films that perform. We are committed to designing our solutions to optimise your processes, strengthen your products and move forward together. [Show all][121] * [About us][122] * [Our solutions][123] * [Sustainability][124] * [Our locations][125] * [Upcoming Events][126] * [POLIFILM CAST][127] **POLIFILM CAST** With an exceptionally experienced team, state-of-the-art production technology and a clear focus on customer orientation, we offer tailor-made stretch films for the most diverse packaging requirements. [Show all][128] * [About us][129] * [Our stretch film solutions][130] * [The Rolling Lab | NEW!][131] * [POLIFILM TRADING][132] **POLIFILM TRADING** With more than 20 years of experience and success in the construction, DIY, painting and decorating, gardening and protective packaging markets, we are your sourcing partner both within and outside the POLIFILM Group for films and their related portfolios. [Show all][133] * [JUFOL][134] * [AM Folien][135] * [RIPAC][136] * [POLICYCLE][137] **POLICYCLE** We are many things to our customers: Disposal company, RecycClass-certified recycler, recyclate supplier, film manufacturer. The element that underpins it all: the sustainable use of plastic as a recyclable material. [Show all][138] * [POLICYCLE CONCEPT][139] * [RECYCLING][140] * [Fluff-to-film][141] * [Fluff-to-Film garbage bag][142] * [Upcoming Events][143] * [Sustainability][144] * [Career][145] **Career** Careers with prospects in a family environment, worldwide, that’s what POLIFILM can offer. Whether you are just starting your career or well established in the workplace, if you appreciate a good working environment and want to forward your career with us, you will find a suitable opportunity with POLIFILM. [Show all][146] * [Vacancies][147] * [Professionals][148] * [