rformance for Sustainability\n\n[ProActive Recyclable Film Products]\n\n### ProAmpac’s ProActive Recyclable films are engineered to replace hard-to-recycle laminated\n### structures\n\n# [Kick it to the Curb!]\n\nWe offer an ever-expanding selection of curbside recyclable fiber products to replace your\nconventional, non-recyclable packaging.\n\n[Learn more about our ProActive Recyclable Fiber Solutions  * *][63]\nPrevious Next\n\n##### Modified Atmosphere Sandwich Wedge\n\nYour browser does not support the video tag.\n[Learn More about Fresh Food To-Go Products][64]\n\n##### Food-To-Go Frenzy\n\nYour browser does not support the video tag.\n[Learn More about Fresh Food To-Go Products][65]\nUpcoming **Event**\nJoin us at lunch! - Tulalip, WA\n* *  September 16-17 - Booth L349\n\n## ProAmpac is a leading global flexible packaging manufacturer.\n\nWe provide creative packaging solutions, industry-leading customer service, and award-winning\ninnovation to a diverse global marketplace.\n\nProAmpac's [ProActive Sustainability][66]® delivers flexible packaging products that help brands\nachieve sustainable goals.\n\n##### Success Stories\n\n* *\n\nGet Value from your Packaging!\n\n##### Innovation through material science\n\n* *\n\nOur Material Science. Your Material Difference.\n\n##### MAKR packaging design portal\n\n* *\n\nDesign your own packaging!\n\n##### CIC – Collaboration and Innovation Center\n\n* *\n\nCollaborate with Us.\n\n[Image]\n\n##### ProAmpac’s launch of our 2026 annual Impact Report outlines not only the successes we have\n##### achieved but also the long-term strategy we continue to execute.\n\n[Get the ProAmpac 2026 Impact Report  * *][67]\n\n[MAKR Logo]\n\n#### Create custom flexible packaging prototypes from anywhere!\n\n[Get Started Now * *][68]\n\n[Image]\nYour browser does not support the video tag. ProAmpac - Flexible packaging for a better today and\ntomorrow\n\n## Latest **News**\n\n[Packaging That Protects Every Bite]\n\n###### What's NewAug 11, 2026\n\n##### Packaging That Protects Every Bite\n\n[Learn More ][69]\n[Explore Our 2026 Impact Report]\n\n#####"}}, "page_text": "[][1] * **Choose Your Region** * [ Europe][2] * [ North America][3] * [ View All Regions][4] * [Advanced Coatings][5] * [Fiberization][6] * [Flexible Packaging][7] * [Kraft Paper Rolls][8] * [Rollstock][9] * [Pouches][10] * [Bags][11] * [Beyond Flexible][12] * [Labels][13] * [Lidding][14] * [Manufacturing Expertise][15] * [Markets We Serve][16] * [Agriculture][17] * [E-Commerce][18] * [Food & Beverage][19] * [Food Service][20] * [Grocery & Retail][21] * [Healthcare][22] * [Home & Personal Care][23] * [Industrial & Office Supplies][24] * [Lawn & Garden][25] * [Pet][26] * [Protein][27] * [Secure and Tamper-Evident Packaging][28] * [Innovation & Material Science][29] * [Advanced Science Labs][30] * [Partners in Science][31] * [Technical Talent & Expertise][32] * [CIC – Collaboration and Innovation Center][33] * [DASL – Design & Sample Lab][34] * [IDEA – Our approach to Innovation][35] * [LEAD – ProAmpac Flexible Packaging Academy][36] * [Evolutionary & Revolutionary Solutions][37] * [MAKR by DASL – Pouch Prototyping][38] * [MAKR Login][39] * [Sustainability][40] * [Sustainable Packaging][41] * [Operations Sustainability][42] * [Social Sustainability][43] * [ProAmpac Impact Report][44] * [Life Cycle Analysis Tool – ProActive CHART][45] * [ Shop][46] [[ProAmpac Logo]][47] English Français [My Account][48] * [About][49] * [Global Reach][50] * [ProAmpac Impact Report][51] * [Quality Certifications][52] * [Media Center][53] * [Press Releases][54] * [What's New][55] * [Awards][56] * [Events][57] * [Videos][58] * [Webinars][59] * [Success Stories][60] * [Careers][61] * [Contact][62] # [Impact '26 - Read the Report] # [Foiled Again? Need to replace foil in your packaging? Learn more.] # [Dream it. Build it.] MAKR by DASL puts the power to create custom flexible packaging prototypes in your hands. # ProActive Recyclable Films ## Never Sacrifice