micals][58] * [Transport and Logistics][59] * [Decorative Surfaces][60] * [Ceiling Tiles][61] * [Doors][62] * [Flooring][63] * [Furniture][64] * [Brands][65] * [EXTENDO®][66] * [NATIVIA®][67] * [SHAPE360®][68] * [Titanium™][69] * [reLIFE™][70] * [BioPP][71] * [Derprosa™][72] * [SynDECOR®][73] * [Edama][74] * [Sustainability][75] * [Dynamic Cycle™][76] * [reDESIGN™][77] * [Reports][78] * [News & Stories][79] * [News][80] * [Stories][81] * [Case studies][82] * [Ti Talks][83] * [Ti News Magazine][84] * [About us][85] * [Taghleef Industries Group][86] * [Associations][87] * [Investors][88] * [Ethics & Compliance][89] * [Terms of Sale][90] * * [reDESIGN™][91] * [Product Finder][92] * [Work with us][93] * [Certifications][94] * [Resources][95] * [Contact us][96] [ Login ][97] / [Register][98] Search for: # Together we Innovate™ ## We produce sustainable packaging films ## that respect food and people We foster [sustainable innovation][99] by developing breakthrough BOPP, CPP and BOPLA packaging solutions that help protect products, avoid food waste, improve safety and hygiene, facilitate recycling processes and support a greener lifestyle. Our expertise and commitment to innovation and sustainability helped us achieve excellence in manufacturing advanced packaging films solutions to meet the requirements of our partners and customers. Each product line is designed with the highest specifications, characteristics, and benefits, based on the organization’s best practices in product innovation and supply chain optimization. ## Together we innovate ## for future generations Dynamic Cycle™ is our holistic approach to sustainability. Our aim is to look beyond the industry and focus on developing breakthrough solutions that impact people’s lives with today and tomorrow in mind. [Find out more][100] ## Explore our packaging films solutions Taghleef Industries is a global manufacturer of PP-based, biobased and biodegradable packaging films for flexible packaging, labeling, graphic arts and technical applications, which are designed to meet the highest quality and most demanding requirements across industries. [ [Flexible Packaging Films] ## Flexible Packaging Films ][101] [ [Label films] ## Label Films ][102] [ [Laminating Films for Graphic Arts products] ## Laminating Films for Graphic Arts ][103] [ [Decorative surfaces] ## Films for Decorative Surfaces ][104] [ [Films for Visual - Products Image] ## Graphic Films for Visual Communication, Signage & Advertising ][105] 01/06 ### The latest edition of Ti News is now available! [Click to read Ti News today][106] [Ti News Home page banner] 02/06 ### Derprosa™ bioBLUE 30. Laminating films made with 30% of resins obtained from renewable resources ### of vegetable origin such as waste cooking oil (second generation feedstock) [Know more][107] [Derprosa bioBlue Biobased polypropylene films.] 03/06 ### Cheese & dairy packaging innovations [Know more][108] 04/06 ### Shrink label films: shaping your product’s sustainable image [Know more][109] [Plastic container of gentle shampoo.] 05/06 ### Innovative Packaging Solutions for Bakery and Biscuits [Know more][110] [A selection of croissants, tortillas, and rice cakes, neatly packaged in flexible films to maintain freshness and quality.] 06/06 ### Recyclable coffee packaging solutions [Know more][111] ## News & Stories [ [Taghleef Industries Launches PVC-Free Graphics Film Range for Signage, Wall Graphics and Display] News ### Taghleef Industries Launches PVC-Free Graphics Film Range for Signage, Wall Graphics and Display Read more ][112] [ [Taghleef-Industries-HU] News ### Kedvezményezett neve: Taghleef Industries Kft. Read more ][113] [ [Taghleef-Industries-propack] News ### Taghleef Industries Makes Its Debut at Propak Asia 2026 Read more ][114] [ [ti talks beyond packaging at interpack, organized by taghleef industries] News ### Ti Talks – Beyond Packaging: Taghleef Industries Brings the Industry’s Most Relevant ### Conversations to Interpack 2026 Read more ][115] Not sure where to start? Try our Products Finder and find any of our films in an instant [PRODUCT FINDER][116] Customize a more sustainable, innovative solution that best meets your specific requirements [Let’s reDESIGN™][117] ## How can we help?Get in touch with us today Country* Afghanistan Albania Algeria Amer.Virgin Is. Andorra Angola Anguila Antartic Antigua and Barbuda Argentina Armenia Aruba Australia Austria Azerbaijan Bahamas Bahrain Bangladesh Barbados Belarus Belgium Belize Benin Bermuda Bhutan Bolivarian Republic of Venezuela Bolivia Bonaire, Saint Eustatius and Saba Bosnia and Herzegovina Botswana Bouvet Island Brazil British Indian Ocean Territory British Virgin Islands Brunei Bulgary Burkina Faso Burundi Cambodia Cameroon Canada Cape Verde Islands Cayman Islands Central African Republic Chad Chile China Christmas Island Coconuts Islands Colombia Comoras Congo Cook Islands Costa Rica Croatia Cuba Curazao Cyprus Czech Republic Democratic Republic of Congo Denmark Dominica Dominican Republic Dutch Antilles East Timor Ecuador Egypt El Salvador Equatorial Guinea Eritrea Estonia Ethiopia Falkland Islands Faroe Islands Finland Fiyi Former Yugoslav Republic of Macedonia France French Guyana French Polynesia French Southern Territories Gabon Gambia Georgia Germany Ghana Gibraltar Gland Islands Greece Greenland Grenada Guadalupe Guam Guatemala Guernesey Guinea Guinea-Bissau Guyana Haiti Heard and McDonald Islands Honduras Hong Kong Hungary Iceland India Indonesia Iraq Ireland Islamic Republic of Iran Israel Italy Ivory Coast Jamaica Japan Jersey Jordan Kazakhstan Kenya Kiribati Korea Republic Kuwait Kyrgyzstan Laos Popular Democratic Republic Latvia Lebanon Lesotho Liberia Libya Liechtenstein Lithuania Luxembourg Macao Madagascar Malawi Malaysia Maldives Mali Malta Man Island Marshall Islnds Martinique Mauritania Mauritius Mayotte Mexico Micronesia Minor Outl.Ins. Monaco Mongolia Montenegro Montserrat Morocco Mozambique Myanmar N.Mariana Islnd Na