: "Brand / Marketer", "key_products": "BOPP films, CPP films, specialty films"}}, "X Score": "75", "Y Score": "70", "Overall Score": "72", "Industry Category": "Others / Packaging", "Quadrant": "Leaders"}, {"Company": "Innovia Films", "Website": "https://innoviafilms.com", "Founded": "2004", "Headquarters": "seed_file", "Continent / Geography": "", "Operational Presence": "United Kingdom; Belgium; Poland", "Ownership": "Subsidiary of CCL Industries", "Employees": "1,350", "Core Categories": "Specialty films; BOPP films", "Specialty Focus": "Brand / Marketer; web_confirmed_flex_pack_player", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Brand / Marketer", "Contact Person": "Vincent Evans", "Role": "Group Procurement", "Email": "filmsinfo@innoviafilms.com", "LinkedIn": "https://www.linkedin.com/company/innovia-films", "Office No.": "+441697342281", "Country Code": "GB", "Region Code": "EU", "Summary": "Innovia Films — channel participant (seed_file). Verify: Manufacturer of specialty BOPP films for flexible packaging.", "Data Sources": "google_ai; openai_sdk_residual", "_crawl": {"founded_year": 2004}, "Data Confidence": "High", "Quality Score": "4", "commercial_role": "Brand / Marketer", "verify_confidence": "95", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "innoviafilms.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "innoviafilms.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "[[A click on the Innovia logo will take you back to our homepage.]][1]\n[Home][2][Products][3][Sustainability][4]\nCareers\n[United Kingdom][5][Australia][6][Germany][7][Mexico][8][Poland][9]\n[Contact][10][News][11][Company][12]\n\n# We give the future a better print.\n\n[A woman standing in front of a store looks in. There is a 'Sale' sign on the window. A print from\nInnovia Films.][A woman standing in front of a store looks in. There is a 'Sale' sign on the window.\nA print from Innovia Films.][A woman standing in front of a store looks in. There is a 'Sale' sign\non the window. A print from Innovia Films.]\n\n## We give the future a better label.\n\n[Some care products are behind a foil. These products receive labels from Innovia Films.][Some care\nproducts are behind a foil. These products receive labels from Innovia Films.][Some care products\nare behind a foil. These products receive labels from Innovia Films.]\n\n## We give the future a better package.\n\n[In front of a plate of salad being served by a person is a package from Innovia Films.][In front of\na plate of salad being served by a person is a package from Innovia Films.][In front of a plate of\nsalad being served by a person is a package from Innovia Films.]\n\n## We give your career a better package.\n\n[Two people in work clothes with safety goggles and helmets stand at a machine. Above them is a\npackage - Start your career at Innovia Films.][Two people in work clothes with safety goggles and\nhelmets stand at a machine. Above them is a package - Start your career at Innovia Films.][Two\npeople in work clothes with safety goggles and helmets stand at a machine. Above them is a package -\nStart your career at Innovia Films.]\n\n## Giving the future low carbon films.\n\n[Low carbon film: footprints like a sea on a transparent film. The film lies over a dense forest -\nsustainable films and packaging with Innovia Films.][Low carbon film: footprints like a sea on a\ntransparent film. The film lies over a dense forest - sustainable films and packaging with Innovia\nFilms.][Low carbon film: footprints like a sea on a transparent film. The film lies over a dense\nforest - sustainable films and packaging with Innovia Films.]\n\n## Giving the future cleaner oceans.\n\n[Cleaner oceans: On the beach with shallow waves and a sunset in the background - covered by a\nsustainable film - Innovia Films.][Cleaner oceans: On the beach with shallow waves and a sunset in\nthe background - covered by a sustainable film - Innovia Films.][Cleaner oceans: On the beach with\nshallow waves and a sunset in the background - covered by a sustainable film - Innovia\nFilms.][Cleaner oceans: On the beach with shallow waves and a sunset in the background - covered by\na sustainable film - Innovia Films.]\n\n## Giving the future recycled content films.\n\n[The future with recycled film and packaging: We recycle for a better future - Innovia Films][The\nfuture with recycled film and packaging: We recycle for a better future - Innovia Films][The future\nwith recycled film and packaging: We recycle for a better future - Innovia Films]\n\n## Innovia Films —This is us\n\n— “We give labels, packaging and graphic films a better future”.\nAs a leading pioneer in materials science Innovia Films can draw on over 80 years of experience as a\nsupplier to the packaging and labelling industry. The company holds a leading global position in the\nmarkets of high performance coated films, tobacco overwrap, graphic film solutions, label and\nsecurity films.\n\n[\nGet in touch\nGet in touch\n][13]\n\nAbout\n\n## Our Business\n\n[A look behind the scenes: the inside of a factory building where people work - Innovia Films]\n[A look behind the scenes: the inside of a factory building where people work - Innovia Films]\n\nInnovia Films is a global producer of polypropylene and polyolefin films that enable packaging,\nlabel and graphic films of tomorrow. Lightweight, functional, recyclable and with a low carbon\nfootprint. We are the only material science company that can offer all technolo"}}, "page_text": "[[A click on the Innovia logo will take you back to our homepage.]][1] [Home][2][Products][3][Sustainability][4] Careers [United Kingdom][5][Australia][6][Germany][7][Mexico][8][Poland][9] [Contact][10][News][11][Company][12] # We give the future a better print. [A woman standing in front of a store looks in. There is a 'Sale' sign on the window. A print from Innovia Films.][A woman standing in front of a store looks in. There is a 'Sale' sign on the window. A print from Innovia Films.][A woman standing in front of a store looks in. There is a 'Sale' sign on the window. A print from Innovia Films.] ## We give the future a better label. [Some care products are behind a foil. These products receive labels from Innovia Films.][Some care products are behind a foil. These products receive labels from Innovia Films.][Some care products are behind a foil. These products receive labels from Innovia Films.] ## We give the future a better package. [In front of a plate of salad being served by a person is a package from Innovia Films.][In front of a plate of salad being served by a person is a package from Innovia Films.][In front of a plate of salad being served by a person is a package from Innovia Films.] ## We give your career a better package. [Two people in work clothes with safety goggles and helmets stand at a machine. Above them is a package - Start your career at Innovia Films.][Two people in work clothes with safety goggles and helmets stand at a machine. Above them is a package - Start your career at Innovia Films.][Two people in work clothes with safety goggles and helmets stand at a machine. Above them is a package - Start your career at Innovia Films.] ## Giving the future low carbon films. [Low carbon film: footprints like a sea on a transparent film. The film lies over a dense forest - sustainable films and packaging with Innovia Films.][Low carbon film: footprints like a sea on a transparent film. The film lies over a dense forest - sustainable films and packaging with Innovia Films.][Low carbon film: footprints like a sea on a transparent film. The film lies over a dense forest - sustainable films and packaging with Innovia Films.] ## Giving the future cleaner oceans. [Cleaner oceans: On the beach with shallow waves and a sunset in the background - covered by a sustainable film - Innovia Films.][Cleaner oceans: On the beach with shallow waves and a sunset in the background - covered by a sustainable film - Innovia Films.][Cleaner oceans: On the beach with shallow waves and a sunset in the background - covered by a sustainable film - Innovia Films.][Cleaner oceans: On the beach with shallow waves and a sunset in the background - covered by a sustainable film - Innovia Films.] ## Giving the future recycled content films. [The future with recycled film and packaging: We recycle for a better future - Innovia Films][The future with recycled film and packaging: We recycle for a better future - Innovia Films][The future with recycled film and packaging: We recycle for a better future - Innovia Films] ## Innovia Films —This is us — “We give labels, packaging and graphic films a better future”. As a leading pioneer in materials science Innovia Films can draw on over 80 years of experience as a supplier to the packaging and labelling industry. The company holds a leading global position in the markets of high performance coated films, tobacco overwrap, graphic film solutions, label and security films. [ Get in touch Get in touch ][13] About ## Our Business [A look behind the scenes: the inside of a factory building where people work - Innovia Films] [A look behind the scenes: the inside of a factory building where people work - Innovia Films] Innovia Films is a global producer of polypropylene and polyolefin films that enable packaging, label and graphic films of tomorrow. Lightweight, functional, recyclable and with a low carbon footprint. We are the only material science company that can offer all technologies: Bubble, Stenter and Cast Polypropylene films. Our labelling and packaging products and technologies are constantly being improved by our research and development specialists in order to provide sustainable and recyclable solutions for a better future. [ Explore our products Explore our products ][14] About ## Our Core Values [The earth can be seen from space. Find out all about our values at Innovia Films now.] [The earth can be seen from space. Find out all about our values at Innovia Films now.] Our people make the difference, and our culture rooted in accountability, excellence and teamwork ensuring every employee is able to make a difference. We work together to do what we set out to achieve for our customers, actively seeking solutions through innovation and our unique capabilities. Innovation through research and development is at the heart of our business. Sustainability is key for our clients, for our employees and for us as a global company. We are committed to improving today’s performance in order to build a more sustainable tomorrow. [ More on sustainability More on sustainability ][15] [The earth can be seen from space. Find out all about our values at Innovia Films now.] About ## Our people are our Key Asset [Two people are having a conversation. Start a career with Innovia Films now!] [Two people are having a conversation. Start a career with Innovia Films now!] Our employees’ inspiration, passion and dedication are very important to the success in our business. At Innovia Films we are committed to promoting an inclusive work environment where everyone is respected and supported, where diversity and difference are truly valued. With a wide range of job opportunities, training and development programmes and a number of attractive benefits Innovia can provide the right career path for you! [ Explore our job offers Explore our job offers ][16] Updates ## News and Insights [ ### Innovia Films and PureCycle Partner to Successfully Produce White, Cavitated BOPP Film Using ### PureFive Choice™ Recycled Polypropylene Milestone Demonstrates Viability of PureCycle’s Recycled Resin in High-Performance Flexible Packaging for Snack, Confectionery and Roll-Fed Label Applications 9.6.26 ][17] [ ### Smarter, Simpler, More Sustainable Packaging—Innovia Unveils What’s Next at Interpack 2026 At Hall 9, Stand F04, Innovia Films - a leading innovator in materials science and manufacturer of BOPP films for packaging, labels, graphics and tobacco applications - will unveil a new generation of mono-material polypropylene films designed to help brands and converters meet tightening EU regulations—while simplifying production and maintaining performance. 23.3.26 ][18] [ ### Innovia Films Launches P2G: High-Performance, Recyclable Film for Fresh Produce Packaging Innovia Films, a leading material science pioneer and manufacturer of BOPP films, today announced the launch of P2G, a clear high gas transmission BOPP film designed specifically for flow wrap applications in fresh produce packaging, including pre-prepared vegetables. 4.3.26 ][19] [[A click on the Innovia logo will take you back to our homepage.]][20] ## Pack for Progress. [Legal Disclaimer][21][Corporate][22][[A click on the Innovianet logo will take you the Log in section.]][23] Follow us [[Innovia Films LinkedIn Page]][24][[Click on the X Logo and visit the Innovia Films X page.]][25] ## Pack for Progress. © 2018 Spoon Inc, All rights reserved. [1]: / [2]: / [3]: /products [4]: /sustainability [5]: /careers [6]: /carrera [7]: /carrera [8]: /carrera [9]: /kariera [10]: /contact [11]: /news [12]: /company [13]: /contact [14]: /products [15]: /sustainability [16]: /careers [17]: /post/innovia-films-and-purecycle-partner-to-successfully-produce-white-cavitated-bopp-film-us ing-purefive-choice-tm-recycled-polypropylene [18]: /post/smarter-simpler-more-sustainable-packaging--innovia-unveils-whats-next-at-interpack-2026 [19]: /post/innovia-films-launches-p2g-high-performance-recyclable-film-for-fresh-produce-packaging [20]: / [21]: /legal-disclaimer [22]: https://cclind.com/ [23]: https://innovianet.com/innovianet/views/login_en/ [24]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/innovia-films/?originalSubdomain=de [25]: https://x.com/i/flow/login?redirect_after_login=%2Finnoviafilms", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "Innovia Films — channel participant (seed_file). Verify: Manufacturer of specialty BOPP 