About][8]\n  * [Our Story][9]\n  * [Meet Our Champions][10]\n  * [Success Stories][11]\n  * [Careers][12]\n  * [Donate][13]\n* [Entrepreneur Ecosystem][14]\n* [Resources][15]\n  * [News & Press Releases][16]\n  * [Join Our Newsletter][17]\n* [Events][18]\n* [Contact][19]\n* [APPLY TODAY][20]\n\n[(909) 915-1706][21]\n* [Loans][22]\n  * [Small Business Loans][23]\n  * [Community Lending Programs][24]\n  * [Loan Calculator][25]\n  * [SBA 504 Loan Program][26]\n  * [SBA 504 Rates][27]\n  * [SBA 504 Calculator][28]\n* [About][29]\n  * [Our Story][30]\n  * [Contact Our Team][31]\n  * [Success Stories][32]\n  * [Careers][33]\n  * [Donate][34]\n* [Entrepreneur Ecosystem][35]\n* Resources\n  * [News & Press Releases][36]\n  * [Join Our Newsletter][37]\n* [Events][38]\n* [Contact][39]\n\n[APPLY NOW][40]\n[mobile home section 1]\n\n# Financing Your Business,\n# Empowering Your Future!\n\n### Discover More with SBA 504\n\nThe SBA 504 loan is one of our financing options that provides long-term, fixed-rate financing and\nfor major assets like commercial real estate and equipment. Designed to support business growth and\njob creation, this program helps small businesses purchase, build, refinance, or upgrade the spaces\nand tools they need to grow.\n\n[APPLY TODAY][41]\n\n## Small Business? Big Dreams?\n## We’ve Got You Covered!\n\n### Explore our Community Lending Programs\n\nAmPac’s Community Lending Programs offer flexible, affordable financing for small businesses. These\nprograms help underserved entrepreneurs access financing for working capital, equipment, or\nexpansion, bridging the gap to growth with tailored support and mission-driven funding.\n\n[JOIN US][42]\n\n# Financing Your Business,\n# Empowering Your Future!\n\n### Discover More with SBA 504\n\nThe SBA 504 loan is one of our financing options that provides long-term, fixed-rate financing and\nfor major assets like commercial real estate and equipment. Designed to support business growth and\njob creation, this program helps small businesses purchase, build, refinance, or upgrade the spaces\nand tools they need to grow.\n\n[APPLY TODAY][43]\n\n## Small Business? Big Dreams?\n## We’ve Got You Covered!\n\n### Explore our Community Lending Programs\n\nAmPac’s Community Lending Programs offer flexible, affordable financing for small businesses. These\nprograms help underserved entrepreneurs access financing for working capital, equipment, or\nexpansion, bridging the gap to growth with tailored support and mission-driven funding.\n\n[LEARN MORE][44]\nCurrent SBA 504 Effective Rates (as of August 2026)\n6.27%\n25 Years\n6.27%\n20 Years\n6.19%\n10 Years\n6.03%\n25 Yr Manufacturing\n6.02%\n20 Yr Manufacturing\n5.89%\n10 Yr Manufacturing\n\n## Partner with a Team of Passionate\n## Small Business Champions\n\nOver\n15,000\njobs created and preserved\nMore than\n$2 Billion\nin loans, empowering growth and opportunity\nServing over\n2,000\nbusinesses with dedication and care\nPioneering as the nation’s first\nFaith-Based\nSBA lender, driven by purpose and faith\n[See Our Success Stories][45]\n\n## Trusted by Many\n\nAmPac Business Capital is a mission-driven lender dedicated to advancing entrepreneurial dreams\nthrough access to capital and resources that foster long-term business success. AmPac provides\ntailored financing solutions and support through its Community Lending Programs, SBA 504 loans, and\nEntrepreneur Ecosystem—guiding businesses from cradle to legacy.\n\nFounded by Hilda Kennedy in 2005, AmPac is a private nonprofit organization headquartered in\nOntario, California. As the first faith-based SBA 504 lender in the nation, AmPac was built to serve\nsmall business owners who are often overlooked by traditional lenders. Through a commitment to\neconomic empowerment and inclusive opportunity, AmPac continues to help entrepreneurs build stronger\nbusinesses and stronger communities.\n\n[OUR STORY][46"}}, "page_text": "[google-translator] [(909) 915-1706][1] * [Loans][2] * [Small Business Loans][3] * [Community Lending Programs][4] * [SBA 504 Loan Program][5] * [SBA 504 Rates][6] * [SBA 504 Calculator][7] * [About][8] * [Our Story][9] * [Meet Our Champions][10] * [Success Stories][11] * [Careers][12] * [Donate][13] * [Entrepreneur Ecosystem][14] * [Resources][15] * [News & Press Releases][16] * [Join Our Newsletter][17] * [Events][18] * [Contact][19] * [APPLY TODAY][20] [(909) 915-1706][21] * [Loans][22] * [Small Business Loans][23] * [Community Lending Programs][24] * [Loan Calculator][25] * [SBA 504 Loan Program][26] * [SBA 504 Rates][27] * [SBA 504 Calculator][28] * [About][29] * [Our Story][30] * [Contact Our Team][31] * [Success Stories][32] * [Careers][33] * [Donate][34] * [Entrepreneur Ecosystem][35] * Resources * [News & Press Releases][36] * [Join Our Newsletter][37] * [Events][38] * [Contact][39] [APPLY NOW][40] [mobile home section 1] # Financing Your Business, # Empowering Your Future! ### Discover More with SBA 504 The SBA 504 loan is one of our financing options that provides long-term, fixed-rate financing and for major assets like commercial real estate and equipment. Designed to support business growth and job creation, this program helps small businesses purchase, build, refinance, or upgrade the spaces and tools they need to grow. [APPLY TODAY][41] ## Small Business? Big Dreams? ## We’ve Got You Covered! ### Explore our Community Lending Programs AmPac’s Community Lending Programs offer flexible, affordable financing for small businesses. These programs help underserved entrepreneurs access financing for working capital, equipment, or expansion, bridging the gap to growth with tailored support and mission-driven funding. [JOIN US][42] # Financing Your Business, # Empowering Your Future! ### Discover More with SBA 504 The SBA 504 loan is one of our financing options that provides long-term, fixed-rate financing and for major assets like commercial real estate and equipment. Designed to support business growth and job creation, this program helps small businesses purchase, build, refinance, or upgrade the spaces and tools they need to grow. [APPLY TODAY][43] ## Small Business? Big Dreams? ## We’ve Got You Covered! ### Explore our Community Lending Programs AmPac’s Community Lending Programs offer flexible, affordable financing for small businesses. These programs help underserved entrepreneurs access financing for working capital, equipment, or expansion, bridging the gap to growth with tailored support and mission-driven funding. [LEARN MORE][44] Current SBA 504 Effective Rates (as of August 2026) 6.27% 25 Years 6.27% 20 Years 6.19% 10 Years 6.03% 25 Yr Manufacturing 6.02% 20 Yr Manufacturing 5.89% 10 Yr Manufacturing ## Partner with a Team of Passionate ## Small Business Champions Over 15,000 jobs created and preserved More than $2 Billion in loans, empowering growth and opportunity Serving over 2,000 businesses with dedication and care Pioneering as the nation’s first Faith-Based SBA lender, driven by purpose and faith [See Our Success Stories][45] ## Trusted by Many AmPac Business Capital is a mission-driven lender dedicated to advancing entrepreneurial dreams through access to capital and resources that foster long-term business success. AmPac provides tailored financing solutions and support through its Community Lending Programs, SBA 504 loans, and Entrepreneur Ecosystem—guiding businesses from cradle to legacy. Founded by Hilda Kennedy in 2005, AmPac is a private nonprofit organization headquartered in Ontario, California. As the first faith-based SBA 504 lender in the nation, AmPac was built to serve small business owners who are often overlooked by traditional lenders. Through a commitment to economic empowerment and inclusive opportunity, AmPac continues to help entrepreneurs build stronger businesses and stronger communities. [OUR STORY][46] ## Financing Options For Entrepreneurs ### SBA 504 Loans ### SBA 504 Loans With down payments as low as 10% for commercial real estate, SBA 504 loans are one of the best funding options for small businesses! [Unlock Your Potential][47] ### Community Lending Small Business Programs ### Community Lending Small Business Programs Built to serve small businesses at all stages, these programs fund working capital, equipment, expansion, and more, with personalized support and a mission to close the gap to growth! [Discover Your Options][48] ### Entrepreneur Ecosystem ### Entrepreneur Ecosystem Wherever you are in your small business journey, AmPac will support you in advancing your entrepreneurial dream. [Get Connected Today][49] ## Transforming Communities, Strengthening Families, & Inspiring Entrepreneurial Success [Meet Our Business Champions][50] ## Your Vision, Our Mission ### Your goals are within reach—start with the right funding options. #### Own the #### Space That Powers Your Business Ready to own your own building? AmPac will help you secure your commercial property and invest in your future. #### Invest #### in New Equipment Find out how financing for machinery and equipment can give your business the tools it needs to succeed. #### Refinance Your Commercial Debt Discover how AmPac can refinance your commercial debt and help you achieve your business goals. #### Make Your Property Shine Financing for tenant improvements and ground-up construction, helping businesses build or customize spaces to fit their needs. #### Working Capital Under $100,000 Flexible financing for working capital, helping businesses cover day-to-day expenses and propel growth. [Explore More Options][51] ## Join us for the 18th ## Annual Connecting Faith ## and Business Conference **On October 15th,** discover how aligning your faith with your business can unlock greater impact and fulfillment. Celebrate purpose-driven entrepreneurship today. [Join Us][52] ## At The Heart Of Everything, ## We Keep It Simple. Three steps to put your business first so you can focus on your path to success, while we ensure financial hurdles don’t slow you down. Step 01 [Application Icon][Application Icon] ### APPLICATION AmPac, along with our bank partners (for real estate or equipment loans), meets with the business owner to get to know the business and understand its financing needs, kicking off the process by gathering key financial details. Step 02 [Application Icon][Application Icon] ### BUSINESS REVIEW The business owner completes a financial checklist, providing personal and business tax returns, business plans, projections, and any additional required documents to ensure a thorough review. Step 03 [Application Icon][Application Icon] ### CLOSING Once all company documents are in place, AmPac finalizes the process, closes the deal, and provides the funds for your business needs. [Ready to Grow? Apply today!][53] ## Explore Our ## Entrepreneurship Ecosystem ### Get plugged in to our Entrepreneurial Support Hub The Entrepreneur Ecosystem provides access to powerful resources, tailored guidance, and a thriving community. It supports business growth through hands-on coaching and personalized technical assistance, provides co-working spaces, connects entrepreneurs with industry experts, while also hosting networking and training events designed to foster collaboration and create new opportunities. [Entrepreneur Ecosystem Mobile Application][Entrepreneur Ecosystem Mobile Application] #### Perks of Being a Mobile App Member Message And Share Updates With Over 2,500 Business Professionals Easily book offices and conference rooms for in-person work Get connected to free coaching, consulting, e-learning, and loan application support Join teams to make a bigger impact and accelerate your business journey [][54] [][55] ## Powerful Partnerships, Meaningful Impact [View All Partners][56] ## Rooted in Shared Values ### You can always count on us, walking beside you on your business journey. Our commitment is to nurture small businesses on the path to success. With the support of our trusted partners, we provide the capital and resources you need, no matter where you are in your entrepreneurial journey. [Success Stories][57] [Two people walking][Two people walking] #### Site Links [Loan Programs][58] [Our Story][59] [Meet Our Champions][60] [Success Stories][61] [Careers][62] [Donate][63] [Events][64] [Entrepreneur Ecosystem][65] [News & Press Releases][66] [Annual Reports][67] [Terms of Service][68] [Privacy Policy][69] [Cookie Policy][70] #### Communities We Serve San Bernardino San Diego Palm Desert Sacramento Ontario Inland Empire Arizona Nevada #### Resources [SBA][71] [SBDC][72] [SCORE][73] [City of Riverside][74] [City of Moreno Valley][75] [IE Women’s Business Center][76] [Town of Apple Valley][77] [Wells Fargo Works for Small Businesses][78] #### Connect With Us  [(909) 915-1706][79] #### Follow: #AmPacBusinessCapital * [Follow][80] * [Follow][81] * [Follow][82] * [Follow][83] #### Follow: #EntrepreneurEcosystem * [Follow][84] * [Follow][85] * [Follow][86] * [Follow][87] * [Follow][88] #### Locations AmPac Headquarters 3110 B Inland Empire Blvd. Ontario, CA 91764 Sacramento 3626 Fair Oaks Blvd. Sacramento, CA 95864 San Bernardino 330 N. D St., Ste. 530 San Bernardino, CA 92401 Palm Desert 37023 Cook St., Ste. 102 Palm Desert, CA 92211 Tucson 160 E. Alameda, Ste. 202 Tucson, AZ 85701 #### Grow with purpose. Turn potential into prosperity. At AmPac Business Capital, we believe in doing what’s right—leading with honesty, transparency, and a genuine commitment to helping businesses grow and thrive. Your success is at the heart of everything we do. #### Stay connected—subscribe to our newsletter! [Get Exclusive Insights][89] [Image: AmPac Business Capital Logo for Social Sharing] [Image: AmPac Business Capital Logo for Social Sharing][Image: AmPac Business Capital Logo for Social Sharing] [[Image: AmPac Business Capital Logo for Social Sharing][Image: AmPac Business Capital Logo for Social Sharing]][90] *Disclaimer: The SBA 504 effective rates displayed on this website are updated monthly based on the latest available data. AmPac does not guarantee the accuracy or availability of these rates at the time of loan application. For the most up-to-date rate information and loan details, please contact our team directly. 2025 AmPac Business Capital. All Rights Reserved. [909-915-1706][91] [1]: tel+1909-915-1706 [2]: https://ampac.com/small-business-loans/ [3]: https://ampac.com/small-business-loans/ [4]: https://ampac.com/community-lending-programs/ [5]: https://ampac.com/small-business-loans/sba-504-loan-program/ [6]: /small-business-loans/sba-504-loan-program/#rates [7]: /small-business-loans/sba-504-loan-program/#504-calculator [8]: https://ampac.com/about/ [9]: https://ampac.com/about/ [10]: /about/#about-team [11]: https://ampac.com/success-stories/ [12]: https://ampac.com/careers/ [13]: https://ampac.com/donate/ [14]: https://ampac.com/entrepreneur-ecosystem/ [15]: # [16]: https://ampac.com/news/ [17]: https://ampac.com/newsletter-sign-up/ [18]: /events/ [19]: https://ampac.com/contact/ [20]: https://ampac.gatewayportal.com/ [21]: tel:+1909-915-1706 [22]: https://ampac.com/small-business-loans/ [23]: https://ampac.com/small-business-loans/ [24]: https://ampac.com/community-lending-programs/ [25]: https://ampac.com/loan-calculator/ [26]: https://ampac.com/small-business-loans/sba-504-loan-program/ [27]: /small-business-loans/sba-504-loan-program/#rates [28]: /small-business-loans/sba-504-loan-program/#504-calculator [29]: https://ampac.com/about/ [30]: https://ampac.com/about/ [31]: https://ampac.com/about/#about-team [32]: https://ampac.com/success-stories/ [33]: https://ampac.com/careers/ [34]: https://ampac.com/donate/ [35]: https://ampac.com/entrepreneur-ecosystem/ [36]: https://ampac.com/news/ [37]: https://", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "Ampac Holdings LLC — channel participant (seed_file). Verify: Manufactures flexible plastic and paper packaging, pouches, bags, and specialty packaging. | Brand