-performance paper and plastic packaging\nsolutions** that meet the highest demands of our customers and consumers alike, delivering **product\nprotection, safety, convenience, preservation, sustainability** and **promotional impact**.\n\n[ Our Products ][82]\n\n## Designed for you\n\nWe manufacture packaging for a variety of markets including **food and pet food**, **consumer\ngoods**, **medical applications**, **agriculture**, and **industrial**. With our corporate office\nbased in Vienna, our team of over 2,500 employees delivers excellence across 17 sites in the EMEA\nregion.\n\n[ Our Markets ][83]\n\n## Engineered to protect\n\n### Message from Christian Kolarik, CEO\n### \n\n\"At Coveris, we protect the products people **rely on every day**. We innovate and engineer\nhigh-performance packaging, underpinned by our **No Waste** strategy. By considering the entire life\ncycle of a product, we aim to fully **close the loop** and help our customers achieve their\n**sustainability goals**. We develop the packaging of tomorrow because we think beyond today.\"\n\n[ About Us ][84]\n\n## Latest News\n\n[\n10.02.2026\nCoveris announces agreement to sell Paper Business Unit\n][85]\n[ See all news ][86]\n[\n[Jan Willem Bruijsten in front of microphone smiling]\n12.03.2026\nPodcast Premiere: Coveris on \"Inside Packaging\"\n][87] [\n15.12.2025\npladis Global and Coveris Bring Sustainable Packaging Innovation to the US Confectionery Market\n][88]\n[ See all news ][89]\n\n## Making waves in our vision of No Waste\n\nWith our **No Waste** strategy, we are dedicated to producing packaging with the lowest possible\nenvironmental footprint, while ensuring the highest level of protection for the goods we pack.\n\n[ Discover No Waste ][90]\n[Big wavy letter O]\n[Recover logo]\n\n## Keeping plastic circular\n\nWe are leading our industry with our innovative **ReCover** concept, "}}, "page_text": "* Coveris Brands * [ MediFlex ][1] * [ MediFlex Ready-to-go-Range ][2] * [ Unterland/Farmfilms ][3] * Legal * [ Code of Conduct ][4] * [ General Terms and Conditions ][5] * [ Certificates ][6] * [ Terms of Use ][7] * [ Modern Slavery Statement ][8] * [ Compliance ][9] * [ Imprint ][10] * [ Privacy & Cookie Policy ][11] * [ Report Misconduct ][12] * Social * [ Products & Markets ][13] * [ All Products ][14] * [ Markets ][15] * [ Product Brands ][16] * [ ESG ][17] * [ Sustainability Report ][18] * [ Environmental ][19] * [ Social Responsibility ][20] * [ Governance ][21] * [ No Waste ][22] * [ ReCover ][23] * [ No Waste News ][24] * [ Forward Thinking ][25] * [ Film Science Lab ][26] * [ Food Science Lab ][27] * [ Pack Innovation Centre ][28] * [ Careers ][29] * [ Vacancies ][30] * [ Work With Us ][31] * [ Values ][32] * [ Meet our People ][33] * [ Apprenticeships ][34] * [ About Us ][35] * [ Our Team ][36] * [ Our History ][37] * [ Technologies ][38] * [ Forward Thinking ][39] * [ Community Fund ][40] * [ Media & News ][41] * [ News ][42] * [ Press Releases ][43] * [ Media Resources ][44] * [ Contact ][45] * [ Our Locations ][46] [ [Coveris Logo] ][47] * [ Products & Markets ][48] * [ All Products ][49] * [ Markets ][50] * [ Product Brands ][51] * [ ESG ][52] * [ Sustainability Report ][53] * [ Environmental ][54] * [ Social Responsibility ][55] * [ Governance ][56] * [ No Waste ][57] * [ ReCover ][58] * [ No Waste News ][59] * [ Forward Thinking ][60] * [ Film Science Lab ][61] * [ Food Science Lab ][62] * [ Pack Innovation Centre ][63] * [ Careers ][64] * [ Vacancies ][65] * [ Work with us ][66] * [ Values ][67] * [ Meet our people ][68] * [ Apprenticeships ][69] * [ About Us ][70] * [ Our Team ][71] * [ Our History ][72] * [ Technologies ][73] * [ Forward Thinking ][74] * [ Community Fund ][75] * [ News ][76] * [ Newsroom ][77] * [ Press Releases ][78] * [ Media Resources ][79] * [ Contact ][80] * [ Our Locations ][81] # Packaging for goods At Coveris, we develop and manufacture sustainable, **high-performance paper and plastic packaging solutions** that meet the highest demands of our customers and consumers alike, delivering **product protection, safety, convenience, preservation, sustainability** and **promotional impact**. [ Our Products ][82] ## Designed for you We manufacture packaging for a variety of markets including **food and pet food**, **consumer goods**, **medical applications**, **agriculture**, and **industrial**. With our corporate office based in Vienna, our team of over 2,500 employees delivers excellence across 17 sites in the EMEA region. [ Our Markets ][83] ## Engineered to protect ### Message from Christian Kolarik, CEO ### \"At Coveris, we protect the products people **rely on every day**. We innovate and engineer high-performance packaging, underpinned by our **No Waste** strategy. By considering the entire life cycle of a product, we aim to fully **close the loop** and help our customers achieve their **sustainability goals**. We develop the packaging of tomorrow because we think beyond today.\" [ About Us ][84] ## Latest News [ 10.02.2026 Coveris announces agreement to sell Paper Business Unit ][85] [ See all news ][86] [ [Jan Willem Bruijsten in front of microphone smiling] 12.03.2026 Podcast Premiere: Coveris on \"Inside Packaging\" ][87] [ 15.12.2025 pladis Global and Coveris Bring Sustainable Packaging Innovation to the US Confectionery Market ][88] [ See all news ][89] ## Making waves in our vision of No Waste With our **No Waste** strategy, we are dedicated to producing packaging with the lowest possible environmental footprint, while ensuring the highest level of protection for the goods we pack. [ Discover No Waste ][90] [Big wavy letter O] [Recover logo] ## Keeping plastic circular We are leading our industry with our innovative **ReCover** concept, closing the loop on a full scale – from collecting waste to recycling and reusing post-consumer materials in our packaging. [ Learn more about ReCover ][91] ### Read our new Sustainability Report At Coveris, sustainability is a continuous journey. We are committed to delivering measurable, meaningful progress and are proud to share our achievements with our partners, customers and communities. [ Learn More ][92] ### Committed to the future We are driven by a commitment to excellence and guided by our values to Make it Right, Make it Happen, and Make it Better. Through innovation and responsibility, we meet the demands of today while anticipating the future needs of our industry. [ Forward Thinking at Coveris ][93] ### Get in touch We’d love to hear from you. Get in touch with your local Coveris representative today to discover how we can support your packaging needs. [ contact us ][94] * [Products & Markets][95] * [All Products][96] * [Markets][97] * [Product Brands][98] * [ESG][99] * [Sustainability Report][100] * [Environmental][101] * [Social Responsibility][102] * [Governance][103] * [No Waste][104] * [ReCover][105] * [No Waste News][106] * [Forward Thinking][107] * [Film Science Lab][108] * [Food Science Lab][109] * [Pack Innovation Centre][110] * [Careers][111] * [Vacancies][112] * [Work with Us][113] * [Values][114] * [Meet our People][115] * [Apprenticeships][116] * [About Us][117] * [Our Team][118] * [Our History][119] * [Technologies][120] * [Forward Thinking][121] * [Community Fund][122] * [Media & News][123] * [News][124] * [Press Releases][125] * [Media Resources][126] * Coveris Brands * [Amberley Labels][127] * [MediFlex][128] * [MediFlex Ready-to-go-Range][129] * [Unterland/Farmfilms][130] * [Rivendell][131] * Legal * [Code of Conduct][132] * [General terms and conditions][133] * [Certificates][134] * [Terms of use][135] * [Privacy and cookie policy][136] * [Modern slavery statement][137] * [Compliance][138] * [Imprint][139] * [Report Misconduct][140] * [Contact][141] * [Our Locations][142] Social Coveris Rypin (Coveris Rypin Sp. z o.o.) is certified as: [PEFC Certificate Logo for Coveris Rypin] © 2026 Coveris. All Rights Reserved [1]: /en/products-brands/mediflex [2]: /en/me