SCM", "Email": "info@jindalfilms.com", "LinkedIn": "https://www.linkedin.com/company/jindal-films", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "LU", "Region Code": "EU", "Summary": "Jindal Films — channel participant (seed_file). Verify: Manufacturer of BOPP/BOPET films for flexible packaging.", "Data Sources": "google_ai; openai_sdk_residual", "_crawl": {"founded_year": 1952}, "Data Confidence": "High", "Quality Score": "4", "commercial_role": "Brand / Marketer", "verify_confidence": "95", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "jindalfilms.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "jindalfilms.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "Free cookie consent management tool by [TermsFeed Policy Generator][1]\n[Skip to content][2]\n[LinkedIn][3]\n[ [Jindal Films Logo] ][4]\nSearch for:\n* [About us ][5]\n  * [Vision & Values][6]\n  * [Locations][7]\n  * [Innovation][8]\n  * [Our Brands][9]\n  * [Jindal Films Brindisi][10]\n  * [Jindal Films Virton][11]\n  * [Terms & Conditions of Sales][12]\n* [Products ][13]\n  * [FLEX PACK BOPP films ][14]\n    * [ALOX-LYTE™ / Transparent][15]\n    * [BICOR™ / Transparent][16]\n    * [METALLYTE™ / Metallized][17]\n    * [OPPALYTE™ / Opaque][18]\n  * [FLEX PACK BOPE films ][19]\n    * [ETHY-LYTE™ / High Density][20]\n  * [LABELS BOPP films ][21]\n    * [LABEL-LYTE™][22]\n  * [TOBACCO FILMS][23]\n* [News & Events][24]\n* [Sustainability ][25]\n  * [SUSTAINABILITY FOCUS][26]\n  * [MONO-PP SOLUTIONS][27]\n  * [MONO-PE SOLUTIONS][28]\n  * [Re Range][29]\n* [Careers ][30]\n  * [Jindal Films Italy][31]\n* [Contact us][32]\n* [Sign In/My Account DOC][33]\n[7-MONOPP] [7-ETHYLYTE] [7-RERANGE]\n1. [Home][34]\nHome[Alexandra Antoine][35]2025-12-15T08:55:17+00:00\n\n## Solutions For Sustainable Packaging Innovation\n\nJindal Films is a part of B.C. Jindal Group, head quartered in India, which was founded by Shri.\nB.C. Jindal in 1952. We are an industry leader in the development and manufacture of recyclable\nbiaxially oriented polypropylene (BOPP) and polyethylene (BOPE) films designed for flexible\npackaging, labeling, and other applications.\n\nWe strongly believe in the idea of Growing Together. With a close partnership and joint efforts, we\nsupport you in designing sustainable, safe, protecting and attractive packaging. We continuously\ninnovate our product portfolio to provide packaging solutions that are required to build an\nenvironmental friendly and sustainable world.\n\n## NEWS\n\n[Amandine TAYLOR][36]2026-05-04T12:24:27+00:00\n\n#### [JINDAL FILMS EXPANDS BOPP PORTFOLIO TO HELP CUSTOMERS MOVE TOWARDS PPWR COMPLIANCE WITH\n#### RECYCLABLE PP-MONOMATERIAL SOLUTIONS][37]\n\nLuxembourg, LU (7th May, 2026) – Jindal Films (Hall 9 Stand F26), a leader in [...]\n\n[Amandine TAYLOR][38]2026-05-04T12:22:32+00:00\n\n#### [JINDAL FILMS LIVE DEMOS WITH KEY PARTNERS DURING INTERPACK 2026 SHOWCASING PP MONO-MATERIAL\n#### SOLUTIONS ON ROUTE TO PPWR READINESS][39]\n\nLuxembourg, LU (7th May, 2026) – Jindal Films (Hall 9 Stand F26), a leader in [...]\n\n[Amandine TAYLOR][40]2026-05-04T12:18:21+00:00\n\n#### [Committed to Sustainable Progress: Jindal Films Achieves SBTi Validation and Expands Circular\n#### Solutions][41]\n\nJindal Films, a global leader in BOPP films manufacturing, has reached a major milestone in [...]\n\n[Amandine TAYLOR][42]2025-10-09T09:00:25+00:00\n\n#### [JINDAL FILMS EUROPE STRENGTHENS EUROPEAN OPERATIONS WITH MAJOR INVESTMENT IN BRINDISI,\n#### ITALY][43]\n\nNEWS RELEASE Jindal Films Europe Strengthens European Operations with Major Investment in Brindisi,\nItaly Luxembourg [...]\n\nCopyright 2026 Jindal Films | All Rights Reserved | [Privacy Policy][44] | [Legal Notice][45]\n[Page load link][46]\n* [ English][47]\n* [ Chinese (Simplified)][48]\n[ Go to Top ][49]\n\n[1]: https://www.termsfeed.com/\n[2]: #content\n[3]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/jindal-films\n[4]: https://www.jindalfilms.com/\n[5]: https://www.jindalfilms.com/about-us/\n[6]: https://www.jin