nLeader in Producing\nBiopolymer Packaging Films\n[Contact Us][5]\nSealant | Barrier Sealant | Print Web | Flow Wrap Films\n[Contact Us][6]\nShrink Sleeve Decoration Films\n[Contact Us][7]\nOPS Shrink Sleeve Decoration Films\n[Contact Us][8]\n\n# Earthfirst^{®}, your partner for a more sustainable future\n\n## Pioneering Sustainability in Packaging & Technical applications\n\nAt Earthfirst^{®}, our mission is to to create sustainable solutions through open collaboration, as\nnature intended.\n\nAs a global manufacturer of compostable sealant, barrier sealant films, and laminates, we serve a\ndiverse range of industries including food, beverage, medical, personal care, office, industrial,\nand other consumer packaged goods (CPG) segments.\n\n\n## Our Lamination Division: Accelerating Innovation in Packaging\n\nOur Lamination Division combines Earthfirst^{®} Films' expertise in Poly Lactic Acid (PLA) films\nwith other technologies to accelerate innovation in packaging solutions.\n\nBy providing small batch production and fast prototyping of laminates, we lead your brand’s\npackaging innovation journey, serving as an incubator for new ideas.\n\n\n### Discover More\n\n- [Learn more about our sealant, barrier sealant, flow wrap, and shrink wrap film offerings][9]\n- [Explore our compostable laminated structures][10]\n\n \n\nAt Earthfirst^{®} Biopolymer Films, we are committed to making a positive impact with our\nenvironmentally responsible products and creative solutions. Join us in our mission to advance\nsustainability in packaging.\n\n### Earthfirst^{®}, Global Producer of Sustainable Films\n\n### The Advantages of Earthfirst^{®} Biopolymer Films\n\n[ by ][11]\n[+1 800 722 5577][12]\nAmericas\n2 Glenshaw Street, Orangeburg, NY 10962\n1212 Elm Street, Sulphur Springs, TX 75482\n2450 Marilyn Lane, Columbus, OH 43219\n* [Solutions][13]\n* [About Us][14]\n* [Latest News & Articles][15]\n* [Sustainability][16]\n* [Contact Us][17]\n* [Terms of use][18]\n* [Privacy][19]\n* 