 [ E Commerce Mail Envelope Film | Branded Retail Bag Film Soft, Strong and Extensible Can be Certified for Home Compostability] [Contact us][4] Leader in Producing Biopolymer Packaging Films [Contact Us][5] Sealant | Barrier Sealant | Print Web | Flow Wrap Films [Contact Us][6] Shrink Sleeve Decoration Films [Contact Us][7] OPS Shrink Sleeve Decoration Films [Contact Us][8] # Earthfirst^{®}, your partner for a more sustainable future ## Pioneering Sustainability in Packaging & Technical applications At Earthfirst^{®}, our mission is to to create sustainable solutions through open collaboration, as nature intended. As a global manufacturer of compostable sealant, barrier sealant films, and laminates, we serve a diverse range of industries including food, beverage, medical, personal care, office, industrial, and other consumer packaged goods (CPG) segments. ## Our Lamination Division: Accelerating Innovation in Packaging Our Lamination Division combines Earthfirst^{®} Films' expertise in Poly Lactic Acid (PLA) films with other technologies to accelerate innovation in packaging solutions. By providing small batch production and fast prototyping of laminates, we lead your brand’s packaging innovation journey, serving as an incubator for new ideas. ### Discover More - [Learn more about our sealant, barrier sealant, flow wrap, and shrink wrap film offerings][9] - [Explore our compostable laminated structures][10] At Earthfirst^{®} Biopolymer Films, we are committed to making a positive impact with our environmentally responsible products and creative solutions. Join us in our mission to advance sustainability in packaging. ### Earthfirst^{®}, Global Producer of Sustainable Films ### The Advantages of Earthfirst^{®} Biopolymer Films [ by ][11] [+1 800 722 5577][12] Americas 2 Glenshaw Street, Orangeburg, NY 10962 1212 Elm Street, Sulphur Springs, TX 75482 2450 Marilyn Lane, Columbus, OH 43219 * [Solutions][13] * [About Us][14] * [Latest News & Articles][15] * [Sustainabil