he paint requirements of NCCA and ECCA. Offer 20-years warranty. Service With more than 20 years of experience in aluminium coating and colour matching. Our personnel are dedicated to see every step of the process. #### Product Center Color Coated aluminum coil, Mirror Aluminum, Brushed Aluminum, Wooden&Marble Aluminum [[Color Coated Aluminum]][85] [Color Coated Aluminum][86] From vibrant colours to conservative shades, solid colours create a unified appearance without the need of special [[Lacquered Aluminium Foil]][87] [Lacquered Aluminium Foil][88] Painting metal 'in the flat' provides a uniform, smooth paint layer, cleaning. Pre-treatment and paint application are [[Color Coated Aluminium Coils]][89] [Color Coated Aluminium Coils][90] Pre-painting is the process where large metal coils are coated in a continuous, highly automated process prior to final [[Precoated Aluminum]][91] [Precoated Aluminum][92] Changing light conditions and perspectives give these elegant colours a glowing, vivid appearance. . With more than 15 [[Decorative Aluminium Foils]][93] [Decorative Aluminium Foils][94] Sparkle aluminum coils, are also one kind of color coated aluminum coils, but they are different from the normal [[PPAL Coils]][95] [PPAL Coils][96] An aluminum surface with a rustic finish is designed to give the metal a weathered, aged appearance, evoking the charm [[Digital Printed Aluminium]][97] [Digital Printed Aluminium][98] The flat ,smooth, digital surface with vastly improved ink adhesion helps to display printed colours with increased [[Antibacterial Aluminium]][99] [Antibacterial Aluminium][100] With our antibacterial coating systems, the effect develops consistently throughout the entire lacquer. Bacteria has #### Product Application Interiors Decoration Architecture Design Materials Consumer Electronics Packaging Materials Transportation Solar and Renewable #### About Us COILCOAT continuous coating process offers a wide range of colors and finishes to meet customers' requirements. With advanced technology and focusing on durability and corrosion resistance, our lacquered products are ideal for a variety of applications in the aluminum industry. COILCOAT Colour products, can be coated in any colour together with special functional coatings, which have an invaluable contribution to sustainable green buildings.We have automatic Color coated aluminum lines, Printing aluminum lines, Brushed aluminum lines, Mirror aluminum lines, Slitting lines, Cutting lines and other aluminum products processing equipment. Flexible aluminum in working thickness from 0.016mm to 3.0mm, and width from 8mm up to 2,050 mm. Our products are available with several functional surfaces that contribute to scratch resistance, superior weathering performance, easy clean, anti-microbial, textured, and come in many shades to match your creativity and imagination. We have developed a series of products that are committed to improve environmental performance of buildings, increase the sustainability of building facades and interiors, and reduce their impact on the environment by being fully recyclable at any production step and at the end of their life as well We actively share our knowledge to meet your needs. We go through the entire process together, from advice to delivery. We are here whenever you need us. [Learn More][101] * ^{+} Factory land occupation [Factory land occupation] * ^{+} Senior technical engineer [Senior technical engineer] * ^{+} Utility model patent [Utility model patent] * ^{+} Global customers [Global customers] #### Video Center Warmly welcome to visit us! Professional Color Coated Aluminum Manufacturer Premium High Gloss White Slitting Process High Gloss Black Running #### Our Honor Official certification and profession after-sales service. #### News Center [[Why Choose Aluminum For Construction]][102] [Why Choose Aluminum For Construction][103] Nov 10, 2025 It is widly known that Aluminum has the advantages such as high strength-to-wei