ded by integrity and vision, and dedicated to the never-ending horizons of the imagination.\n\n[Learn More About Us][77]\n\n## FIND YOUR SUBSTRATE. WE’LL FIND A SOLUTION.\n* [High Stretch Textiles][78]\n* [Non-Stretch Textiles][79]\n* [Natural Content Textiles][80]\n* [Leather][81]\n* [Plastics][82]\n* [Textiles with DWR Coatings][83]\n* [Textiles with Waterproof"}}, "page_text": "Accept All Cookies X [Skip to main content][1] [ [Bemis.] ][2] [ [Bemis.] ][3] Toogle button menu Search * [Careers][4] * [About][5] Featured posts * [Bemis Associates Names Michael Johansen Chief Executive Officer][6] * [World Leader in Thermoplastic Film, Tape and Adhesive Manufacturing Acquires France-Based Company][7] * [Bemis Associates Pledges 1% of all Seam Tape sales to Environmental Causes][8] ### About * [Company News][9] * [Careers][10] * [Social & Environmental Responsibility][11] * [Community Involvement][12] * [Sustainability][13] Featured posts * [Bemis Joins The Conservation Alliance][14] * [Bemis Associates Pledges 1% of all Seam Tape sales to Environmental Causes][15] * [Private: Bemis Associates partners with Dupont Tate & Lyle Bio Products to launch first Sewfree® product made from renewable material][16] ### Sustainability * [Social & Environmental Responsibility][17] * [Solutions][18] markets * [Performance Wear][19] * [Outerwear][20] * [Soft Goods][21] * [Intimates][22] * [Handbags & Wallets][23] * [Automotive & Transportation][24] * [Advanced Textiles & Composite Bonding][25] * [Footwear][26] * [Graphics & Signage][27] * [Connected Products][28] substrates * [High Stretch Textiles][29] * [Non-Stretch Textiles][30] * [Natural Content Textiles][31] * [Leather][32] * [Plastics][33] * [Textiles with DWR Coatings][34] * [Textiles with Waterproof Coatings][35] * [Metal][36] * [Foams][37] * [Wood][38] * [Products][39] [Construction Adhesives][40] * [Stretch & Recovery Adhesives][41] * [Flexible Adhesives][42] * [Textile to Textile / Textile Over Form][43] * [Breathable Adhesives][44] * [Thermoforming Adhesives for Rigidity][45] * [Sewfree on Demand®][46] * [Seam Reinforcement Tapes][47] * [Edge Binding Tapes][48] * [Adhesives for Natural Fibers][49] * [Heat & Coating Sensitive (Low Surface Energy)][50] * [Adhesives for Dissimilar Substrates][51] * [Insulation / Baffle Adhesives][52] * [Adhesives for Pour-in-Place Foam][53] * [UV Resistant Adhesives][54] * [Moisture Barriers][55] * [Adhesives for Conductive Printing][56] * [EverFit™ 6430][57] * [Nets & Webs][58] [Embellishment Films][59] * [Reflective Stretch Embellishments][60] * [Non-Stretch Embellishments][61] * [Specialty Embellishments][62] * [Embellishments for Nylon][63] * [Reflective Non-Stretch Embellishments][64] * [Stretch Embellishments][65] [Waterproofing Seam Tapes][66] * [2-Layer Seam Tapes][67] * [Customizable Seam Tapes][68] * [3-Layer Seam Tapes][69] * [Resources][70] Featured collections * [Sewfree on Demand® Collection][71] * [Individualization Collection][72] * [Seam Reinforcement Tape Collection][73] ### Resources * [Application Collections][74] * [Frequently Asked Questions][75] * [Contact Us][76] ## Let's make amazing Embellishments Sewfree on Demand® Seam Reinforcement Tape Sewfree® Waterproof Seam Tape Sewfree® Embellishments Sewfree on Demand® Waterproof Seam Tape Sewfree® Embellishments Embellishments Seam Reinforcement Tape Waterproof Seam Tape Sewfree® for Decoration Construction Edge Finishing Automotive Outerwear Construction Wearables Seams & Hems Outdoor Gear Soft Goods Reflective Automotive Ultrasonic Seams PPE Construction Pause Play ## THE BEMIS BOND. IT’S THE ULTIMATE INGREDIENT BRAND. For more than 110 years, Bemis has been engineering innovative bonding solutions that help make amazing. We are everything bonding, and so much more. Bemis is built on collaboration and respect, guided by integrity and vision, and dedicated to the never-ending horizons of the imagination. [Learn More About Us][77] ## FIND YOUR SUBSTRATE. WE’LL FIND A SOLUTION. * [High Stretch Textiles][78] * [Non-Stretch Textiles][79] * [Natural Content Textiles][80] * [Leather][81] * [Plastics][82] * [Textiles with DWR Coatings][83] * [Textiles with Waterproof Coatings][84] * [Metal][85] * [Foams][86] * [Wood][87] ## Featured Products ## EverFit™ 6430 Product #: EverFit™ 6430 Our softest and stretchiest adhesive yet, EverFit™ 6430 is an excellent replacement for traditional elastics. Watch the video on this page to learn more. EverFit™ 6430. A Better Fit for Every(Body) Use With * [High Stretch Textiles][88] * [Non-Stretch Textiles][89] * [Foams][90] [View more details][91] ## Nets & Webs Product #: 3412 NET, 3770 NET, 3770 WEB Sewfree® NET and WEB adhesives are engineered to offer bond strength that customers have come to expect from Bemis Sewfree® adhesives with significant added benefits of lower modulus, reduced weight, and improved breathability. Use With * [High Stretch Textiles][92] * [Natural Content Textiles][93] * [Leather][94] * [Plastics][95] * [Textiles with Waterproof Coatings][96] [View more details][97] ## 3-Layer Seam Tapes 3-Layer Seam Tape holds up to the weight of thicker fabrics and provides a reliable seal. With waterproofing solutions for a variety of 3-layer fabrics and materials that use a wide array of coatings, our range of 3-Layer Seam Tapes are the key to protecting the integrity of your weather-worthy gear. Use With * [Textiles with Waterproof Coatings][98] [View more details][99] ## Reflective Stretch Embellishments Product #: RS3500, RS3600, RS4500, RS4501 Enhance visibility with our High-Viz Embellishment Films while offering superior stretch to complement the latest designs. These reflective solutions provide a stronger, more vibrant, versatile choice for your products. Use With * [High Stretch Textiles][100] * [Non-Stretch Textiles][101] * [Natural Content Textiles][102] * [Textiles with Waterproof Coatings][103] [View more details][104] ## Seam Reinforcement Tapes Strengthen seams and add aesthetic touches without compromising flexibility, feel, or weight. In fact, when combined with USLB bonded seams, garments can actually be lighter than with sewn seams. Enjoy stronger construction and visually distinct garments with Bemis SRT. Use With * [High Stretch Textiles][105] * [Non-Stretch Textiles][106] [View more details][107] EverFit™ 6430 Nets & Webs 3-Layer Seam Tapes Reflective Stretch Embellishments Seam Reinforcement Tapes ## YOUR PARTNER IN PROBLEM SOLVING Our Design & Applications team provides services ranging from trend research, education, prototyping, techpack reviews, and more while our technical lab offers testing for compatibility and application recommendations. Bemis can also aid in identifying factories that can execute your project needs as well as on-site technical support for successful implementation. Allow us to partner with you and guide you from inspiration to execution. [About Us][108] ## LET’S PUSH THE BOUNDARIES OF BONDING. TOGETHER. At Bemis, our team is your team. We work hand-in-hand with the world’s best designers, developers, and technologists to make inspiring and enduring products, faster. Our full-service approach to design and manufacturing, the Sewfree® Ecosystem, spans all parts of product development – from concept to commercialization – ensuring you don’t just get support along the way, you get solutions that lead to success. [About Us][109] ## Locations Bemis technology stretches around the planet. Our worldwide customer base looks to Bemis for the latest advances to solve challenging requirements. Our ability to develop strategically important products in a timely fashion, gather the best and brightest talent, and put the customer first have been our foundation in building bonds that last. [Contact Us][110] ## Featured Company News [View All News][111] Corporate Updates [ ## Bemis Associates Appoints Christina Chen as President and Chief Operating Officer ][112] April 28, 2026 Corporate Updates [ ## Bemis x Protect Our Winters Challenge Grant: A Bold Investment in Climate Advocacy ][113] August 11, 2025 Products [ ## A Better Fit for Every(Body) ][114] February 13, 2023 ## WHAT ARE YOU MAKING TODAY? Looking for the right adhesive for your project? Tell us about yourself and let us help! We’re ready to lead you into the future of bonding. [Contact Us][115] * [Solutions][116] * [Products][117] * [About][118] * [Resources][119] * [Cookie Policy][120] * [Privacy Statement][121] Contact Us [+1 (978) 425 6500][122] [info@bemisworldwide.com][123] © 2026 Bemis Associates Inc. All Rights Reserved * [Privacy Policy][124] * [California Supply Chain Statement][125] Manage Consent The Bemis Associates Inc. website stores cookies (including third-party cookies) on your computer, as described in our Privacy Policy, including in order to make the website available to you, to improve your browsing experience, to improve the website and to provide personalized services to you. To learn more about how we use cookies and how to change your settings, see our Privacy Policy. By clicking “Accept Non-Essential Cookies” you agree to the use of all cookies and by clicking “Reject Non-Essential Cookies” you refuse the use of all cookies except those strictly necessary for the operation of our website. Note that by clicking “Accept Non-Essential Cookies” you will be consenting to the tracking of your actions on our website (including by cookies, pixels, and other technologies) and the disclosure of your information obtained through these methods to third parties. By clicking on “Customize”, you can accept cookies by category. You can withdraw your consent to the use of cookies at any time. Functional Functional Always active The technical storage or access is strictly necessary for the legitimate purpose of enabling the use of a specific service explicitly requested by the subscriber or user, or for the sole purpose of carrying out the transmission of a communication over an electronic communications network. Preferences Preferences The technical storage or access is necessary for the legitimate purpose of storing preferences that are not requested by the subscriber or user. Statistics Statistics The technical storage or access that is used exclusively for statistical purposes. The technical storage or access that is used exclusively for anonymous statistical purposes. Without a subpoena, voluntary compliance on the part of your Internet Service Provider, or additional records from a third party, information stored or retrieved for this purpose alone cannot usually be used to identify you. Marketing Marketing The technical storage or access is required to create user profiles to send advertising, or to track the user on a website or across several websites for similar marketing purposes. * [Manage options][126] * [Manage services][127] * [Manage {vendor_count} vendors][128] * [Read more about these purposes][129] Accept Non-Essential Cookies Reject Non-Essential Cookies Customize Save preferences [Customize][130] * [{title}][131] * [{title}][132] * [{title}][133] Manage consent [Movement] ### Movement – Embellishments that move with you Our portfolio of embellishment adhesives. [ LEARN MORE ][134] × [1]: #main-content [2]: https://www.bemisworldwide.com [3]: https://www.bemisworldwide.com [4]: https://www.bemisworldwide.com/careers/ [5]: https://www.bemisworldwide.com/adhesives-and-history-about-us/ [6]: https://www.bemisworldwide.com/bemis-associates-names-michael-johnsen-chief-executive-officer/ [7]: https://www.bemisworldwide.com/world-leader-in-thermoplastic-film-tape-and-adhesive-manufacturi ng-acquires-france-based-company/ [8]: https://www.bemisworldwide.com/bemis-pledges-1-percent-of-seam-tape-sales-to-environmental-caus es/ [9]: https://www.bemisworldwide.com/adhesives-and-history-about-us/company-news/ [10]: https://www.bemisworldwide.com/careers/ [11]: https://www.bemisworldwide.com/social-environmental-responsibility/ [12]: https://www.bemisworldwide.com/community-in