Score": "4", "commercial_role": "Brand / Marketer", "verify_confidence": "95", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "suedpack.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "suedpack.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "[ Continue with request ][1]\n Delete selection\nSÜDPACK Newsletter [ Sign up now ][2] [ Sign up now ][3]\n\n#### SÜDPACK Newsletter\n\nReceive regular updates about SÜDPACK, our products and sustainability topics.\n\n[Sign up now][4]\n* [ SÜDPACK Group ][5]\n* [ Food ][6]\n* [ Medica ][7]\n* [ Non-Food ][8]\n* [ Compounds ][9]\n* [[Sustainability Logo] Sustainability][10]\n* [Magazine][11]\n* [Career][12]\n* [English Logo] [ en ][13]\n  * [ de ][14]\n\n[\n[SÜDPACK] [SÜDPACK]\n][15]\nBack\n* [About SÜDPACK][16]\n  * * * [Locations][17]\n      * [Values][18]\n      * [Compliance][19]\n      * [History][20]\n      * [Sustainability Strategy][21]\n      * [Memberships][22]\n      * [Certificates][23]\n* [Markets][24]\n  * * * [Food][25]\n      * [Medica][26]\n      * [Non-Food][27]\n      * [Compounds][28]\n* [Technology][29]\n  * * * [Production processes][30]\n      * [Development of film solutions][31]\n      * [SPQ - Sustainable packaging printing][32]\n      * [Digimarc][33]\n* [News][34]\n  * * * [Press releases][35]\n      * [Fairs & Events][36]\n      * [Media Library][37]\n* [ SÜDPACK Group ][38]\n* [ Food ][39]\n* [ Medica ][40]\n* [ Non-Food ][41]\n* [ Compounds ][42]\n* [[Sustainability Logo] Sustainability][43]\nDo you need help?\n* [Contact][44]\n* [Magazine][45]\n* [Career][46]\n* [English Logo] [ en ][47]\n  * [ de ][48]\n* [Search Icon] Search\n  Search ×\n* [Contact][49]\n* [English Logo] [ en ][50]\n  * [ de ][51]\nSÜDPACK Packaging\n\n# High-Performance films — for multiple applications.\n\nSearch ×\n1. [SÜDPACK Corporate][52]\n2. [SÜDPACK Group][53]\n* ## Our online magazine is live\n  \n  #### More knowledge. More practical insights. More sustainability.\n  \n   \n  \n  [Read more ][54]\n* ## Progress Report 2025\n  \n  [Find out more ][55]\n* ## SÜDPACK Newsletter\n  \n  ### Receive regular updates about SÜDPACK, our products and sustainability topics.\n  \n  [Register now ][56]\n\n## SÜDPACK - Maximum quality and performance\n\n#### Since 60 years we are giving our best to create maximum added value.\n\nSÜDPACK is a leading manufacturer of high-performance films for the packaging of [food][57],\n[non-food][58] and [medical][59] products. We also draw on in-depth expertise in manufacturing\ninnovative [compounds ][60]from conventional and bio-based raw materials, tailoring them to the\nspecific needs of our customers. With our long term expertise, modern technology and a high degree\nof innovation, we have been a competent industrial partner for 60 years.\n\nOur core competencies? Coextrusion, laminating and converting.\nSÜDPACK products offer a superior quality, performance and functionality. We meet the changing\nrequirements in the packaging industry with a strong portfolio of [sustainable film solutions][61]\nand with models to implement closed loops.\n\n[Learn more about SÜDPACK][62]\n\n[[Films manufacturer for multiple applications] ][63]\n\n### SÜDPACK is one of the pioneers\n### in sustainability\n\nSustainability is reflected in our corporate governance, our processes, our products as well as in\nour commitment to people and to the environment.\nWhich is why we are constantly expanding our portfolio of material-efficient, recyclable film\nsolutions and are committed to the implementation of a circular economy in our industry.\n\n[More about sustainability by SÜDPACK][64]\n\n### Always in the know -\n### with SÜDPACK.\n\nAre you interested in current news on our company? We are happy to keep you informed about new\ndevelopments and show you what moves us as a leading manufacturer of flexible films solutions as\nwell as an employer.\n\n \n\n[\n][65]\n\n### [Expansion of SÜDPACK’s Coulmer site completed ][66]\n\nJuly 17, 2026, marked an important milestone in SÜDPACK Medica’s history, with the official opening\nof the film and packaging manufacturer’s…\n\n07/23/2026 Corporate, Plants\n[\n][67]\n\n### [SÜDPACK Planova®: Bio-based PLA film for fresh herbs and cut flowers ][68]\n\nWhether fresh cut flowers, potted herbs, or cut herbs, horticultural products need to be both\noptimally protected and attractively presented at the…\n\n07/22/2026 "}}, "page_text": "[ Continue with request ][1] Delete selection SÜDPACK Newsletter [ Sign up now ][2] [ Sign up now ][3] #### SÜDPACK Newsletter Receive regular updates about SÜDPACK, our products and sustainability topics. [Sign up now][4] * [ SÜDPACK Group ][5] * [ Food ][6] * [ Medica ][7] * [ Non-Food ][8] * [ Compounds ][9] * [[Sustainability Logo] Sustainability][10] * [Magazine][11] * [Career][12] * [English Logo] [ en ][13] * [ de ][14] [ [SÜDPACK] [SÜDPACK] ][15] Back * [About SÜDPACK][16] * * * [Locations][17] * [Values][18] * [Compliance][19] * [History][20] * [Sustainability Strategy][21] * [Memberships][22] * [Certificates][23] * [Markets][24] * * * [Food][25] * [Medica][26] * [Non-Food][27] * [Compounds][28] * [Technology][29] * * * [Production processes][30] * [Development of film solutions][31] * [SPQ - Sustainable packaging printing][32] * [Digimarc][33] * [News][34] * * * [Press releases][35] * [Fairs & Events][36] * [Media Library][37] * [ SÜDPACK Group ][38] * [ Food ][39] * [ Medica ][40] * [ Non-Food ][41] * [ Compounds ][42] * [[Sustainability Logo] Sustainability][43] Do you need help? * [Contact][44] * [Magazine][45] * [Career][46] * [English Logo] [ en ][47] * [ de ][48] * [Search Icon] Search Search × * [Contact][49] * [English Logo] [ en ][50] * [ de ][51] SÜDPACK Packaging # High-Performance films — for multiple applications. Search × 1. [SÜDPACK Corporate][52] 2. [SÜDPACK Group][53] * ## Our online magazine is live #### More knowledge. More practical insights. More sustainability. [Read more ][54] * ## Progress Report 2025 [Find out more ][55] * ## SÜDPACK Newsletter ### Receive regular updates about SÜDPACK, our products and sustainability topics. [Register now ][56] ## SÜDPACK - Maximum quality and performance #### Since 60 years we are giving our best to create maximum added value. SÜDPACK is a leading manufacturer of high-performance films for the packaging of [food][57], [non-food][58] and [medical][59] products. We also draw on in-depth expertise in manufacturing innovative [compounds ][60]from conventional and bio-based raw materials, tailoring them to the specific needs of our customers. With our long term expertise, modern technology and a high degree of innovation, we have been a competent industrial partner for 60 years. Our core competencies? Coextrusion, laminating and converting. SÜDPACK products offer a superior quality, performance and functionality. We meet the changing requirements in the packaging industry with a strong portfolio of [sustainable film solutions][61] and with models to implement closed loops. [Learn more about SÜDPACK][62] [[Films manufacturer for multiple applications] ][63] ### SÜDPACK is one of the pioneers ### in sustainability Sustainability is reflected in our corporate governance, our processes, our products as well as in our commitment to people and to the environment. Which is why we are constantly expanding our portfolio of material-efficient, recyclable film solutions and are committed to the implementation of a circular economy in our industry. [More about sustainability by SÜDPACK][64] ### Always in the know - ### with SÜDPACK. Are you interested in current news on our company? We are happy to keep you informed about new developments and show you what moves us as a leading manufacturer of flexible films solutions as well as an employer. [ ][65] ### [Expansion of SÜDPACK’s Coulmer site completed ][66] July 17, 2026, marked an important milestone in SÜDPACK Medica’s history, with the official opening of the film and packaging manufacturer’s… 07/23/2026 Corporate, Plants [ ][67] ### [SÜDPACK Planova®: Bio-based PLA film for fresh herbs and cut flowers ][68] Whether fresh cut flowers, potted herbs, or cut herbs, horticultural products need to be both optimally protected and attractively presented at the… 07/22/2026 Products, Sustainability [ ][69] ### [“No need to fear the 7C flexo print process!” ][70] Switching to a standardized seven-color flexo print process is a logical step toward greater sustainability. 05/26/2026 Products, Sustainability [[Ausbildung, Studium und Karriere bei SÜDPACK] ][71] ### The career portal of SÜDPACK [[Berufseinstieg mit SÜDPACK] ][72] Vocational training, study program or permanent employment – SÜDPACK offers a wide range of opportunities for starting a career and excellent prospects for qualified professionals. [SÜDPACK as employer][73] [[Ausbildung, Studium und Karriere bei SÜDPACK] ][74] Do you require more information? We are happy to help. [Make an appointment ][75] #### About SÜDPACK * [Markets][76] * [Locations][77] * [History][78] #### Sustainability * [Material reduction][79] * [Design for Recycling][80] * [Renewable resources][81] * [Closing material cycles][82] #### Press * [Press releases][83] * [Fairs & Events][84] [SÜDPACK honored as one of the '100 Businesses for Resource Efficiency' by the government of Baden-Württemberg and leading business associations.] [SÜDPACK] * © SÜDPACK 2026. All rights reserved. * [Privacy policy][85] * [Terms and conditions][86] * [Imprint][87] * [Newsletter][88] * [Career][89] * Follow us [1]: /en/medica/product-cart [2]: #popup-content-1 [3]: /en/suedpack-group/about-suedpack/newsletter [4]: /en/suedpack-group/about-suedpack/newsletter [5]: /en/suedpack-group [6]: /en/food [7]: /en/medica [8]: /en/non-food [9]: /en/compounds [10]: /en/sustainability [11]: /en/suedpack-magazine [12]: /en/career [13]: /en/suedpack-group [14]: /de/suedpack-gruppe [15]: /en/suedpack-group [16]: /en/suedpack-group/about-suedpack [17]: /en/suedpack-group/about-suedpack/loc