ova-bio-based-pla-film-f or-fresh-herbs-and-cut-flowers [69]: /en/suedpack-group/news/press-releases/press-detail-view/no-need-to-fear-the-7c-flexo-print-pr ocess [70]: /en/suedpack-group/news/press-releases/press-detail-view/no-need-to-fear-the-7c-flexo-print-pr ocess [71]: /en/career [72]: /en/career [73]: /en/career [74]: /en/career [75]: /en/suedpack-group/contact [76]: /en/suedpack-group/markets [77]: /en/suedpack-group/about-suedpack/locations [78]: /en/suedpack-group/about-suedpack/history [79]: /en/material-reduction [80]: /en/sustainability/closing-material-cycles/design-for-recycling [81]: /en/sustainability/renewable-resources [82]: /en/sustainability/closing-material-cycles [83]: /en/suedpack-group/news/press-releases [84]: /en/suedpack-group/news/fairs-events [85]: /en/privacy-policy [86]: /en/terms-and-conditions [87]: /en/imprint [88]: /en/suedpack-group/about-suedpack/newsletter [89]: /en/career", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "Südpack Verpackungen GmbH & Co. KG — channel participant (seed_file). Verify: Südpack is a well-known manufacturer of flexible films and packaging. | Brand / Marketer; web_confirmed_flex_pack_player | Flexible films; rigid films; pouches and bags; lidding/top films; medical/cleanroom packaging films | Germany | Ochsenhausen, Germany", "role_description": "Brand / Marketer", "key_products": "Flexible films; rigid films; pouches and bags; lidding/top films; medical/cleanroom packaging films"}}, "X Score": "72", "Y Score": "66", "Overall Score": "69", "Industry Category": "Others / Packaging", "Quadrant": "Leaders"}, {"Company": "Essentra plc", "Website": "https://www.essentra.com", "Founded": "1957", "Headquarters": "United Kingdom", "Continent / Geography": "EU(United Kingdom)", "Operational Presence": "United Kingdom", "Ownership": "Public", "Employees": "2886", "Core Categories": "Protective Products; Hardware; Fasteners; Cable Management", "Specialty Focus": "UK-based company offering flexible packaging solutions.", "Key Brands Represented": "Essentra Components; Essentra Hengzhu Precision Components Co., Ltd.", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Brand / Marketer", "Contact Person": "Andrew Ford", "Role": "Vice President of Sales", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "https://www.linkedin.com/company/essentra", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "GB", "Region Code": "EU", "Summary": "Essentra plc — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Offers flexible packaging solutions, though core categories are protective products; still a packaging manufacturer.", "Data Sources": "google_ai; openai_sdk_residual", "_crawl": {"founded_year": 1957}, "Data Confidence": "High", "Quality Score": "4", "commercial_role": "Brand / Marketer", "verify_confidence": "80", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "essentra.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "essentra.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "[[Essentra PLC - Go to homepage]][1]\n[ABOUT US][2]\n[OVERVIEW][3][OUR PURPOSE, VALUES AND GOALS][4][OUR HISTORY][5][Our Locations][6][Board of\nDirectors][7][Group Executive Committee][8][STAKEHOLDERS][9]\n[Investors & Media][10]\n[FINANCIAL DATA][11][Company news][12][Reports & Accounts][13][Webcasts and\nPresentations][14][Financial Calendar][15][Analyst Coverage and Consensus][16][Share\nInformation][17][Shareholder Services][18][Advisers][19][Regulatory News][20][Corporate\nGovernance][21][Email Alerts][22]\n[ESG][23]\n[OVERVIEW][24][Codes, Policies and Standards][25][ESG Reporting Centre][26][Community][27]\n[[Essentra PLC - Go to homepage]][28]\n[Hero banner]\n\nOur purpose is to help customers build a sustainable future.\n\n[Hero banner]\n\nOur purpose is to help customers build a sustainable future.\n\n[Hero banner]\n\nOur purpose is to help customers build a sustainable future.\n\n## Company Information\n\n[A worker in a reflective vest and safety glasses writes on a clipboard in an industrial setting\nwith machinery around.]\n\n### Our Purpose, Values & Goals\n\nA service-led manufacturer with a global footprint, balancing local customer service with\noperational scale.\n* [> About Us - Overview][29]\n\n[Research and Development Centre booth in a factory, featuring a welcome sign and information about\nsustainability, with machinery in the background.]\n\n### ESG\n\nWe help customers build a sustainable future.\n* [> LEARN MORE][30]\n\n[Where We Are]\n\n### Where We Are\n* [> HEAD OFFICE][31]\n* [> INTERNATIONAL LOCATIONS][32]\n\n[Assorted industrial plastic components in various shapes and colors displayed on a light gray\nsurface.]\n\n### History\n* [> HISTORY][33]\n\n[A man in a high-visibility orange jacket operates a pallet jack in a warehouse with large boxes and\nbags of yellow items.]\n\n### Annual Report\n* [> 2025 ANNUAL REPORT AND ACCOUNTS][34]\n\n[Smiling warehouse worker in a safety vest leans on a stack of large cardboard boxes on a\nblue-handled cart, with shelves and a cage in the background.]\n\n### Webcasts & Presentations\n\nWatch our latest webcast and download the presentation.\n* [> VIEW WEBCASTS AND PRESENTATIONS][35]\n\n## Press releases and news\n\n[\n[Results for the Half Year Ended 30 June 2026]\n\n### Results for the Half Year Ended 30 June 2026\n\n][36]\n\n28 Jul 2026\n\n[\n[Yellow plastic bottle caps arranged in a row on a moving conveyor belt inside a factory.]\n\n### Notice and Invitation to Half Year 2026 results\n\n][37]\n\n20 Jul 2026\n\n[\n[Completion of the Boteco Acquisition]\n\n### Completion of the Boteco Acquisition\n\n][38]\n\n24 Jun 2026\n\n[\n[Agreement to acquire Boteco]\n\n### Agreement to acquire Boteco\n\n][39]\n\n20 May 2026\n\n[\n[2026 AGM trading update]\n\n### 2026 AGM trading update\n\n][40]\n\n20 May 2026\n\n[\n[Smiling worker in a yellow safety vest and goggles holds red plastic parts in an industrial\nsetting.]\n\n### Publication of Annual Report And Accounts And Notice of AGM\n\n][41]\n\n30 Mar 2026\n\n[\n[A worker in safety glasses inspects bags of orange snack chips at a factory, surrounded by\nindustrial equipment.]\n\n### Results for the Full Year Ended 31 December 2025\n\n][42]\n\n17 Mar 2026\n\n[\n[Six yellow plastic bottle caps on a conveyor belt in a factory setting.]\n\n### Notice and Invitation to Full Year 2025 results\n\n][43]\n\n9 Mar 2026\n\n[\n[A man wearing a hairnet and a wristwatch inspects a translucent sheet under a bright light, in a\nfocused industrial setting.]\n\n### FY25 pre-close trading update\n\n][44]\n\n14 Jan 2026\n\n[\n[A person wearing safety goggles examines packaged products in a factory, standing near blue\nindustrial equipment.]\n\n### Acquisition of Device Technologies\n\n][45]\n\n16 Dec 2025\n\n[\n[Close-up of a frosted glass panel with a cut-out \"E\" shape, revealing a blurred, colorful\nbackground.]\n\n### Q3 2025 Trading Update\n\n][46]\n\n29 Oct 2025\n\n[\n[A person wearing red gloves marks a cardboard box sealed with Essentra Components tape, using a\nblack marker.]\n\n### Results for the Half Year Ended 30 June 2025\n\n][47]\n\n29 Jul 2025\n\n[\n[Worker in a yellow vest moves a cart through a warehou"}}, "page_text": "[[Essentra PLC - Go to homepage]][1] [ABOUT US][2] [OVERVIEW][3][OUR PURPOSE, VALUES AND GOALS][4][OUR HISTORY][5][Our Locations][6][Board of Directors][7][Group Executive Committee][8][STAKEHOLDERS][9] [Investors & Media][10] [FINANCIAL DATA][11][Company news][12][Reports & Accounts][13][Webcasts and Presentations][14][Financial Calendar][15][Analyst Coverage and Consensus][16][Share Information][17][Shareholder Services][18][Advisers][19][Regulatory News][20][Corporate Governance][21][Email Alerts][22] [ESG][23] [OVERVIEW][24][Codes, Policies and Standards][25][ESG Reporting Centre][26][Community][27] [[Essentra PLC - Go to homepage]][28] [Hero banner] Our purpose is to help customers build a sustainable future. [Hero banner] Our purpose is to help customers build a sustainable future. [Hero banner] Our purpose is to help customers build a sustainable future. ## Company Information [A worker in a reflective vest and safety glasses writes on a clipboard in an industrial setting with machinery around.] ### Our Purpose, Values & Goals A service-led manufacturer with a global footprint, balancing local customer service with operational scale. * [> About Us - Overview][29] [Research and Development Centre booth in a factory, featuring a welcome sign and information about sustainability, with machinery in the background.] ### ESG We help customers build a sustainable future. * [> LEARN MORE][30] [Where We Are] ### Where We Are * [> HEAD OFFICE][31] * [> INTERNATIONAL LOCATIONS][32] [Assorted industrial plastic components in various shapes and colors displayed on a light gray surface.] ### History * [> HISTORY][33] [A man in a high-visibility orange jacket operates a pallet jack in a warehouse with large boxes and bags of yellow items.] ### Annual Report * [> 2025 ANNUAL REPORT AND ACCOUNTS][34] [Smiling warehouse worker in a safety vest leans on a stack of large cardboard boxes on a blue-handled cart, with shelves and a cage in the background.] ### Webcasts & Presentations Watch our latest webcast and download the presentation. * [> VIEW WEBCASTS AND PRESENTATIONS][35] ## Press releases and news [ [Results for the Half Year Ended 30 June 2026] ### Results for the Half Year Ended 30 June 2026 ][36] 28 Jul 2026 [ [Yellow plastic bottle caps arranged in a row on a moving conveyor belt inside a factory.] ### Notice and Invitation to Half Year 2026 results ][37] 20 Jul 2026 [ [Completion of the Boteco Acquisition] ### Completion of the Boteco Acquisition ][38] 24 Jun 2026 [ [Agreement to acquire Boteco] ### Agreement to acquire Boteco ][39] 20 May 2026 [ [2026 AGM trading update] ### 2026 AGM trading update ][40] 20 May 2026 [ [Smiling worker in a yellow safety vest and goggles holds red plastic parts in an industrial setting.] ### Publication of Annual Report And Accounts And Notice of AGM ][41] 30 Mar 2026 [ [A worker in safety glasses inspects bags of orange snack chips at a factory, surrounded by industrial equipment.] ### Results for the Full Year Ended 31 December 2025 ][42] 17 Mar 2026 [ [Six yellow plastic bottle caps on a conveyor belt in a factory setting.] ### Notice and Invitation to Full Year 2025 results ][43] 9 Mar 2026 [ [A man wearing a hairnet and a wristwatch inspects a translucent sheet under a bright light, in a focused industrial setting.] ### FY25 pre-close trading update ][44] 14 Jan 2026 [ [A person wearing safety goggles examines packaged products in a factory, standing near blue industrial equipment.] ### Acquisition of Device Technologies ][45] 16 Dec 2025 [ [Close-up of a frosted glass panel with a cut-out \"E\" shape, revealing a blurred, colorful background.] ### Q3 2025 Trading Update ][46] 29 Oct 2025 [ [A person wearing red gloves marks a cardboard box sealed with Essentra Components tape, using a black marker.] ### Results for the Half Year Ended 30 June 2025 ][47] 29 Jul 2025 [ [Worker in a yellow vest moves a cart through a warehouse aisle lined with stacked bins under bright lighting.] ### Notice and Invitation to Half Year 2025 results ][48] 17 Jul 2025 [ [Essentra Components] ### AGM 2025 Trading Update ][49] 20 May 2025 [ [Close-up of a frosted glass panel with a cut-out letter \"E\". Blurred colored rectangles are visible through the glass in the background.] ### Results for the Full Year Ended 31 December 2024 ][50] 18 Mar 2025 [ [Man wearing a hairnet examines a large sheet of paper under a light.] ### Notice of Full Year 2024 results ][51] 16 Mar 2025 [ [A worker in safety goggles inspects packaged goods on an industrial conveyor belt in a factory setting.] ### FY2024 Pre-close Trading Update ][52] 16 Jan 2025 [ [Close-up of a frosted glass panel with a cut-out letter \"E,\" allowing a blurred view of colors in the background.] ### Q3 2024 Trading Update ][53] 23 Oct 2024 [ [Essentra Components] ### Re