t][109] pause_circle chevron_left chevron_right # This is Huhtamaki Our vision is to be the first choice for sustainable packaging solutions globally. We strive to earn this position every day with our leading innovative products that ensure hygiene and safety for food on-the-shelf and food on-the-go. We believe in protecting food, people and the planet and supporting affordability and accessibility to food and everyday necessities for people around the world. [35 Operating countries] ### 35 Operating countries [17,400 employees] ### 17,400 employees [A Nordic heritage of more than 100 years] ### A Nordic heritage of more than 100 years [~4.0 billion euros net sales] ### ~4.0 billion euros net sales ## Explore our business segments and packaging solutions ### [ Fiber ### Packaging ][110] ### [ Flexible ### Packaging ][111] ### [ Foodservice ### Packaging ][112] ### [ North ### America ][113] chevron_left chevron_right ## Huhtamaki in Action Find out more about the role of packaging in creating a sustainable future and delivering circular economy. 23.07.2026 · People, Recent ### [Huhtamaki - Andalusia safety streak relies on dedication from employees][114] 23.07.2026 · People, Recent ### [Safety is the top priority at every shift change at Huhtamaki - Goodyear][115] 21.07.2026 · ### [Strengthening Huhtamaki's long-standing engagement with India][116] [Read the latest highlights here][117] ## Huhtamaki for Investors Huhtamaki (HUH1V, Nasdaq Helsinki) is a key leading global player in sustainable food-on-the-go and food-on-the-the-shelf packaging solutions. Our innovative products help billions of consumers around the world make responsible lifestyle choices every day. Our ambition is to become the first choice in sustainable packaging solutions. [Read more][118] ## Latest releases 23.07.2026 ### [Huhtamaki resolved on establishing a new share ownership plan for the members of its Global ### Executive Team ][119] 23.07.2026 ### [Huhtamäki Oyj’s Half-yearly Report January 1–June 30, 2026: Delivering comparable net sales ### growth and strong profitability][120] 13.07.2026 ### [Huhtamaki publishes 2026 Half-Yearly Report on July 23, 2026][121] [View all releaseschevron_right][122] ## Share price #### Latest 31.78€ #### 1 month +19.28% #### This year +6.05% #### 3 years +3.41% #### 5 years -29.91% HUH1V Huhtamäki (HEL) Updated: 2026/08/13 00:36 (UTC+3) ## Working with Us People are integral to everything we do. At Huhtamaki you're part of a global business dedicated to supporting our customers' growth. Together we can unwrap your true potential. [Read more][123] ## Join us at these industry events ### [ Parhaat Pidot ][124] 20 August, Helsinki Finland ### [ 2026 Fine Food Show ][125] 31 August - 3 September, Melbourne Australia ### [ Pack Expo International 2026 ][126] 18-21 October, Chicago, IL USA ### [ Private Label Manufacturers Annual Private Label Tradeshow ][127] 15-17 November, Chicago, IL USA chevron_left chevron_right ##### [Huhtamaki] * [About][128] * [Products][129] * [Investors][130] * [Sustainability][131] * [Careers][132] * [Media][133] * [Foodservice Packaging][134] * [North America][135] * [Flexible Packaging][136] * [Fiber Packaging][137] * [Legal notice][138] * [Modern slavery statement][139] * [Privacy notice][140] * [Terms And Conditions][141] * [Supplier Information][142] * Cookie Settings * [Linkedin][143] * [Youtube][144] [1]: /en/ [2]: /en/about/ [3]: /en/packaging-business-segments/ [4]: /en/food-packaging-products/ [5]: /en/investors/ [6]: /en/sustainability/ [7]: /en/careers/ [8]: /en/media/ [9]: /en/about/contact-us/ [10]: # [11]: # [12]: /fi/ [13]: /en/foodservice/ [14]: /en/flexible-packaging/ [15]: /en-us/north-america/ [16]: /en/fiber-packaging/ [17]: /en-br/fiber-packaging/ [18]: /en-us/north-america/ [19]: /en-us/north-america/ [20]: /en-au/fiber-packaging/ [21]: https://www.huhtamaki.com.au/ [22]: /zh-cn/foodservice/ [23]: /en-in/flexible-packaging/ [24]: /en-in/foodservice/ [25]: /en-nz/fiber-pac