lms][20]\n    * [Holographic Films][21]\n    * [TMP][22]\n  * [Saracote][23]\n    * [Release Liner-Labels][24]\n    * [Release Liner-Speciality][25]\n    * [Shingle Roofing Tape][26]\n    * [Release Film Liner][27]\n    * [Primer Coated Liner][28]\n    * [Release Liner - Electronic Industry][29]\n  * [Saralam][30]\n    * [Reflective Insulation][31]\n    * [Decorative Lamination][32]\n    * [Polyester Thermal Lamination - Thin gauge][33]\n    * [Polyester Thermal Lamination - Thick gauge][34]\n    * [Polypropylene Thermal Lamination][35]\n    * [Nylon Thermal Lamination][36]\n    * [Ultra Megabond Nylon Thermal Lamination Digital][37]\n    * [Ultra Megabond Polyester Thermal Lamination Digital][38]\n    * [Ultra Megabond Polypropylene Thermal Lamination Digital][39]\n    * [Zafira UV Polyester Thermal Lamination ][40]\n  * [Saraprint][41]\n    * [Digital Print Media][42]\n    * [Polyester Master Plate][43]\n    * [Laser Printer Film][44]\n    * [Inkjet Films][45]\n    * [Backlit Films][46]\n    * [Label Face Films][47]\n* [Innovation][48]\n* [Sustainability][49] [Sustainability][50]\n  * [Sustainability at a Glance][51]\n  * [Policies][52]\n  * [ESG Profile][53]\n* [Investor][54]\n* [People][55]\n* [Contact us][56]\n* ## Search form\n  \n  Search\n  [ [Home] ][57]\n  [polyplex][58]\n\n## ABOUT US\n\n### One of the leading PET Film Manufacturers\n\nPolyplex Corporation Ltd. (Polyplex) has the seventh-largest capacity of polyester (PET) film\nglobally.\n\nOur polyester capabilities include both thin and thick PET film in a wide range of thickness and\nsurface properties covering a spectrum of applications.\n\nOur diversified business portfolio also includes BOPP, Blown PP/PE and CPP films produced in\nstate-of-the-art plants with economic size. Integrated downstream capabilities of Metallizing,\nHolography, Silicone Coating, Offline Chemical Coating, Extrusion Coating and Transfer Metallized\nPaper deliver further value-added products.\n\nWe have a global presence, supplying to about 2735 customers in 86 countries across Europe, the\nAmericas, the Indian sub-continent, Far East, Asia Pacific and the Middle East.\n\n[Know More][59]\n[About Us]\n**37** Years of Operations\n86\n\n##### Countries\n\n2850\n\n##### Employees\n\n826 m\n\n##### USD Turnover\n\n## OUR PRODUCTS\n\n[Sarafil]\n\n##### Sarafil\n\nSarafil base films are suitable for a range of applications with its inherent properties of being\nclear, transparent, flexible and with high Tensile s...\n\n[Know More][60]\n[Sarafil]\n\n##### Saracote\n\nThe Saracote range of silicone coated films (PET/PP) is designed to provide an excellent carrier to\npressure sensitive material. The typical applicati...\n\n[Know More][61]\n[Sarafil]\n\n##### Saralam\n\nThe Saralam range of extrusion coated film products cater to a variety of end use such as thermal\nlamination products like book covers, identity cards...\n\n[Know More][62]\n[Sarafil]\n\n##### Saraprint\n\nSaraprint is an innovative non-tearable polyester film designed especially for digital print media\nsegment for photo album, general commercial printin...\n\n[Know More][63]\n[View All Products][64]\n[announcement]\n\n## ANNOUNCEMENTS\n\n###### ACQUISITION OF 51% STAKE IN TECHNOVA PRINTRITE PRODUCTS PRIVATE LIMITED - 30.04.2026\n\nTo know more [click here][65]\n\n###### FINANCIAL RESULTS - 11.08.2026\n\nPOLYPLEX CORPORATION LIMITED HAS SUBMITTED TO THE EXCHANGE, THE FINANCIAL RESULTS FOR THE PERIOD\nENDED June 30, 2026.\n\nTo know more [click here][66]\n\n## Sustainability\n\n#### DEVELOPED\n* Green Wrap PET Film\n* Bio Based Films - (Bio MEG)\n* PET Monomeric Film\n* RPET (Up to 100% PCR content)\n\n#### REPLACED\n* PVC Twist Wrap Film with Green PET wrap film"}}, "page_text": "[ Skip to main content ][1] [[Polyplex]][2] * [Home][3] * [About Us][4] [About Us][5] * [Overview][6] * [Growth Story][7] * [Vision Mission & Values][8] * [Global Presence][9] * [CSR][10] * [Certifications][11] * [Products][12] [Products][13] * [Overview][14] * [Sarafil][15] * [BOPET Films][16] * [BOPP Films][17] * [CPP Films][18] * [Blown Films][19] * [Sustainable Films][20] * [Holographic Films][21] * [TMP][22] * [Saracote][23] * [Release Liner-Labels][24] * [Release Liner-Speciality][25] * [Shingle Roofing Tape][26] * [Release Film Liner][27] * [Primer Coated Liner][28] * [Release Liner - Electronic Industry][29] * [Saralam][30] * [Reflective Insulation][31] * [Decorative Lamination][32] * [Polyester Thermal Lamination - Thin gauge][33] * [Polyester Thermal Lamination - Thick gauge][34] * [Polypropylene Thermal Lamination][35] * [Nylon Thermal Lamination][36] * [Ultra Megabond Nylon Thermal Lamination Digital][37] * [Ultra Megabond Polyester Thermal Lamination Digital][38] * [Ultra Megabond Polypropylene Thermal Lamination Digital][39] * [Zafira UV Polyester Thermal Lamination ][40] * [Saraprint][41] * [Digital Print Media][42] * [Polyester Master Plate][43] * [Laser Printer Film][44] * [Inkjet Films][45] * [Backlit Films][46] * [Label Face Films][47] * [Innovation][48] * [Sustainability][49] [Sustainability][50] * [Sustainability at a Glance][51] * [Policies][52] * [ESG Profile][53] * [Investor][54] * [People][55] * [Contact us][56] * ## Search form Search [ [Home] ][57] [polyplex][58] ## ABOUT US ### One of the leading PET Film Manufacturers Polyplex Corporation Ltd. (Polyplex) has the seventh-largest capacity of polyester (PET) film globally. Our polyester capabilities include both thin and thick PET film in a wide range of thickness and surface properties covering a spectrum of applications. Our diversified business portfolio also includes BOPP, Blown PP/PE and CPP films produced in state-of-the-art plants with economic size. Integrated downstream capabilities of Metallizing, Holography, Silicone Coating, Offline Chemical Coating, Extrusion Coating and Transfer Metallized Paper deliver further value-added products. We have a global presence, supplying to about 2735 customers in 86 countries across Europe, the Americas, the Indian sub-continent, Far East, Asia Pacific and the Middle East. [Know More][59] [About Us] **37** Years of Operations 86 ##### Countries 2850 ##### Employees 826 m ##### USD Turnover ## OUR PRODUCTS [Sarafil] ##### Sarafil Sarafil base films are suitable for a range of applications with its inherent properties of being clear, transparent, flexible and with high Tensile s... [Know More][60] [Sarafil] ##### Saracote The Saracote range of silicone coated films (PET/PP) is designed to provide an excellent carrier to pressure sensitive material. The typical applicati... [Know More][61] [Sarafil] ##### Saralam The Saralam range of extrusion coated film products cater to a variety of end use such as thermal lamination products like book covers, identity cards... [Know More][62] [Sarafil] ##### Saraprint Saraprint is an innovative non-tearable polyester film designed especially for digital print media segment for photo album, general commercial printin... [Know More][63] [View All Products][64] [announcement] ## ANNOUNCEMENTS ###### ACQUISITION OF 51% STAKE IN TECHNOVA PRINTRITE PRODUCTS PRIVATE LIMITED - 30.04.2026 To know more [click here][65] ###### FINANCIAL RESULTS - 11.08.2026 POLYPLEX CORPORATION LIMITED HAS SUBMITTED TO THE EXCHANGE, THE FINANCIAL RESULTS FOR THE PERIOD ENDED June 30, 2026. To know more [click here][66] ## Sustainability #### DEVELOPED * Green Wrap PET Film * Bio Based Films - (Bio MEG) * PET Monomeric Film * RPET (Up to 100% PCR content) #### REPLACED * PVC Twist Wrap Film with Green PET wrap film in the Confectionary Industry * Aluminium foil with metallized barrier PET film in food packaging (cost reduction) #### INVESTED IN CIRCULAR SOLUTIONS Dedicated recycling unit in Thailand - EcoBlue Limited [(http://ecoblue.co.th/)][67] * Recycling solutions for materials like films, label liner and laminates. * High quality rPET, rPP and rHDPE resin for sustainability conscious organizations. [View All Sustainability][68] #### [About Us