utomated Equipment ][63] * [ Mailer Box ][64] * [ Protective Film for Automotive & Transportation ][65] * [ Protective Film for Metals ][66] * [ Protective Film for Plastics ][67] * [ Protective Film for Building & Construction ][68] * [ Protective Film for Appliances ][69] * [ Bubble Rolls ][70] * [ Bubble Bags & Pouches ][71] * [ Foil Bubble - ThermaCycle® Flex ][72] * [ Foam Bags & Pouches ][73] * [ Astro-Foam Polyethylene Foam ][74] * [ Extruded ][75] * [ Laminated ][76] * [ Void Fill Paper Packaging ][77] * [ Surface Protection Paper ][78] * [ Grocery & Food Service Paper ][79] * [ CushionPak ][80] * [ ProFlex Profiles ][81] * [ PantaPak ][82] * [ Single Face ][83] * [ SleevIt ][84] * [ Corner Keeper ][85] * [ Bumper Guard ][86] * [ Centerfold Laminations ][87] * [ ThermaCycle Flex ][88] * [ Manufacturing Capabilities ][89] * [ Markets Served ][90] * [ Agriculture ][91] * [ Appliance ][92] * [ Automotive & Transportation ][93] * [ Building & Construction ][94] * [ Consumer Packaged Goods ][95] * [ eCommerce & Fulfillment ][96] * [ Furniture & Millwork ][97] * [ Mail Order Pharmaceutical ][98] * [ Meal Kit & Grocery Delivery ][99] * [ Nutraceuticals ][100] * [ Publishing & Distribution ][101] * [ Retail Packaging ][102] * [ Small Parts Packaging ][103] * [ Third Party Logistics ][104] * [ Performance Flexibles ][105] * [ Inside the Box Protection ][106] * [ Surface Protection ][107] * [ Mailing & Bagging Solutions ][108] * [ Insulated Packaging ][109] * [ Customer Experience ][110] * [ Grocery & Food Processing ][111] * [ Laboratory Capabilities ][112] * [ AirSpeed Air Systems ][113] * [ Astro-Bubble Bubble Rolls ][114] * [ Astro-Foam Polyethylene Sheet Foam ][115] * [ EasyPack Paper Systems ][116] * [ EverTec Mailers ][117] * [ Inspyre Packaging ][118] * [ IntelliPack On-Demand Foam ][119] * [ PolyMask Protective Films ][120] * [ PolyPlank Foam for Fabrication ][121] * [ Renew Sustainable Products ][122] * [ Pregis Sharp Automated Bagging ][123] * [ ThermaCycle Flex Insulated Packaging ][124] * Services * [ Pregis IQ ][125] * [ Integration Services ][126] * [ Customized Packaging ][127] * Support * [ Technical Support ][128] * [ Training ][129] * [ Contact Technical Support ][130] * [ Knowledge HUB ][131] * About Us * [ About Pregis ][132] * [ Pregis Purpose ][133] * [ Pregis IQ ][134] Sustainability * [ Sustainable Packaging ][135] * [ 2K30 Goals ][136] * [ Sustainability Report ][137] * [ Giving Back ][138] * [ Pregis Purpose Awards ][139] * [ Recycling Tips ][140] [ Resources ][141] [ Careers ][142] [ Contact Us ][143] [ Choose Language ][144] # Pregis home # Innovative, sustainable packaging solutions We help customers across diverse industries solve their toughest business challenges so they can create customers for life. [ Explore Solutions ][145] [ [Scroll to About Pregis] ][146] ## A global, vertically integrated provider of innovative packaging, equipment and services Pregis is a customer-driven solutions provider of innovative packaging materials and equipment. As a material agnostic company, we work with customers to find the right solution to solve their business challenges. Our end-to-end suite of services make us stand out from the rest. We deliver actionable data-backed recommendations and partner with customers to integrate seamlessly into their operations to achieve the desired results. ### In partnership with our channel partners, we serve leading global brands across industries [Automotive] [Automotive][147] [Consumer Packaged Goods] [ Consumer Packaged Goods ][148] [Small Parts Packaging] [ Small Parts Packaging ][149] [Third Party Logistics] [ Third Party Logistics ][150] [Building & Construction] [ Building & Construction ][151] [Nutraceuticals] [ Nutraceuticals ][152] [Retail Packaging] [ Retail Packaging ][153] [Ecommerce & Fulfillment] [ Ecommerce & Fulfillment ][154] [ [Scroll to Products & Systems] ][155] 01/ Solutions ## Our Products & Systems ### Inside-the-Box Protection Keep your goods safe and secure during transit with Pregis. Our full complement of air, paper and foam inside-the-box packaging solutions protect against damage during the journey of a package. [ See our Products ][156] ### Flexible Packaging Pregis Flexible Packaging are created to meet and exceed our customers’ unique needs. See how our film experts use innovative technology and formulas to deliver superiorpackaging solutions every time. [ Get Your Secret Formula ][157] ### Surface Protection Protect your critical surfaces, edge and parts from the manufacturing, production or shipping environments they face. Prevent scratching, marring and abrasion with Pregis’ complete line of temporary protection films and materials. [ Protection on Contact ][158] ### Mailing & Bagging Solutions Replace the box with a mailer or bag that contains goods through the shipping cycle and minimizes parcel costs. Our options range from ready to use shippers to scalable automated mailing and bagging systems. [ Get Ready to Ship ][159] ### Industry-Specific Solutions Solutions designed to protect the common to the uncommon. We cater to the unique and distinctive application needs across many diverse industries. [ Discover the Solution ][160] We're Hiring! Pregis is looking for the most enthusiastic and talented people to join our growing industry. [ Learn More ][161] ### Our 2025 Sustainability Report Is Here Discover how we are advancing our commitment to protect, preserve and inspyre through measurable environmental and social impact. ─┬────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── │**1.28 million trees saved from harvesting in 2025** │ │**5.66 million trees saved since 2019** │ │**Over $1MM raised to improve access to clean water** │ │**92% global waste diversion from landfill** │ │**EcoVadis Bronze Medal recipient** ─┴────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── [View the 2025 Sustainability Report][162] [Pregis-Promise-Logo.png] [ [Scroll to Spotlight on Service] ][163] ### Creating solutions that work for both customers and the environment At our Pregis IQ^{®} Innovation Headquarters, we use a consultative approach to combine innovation with expertise, help businesses improve packaging efficiency, protect products and reduce waste. Our goal is to educate customers and provide them with data that enables informed decision making. We offer: ───────────────────────┬───────────────────────────┬────────────────────┬─────────────────────────── **[Life-Cycle.png]** │**[vibration-test.png]** │[materials.png] │**[EcoGauge-damage.png]** │ │ │ **Design** │**Testing** │**Analysis** │**Training** ───────────────────────┴───────────────────────────┴────────────────────┴─────────────────────────── [IQ Services][164] [Our-People---Kenya-Feature] ### Spotlight on Service **From Product to Purpose: *Witnessing the Inspyre Impact in Kenya*** In Kenya, Pregis team member, Jason Parsons, witnessed how Uzima water filters deliver clean water, hope and resilience to families facing daily water insecurity. Every Pregis Inspyre™ purchase helps fund this mission. [Read the Story][165] ### Smarter packaging starts with total cost of ownership Total Cost of Ownership (TCO) is the focal point of our approach. TCO is the comprehensive cost of producing, storing, distributing and commercializing products. It includes both direct and indirect costs. **The impact TCO can make on your business is transformative.** [Get the eBook][166] [tco-cover] [ [Scroll to Knowledge Hub] ][167] Stay in the know with Happenings from the Hub [ Sign Up for Our Newsletter ][168] [Pregis logo footer] Product Categories * [ On-Demand Paper Systems ][169] * [ On-Demand Air systems ][170] * [ On-Demand Foam Systems ][171] * [ Automated Mailing & Bagging ][172] * [ Shipping Mailers ][173] * [ Cohesive Packaging Solutions ][174] * [ Temporary Protection Films ][175] * [ Bubble Cushioning & Pouches ][176] * [ Foam Sheets & Pouches ][177] * [ Foam for Fabrication ][178] * [ Paper Rolls & Sheets ][179] * [ Specialty Products ][180] Solutions by Need * [ Flexible Packaging Films ][181] * [ Inside the Box Protection ][182] * [ Surface Protection ][183] * [ Mailing & Bagging Solutions ][184] * [ Insulated Packaging ][185] * [ Customer Experience ][186] * [ Grocery & Foodservice Paper ][187] Services * [ Pregis IQ ][188] * [ Integration Services ][189] * [ Customized Packaging ][190] About Us * [ Why Pregis ][191] * [ Pregis Purpose ][192] * [ Sustainability ][193] * [ Giving Back ][194] * [ Careers ][195] * [ Resources ][196] * [ Corporate Governance ][197] * [ Terms and Conditions ][198] * [ Accessibility Statement ][199] * [ Privacy Policy ][200] * [ CPRA Privacy Policy ][201] Connect With Pregis * [ Contact Us ][202] * [ Subscribe ][203] * [ Knowledge Hub ][204] ©2026 Pregis LLC. All Rights Reserved. | [Sitemap][205] Pregis North America 227 W Monroe", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "Pregis LLC — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Manufacturer of protective and flexible packaging materials, including films and pouches. | Produces flexible protective packaging materials for various industries. | Protective packaging, flexible packaging | Pregis | United States | United States", "role_description": "Brand / Marketer", "key_products": "Protective packaging, flexible packaging"}}, "X Score": "68", "Y Score": "66", "Overall Score": "67", "Industry Category": "Others / Packaging", "Quadrant": "Leaders"}, {"Company": "Toray Industries", "Website": "https://www.toray.com", "Founded": "1926", "Headquarters": "Japan", "Continent / Geography": "APAC(Japan)", "Operational Presence": "Japan", "Ownership": "Public (TSE: 3402)", "Employees": "20", "Core Categories": "Fiber and Textiles; High-performance Chemicals; Carbon Fiber Composite Materials; Environmental Engineering; Life Sciences", "Specialty Focus": "Offers high-performance films for flexible p