t film based on an inspiring true story about young boy Tri who survives to achieve great\nsuccess.\n\n][12]\n\n## Toray at a glance\n\nHere is an overview of Toray, a material manufacturer that provides cutting-edge materials and\ncontinues to support innovation all around the world.\n\n[Toray at a glance][13]\n\n## Sustainability\n\nWeaving a Sustainable Future for the Environment and People through Innovative Technologies and\nAdvanced Materials\n\n[Sustainability][14]\n\n## We get to know the real Sani Brown through an interview exploring his latest\n## competitions, thoughts on the partnership with Toray, and message to fans.\n\n[Read More][15]\n\n## That’s why, Toray.\n\nDiscover how Toray advanced materials work behind the scenes\nto make life better in thousands of different ways.\n\n[That’s why, Toray.][16]\n\n[1]: #contents\n[2]: #globalNav\n[3]: /100th/\n[4]: /overview/\n[5]: /news/\n[6]: https://youtu.be/HIwn8sXn97g\n[7]: https://partners.wsj.com/toray/the-fabric-of-innovation/the-hidden-technology-transforming-amer\nicas-fastest-growing-sport/\n[8]: https://partners.wsj.com/toray/the-fabric-of-innovation/rewriting-the-rules-of-fashion-discover\n-the-partnership-reshaping-modern-clothing/\n[9]: https://youtu.be/t4YYIzFkP8A\n[10]: https://impact.economist.com/sustainability/water-treatment-for-global-good/\n[11]: https://youtu.be/C51aB194mkA\n[12]: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VScgiPrzfUA\n[13]: /overview/\n[14]: /sustainability/\n[15]: /partnership/athlete/\n[16]: /thatswhy/"}}, "page_text": "* [Jump to main content][1] * [Jump to Global Navigation][2] [100th Anniversary Website][3] # MATERIALS CHANGE OUR LIVES [Toray at a glance][4] ## News [Newsroom][5] ## Our Stories [ ### TORAY 100th ANNIVERSARY COMMEMORATIVENEW FILM \"A RAY OF LIGHT\" & \"A Century of History\" ][6] [ ### The Fabric of InnovationNEW The Hidden Technology Transforming America’s Fastest-Growing Sport Behind pickleball’s explosive growth lies carbon fiber, quietly driving the sport’