Laminations][7] * [— PCR Film Laminations][8] * [Stand Up Pouches][9] * [— PCR Pouches][10] * [— Recyclable Pouches][11] * [— STANDCAP Inverted Pouches][12] * [— Spouted Pouches][13] * [— Zipper Pouches][14] * [— Slider Pouches][15] * [— Other Pre-made Pouches][16] * [Narrow Web Flexible Packaging][17] * [Capabilities][18] * [Custom Engineered Laminations][19] * [Package Engineering Expertise][20] * [Adhesive Laminating & Coating][21] * [Extrusion Laminating & Coating][22] * [Prepress & Graphics Engineering][23] * [Flexographic Printing][24] * [Quality & Regulatory Systems][25] * [Custom Finishing & Slitting][26] * [Pouch Prototyping & Testing][27] * [Pouch Converting][28] * [Markets][29] * [Food & Beverage][30] * [Pharmaceutical & Medical][31] * [Pet Food and Treat Packaging][32] * [Nutritional & Nutraceuticals][33] * [Household Products & Chemicals][34] * [Oil & Lubricants][35] * [Personal Care & Cosmetics][36] * [Sustainability][37] * [Company Environmental Responsibility][38] * [Sustainable Flexible Packaging][39] * [Gallery][40] * [Resources][41] * [Flexible Packaging Definitions][42] * [Graphics Specifications][43] * [Web Layouts][44] * [Conversions & Calculators][45] * [About Us][46] * [Why Glenroy?][47] * [Vision, Mission, Values][48] * [History][49] * [Success Stories][50] * [Testimonials][51] * [News][52] * [Blog][53] * [Careers][54] * [Contact Us][55] [[Glenroy Logo and Home Page]][56] * [Flexible Packaging][57] * [Flexible Packaging Films][58] * [— High Barrier Film Laminations][59] * [— Pouch Film Laminations][60] * [— Stick Pack Film Laminations][61] * [— Recyclable Film Laminations][62] * [— PCR Film Laminations][63] * [Stand Up Pouches][64] * [— PCR Pouches][65] * [— Recyclable Pouches][66] * [— STANDCAP Inverted Pouches][67] * [— Spouted Pouches][68] * [— Zipper Pouches][69] * [— Slider Pouches][70] * [— Other Pre-made Pouches][71] * [Narrow Web Flexible Packaging][72] * [Capabilities][73] * [Custom Engineered Laminations][74] * [Package Engineering Expertise][75] * [Adhesive Laminating & Coating][76] * [Extrusion Laminating & Coating][77] * [Prepress & Graphics Engineering][78] * [Flexographic Printing][79] * [Quality & Regulatory Systems][80] * [Custom Finishing & Slitting][81] * [Pouch Prototyping & Testing][82] * [Pouch Converting][83] * [Markets][84] * [Food & Beverage][85] * [Pharmaceutical & Medical][86] * [Pet Food and Treat Packaging][87] * [Nutritional & Nutraceuticals][88] * [Household Products & Chemicals][89] * [Oil & Lubricants][90] * [Personal Care & Cosmetics][91] * [Sustainability][92] * [Company Environmental Responsibility][93] * [Sustainable Flexible Packaging][94] * [Gallery][95] * [Resources][96] * [Flexible Packaging Definitions][97] * [Graphics Specifications][98] * [Web Layouts][99] * [Conversions & Calculators][100] * [About Us][101] * [Why Glenroy?][102] * [Vision, Mission, Values][103] * [History][104] * [Success Stories][105] * [Testimonials][106] * [News][107] * [Blog][108] * [Careers][109] * [Contact Us][110] [Contact Us][111] # Step into the Future with Innovative Flexible Packaging. Glenroy^{®} excels in sustainable flexible packaging, offering custom laminations and stand-up pouches for leading brands in various industries’. [Get Started On Your Project Today!][112] [][113] Flexible Packaging Solutions [][114] Meet the needs of your consumers with high quality [flexible packaging][115] solutions. [Learn More][116] [][117] TruRenu^{®} Sustainable Flexible Packaging [][118] Meet your sustainability goals with recyclable & PCR pouches and film laminations. [Learn More][119] [][120] Stand-up Pouches [][121] Drive consumer engagement by converting to customized, high barrier stand-up pouches. [Learn More][122] [][123] Premade STANDCAP Pouches [][124] Expand your packaging portfolio with STANDCAP. [Learn More][125] ## **Flexible Packaging Films and Narrow Web Flexible Packaging** All your flexible packaging needs, in one place. Fully customized & engineered for your products’ formulations, distribution methods, and filling equipment. Surface-printable flexible packaging rollstock for narrow web printers. [Learn More][126] Sustainability Our culture is rooted in ***environmental responsibility*** – through our people, in our products, and in our partnerships. We strive to become more sustainable every day. [Learn More About Our Sustainability Initiative][127] ### TruRenu^{®} Sustainable Flexible Packaging The TruRenu^{®} sustainable flexible packaging portfolio features recyclable pouches and film laminations that qualify for the How2Recycle^{®} store drop-off label program, post-consumer recycled (PCR) pouches and film laminations made with up to 53% recycled content and the eco-friendly premade STANDCAP Pouch in a PCR format with up to 48% recycled content. [Learn More][128] [TruRenu® Sustainable Flexible Packaging] ### Browse Our Flexible Packaging Gallery Jump-start your imagination with our interactive flexible packaging gallery. [View the Gallery][129] [Flexible Packaging Gallery] come grow with us Glenroy is a 3rd generation family-owned company and our culture reflects that. We’re always looking for new faces to join us. If you’re looking for a new career or just getting started, consider applying today! We specialize in flexible packaging and have career opportunities available in packaging, engineering, operations, supply chain, and other business functions. **Check out all open positions here!** ## What's New at Glenroy [[Copacking Checklist: What to Prepare Before Production]][130] ## [Copacking Checklist: What to Prepare Before Production][131] Copacking Checklist: What to Prepare Before Production The Short Answer: Before production day, lock in your product and packaging specs, source materials with backups in place, finalize artwork and labeling, and document your quality control plan. The more your... [read more][132] [[How to Optimize Your Packaging Supply Chain for Maximum Efficiency and Reliability]][133] ## [How to Optimize Your Packaging Supply Chain for Maximum Efficiency and Reliability][134] How to Optimize Your Packaging Supply Chain for Maximum Efficiency and Reliability The Short Answer: Optimizing your packaging supply chain comes down to picking the right packaging materials, building tight supplier partnerships, and using data to spot problems... [read more][135] [[What Is a Co-Packer? How Contract Packaging Works for Growing Brands]][136] ## [What Is a Co-Packer? How Contract Packaging Works for Growing Brands][137] What Is a Co-Packer? How Contract Packaging Works for Growing Brands The Short Answer: A co-packer (short for contract packager) is a third-party company that packages your product for you, either from scratch or after you've made it yourself. They own the equipment,... [read more][138] ## Get Started with Your Project * Name This field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged. * First Name* * Last Name* * Company* * Product Interest* -- Please Select --RollstockPremade PouchesSpouted PouchesSTANDCAP * Approximate Quantity of Premade Pouches* -- Please Select --150,000 - 200,000 per SKU201,000 - 250,000 per SKU251,000 - 300,000 per SKU301,000+ per SKU * Approximate Quantity of STANDCAP* -- Please Select --80,000 – 150,000 per SKU151,000 – 250,000 per SKU251,000 – 500,000 per SKU501,000+ per SKU * Approximate Quantity of Spouted Pouches* -- Please Select --Up to 12oz: 100,000 per SKU12oz – 48oz: 50,000 per SKU * Approximate Quantity of Rollstock* -- Please Select --10 million - 20 million sq inches21 million - 30 million sq inches31 million - 40 million sq inches41 million+ sq inches * Phone* * Email* * Your Project Request or Question* * Glenroy respects your privacy and does not sell, rent, or trade with third parties any information you provide. * CAPTCHA Request Information [Winner of over 100 Printing and Packaging Awards] Connect with Us * [Follow][139] * [Follow][140] * [Follow][141] * [Follow][142] * [Follow][143] [**Flexible Packaging**][1