[54]\n* [Food][55]\n* [Biopharmaceutical][56]\n* [Packaging][57]\n* [Other][58]\n* [Miscellaneous][59]\n[ Go To Top ][60]\n**Search**\nKeyword Search [Search Button][61]\n\nCommon keywords\n* Samyang\n* About Us\n* Samyang Corp.\n* Qone\n* Food\n* Chemical\n* Biopharmaceutical\n* ESG\n* Packaging\n\nGo to contents\n* [Newsroom][62]\n* [Library][63]\n* [Menu][64]\n* [Quick Link][65]\n\n[[Close]][66]\n[ Go To Top ][67]\nBeyond life’s potential,\ninnovate\nthe future\n[ 버튼 ][68]\nscroll down\n\n## Vision\n\nGlobal partner changing the future of humanity\n\nthrough specialty materials and solutions.\n\n[Purpose][69]\n\n## Business\n* [Chemical][70]\n* [Food][71]\n* [Biopharmaceutical][72]\n* [Packaging][73]\n\ncompany/esg\n[\n**COMPANY**\n\nUnlocking the infinite\npotential of life\n\n][74] [\n**ESG**\n\nAchieving growth to create\na sustainable future for all\n\n][75]\n100주년 기념관\n[\n**HISTORY**\n\nA century of passion,\nSamyang’s 100-year history\n\n][76]\n**MEDIA CENTER**\n\nMeet Samyang’s\nnew tomorrow\n\n[버튼][77]\n* [\n  **CAREER**\n  \n  Join the journey of Samyang Group.\n  \n  ][78]\n* [\n  **INVESTORS**\n  \n  Timely investment information on Samyang Group.\n  \n  ][79]\n* [\n  **CI**\n  \n  Samyang Group's CI guideline.\n  \n  ][80]\n* [Privacy policy][81]\n* [ Terms of Service][82]\n* [Refuse unauthorized email collection][83]\n* [Inquiry][84]\n* [Ethics Management][85]\n* [Affiliate Websites][86]\n  \n  *Holding Company*\n    [Samyang Holdings Corp.][87]\n  \n  *Chemical*\n    [Samyang Corp. (Chemical)][88] [Samnam Petrochemical][89] [Samyang Kasei][90] [Samyang\n    Innochem][91] [Samyang Fine Technology][92] [Samyang KCI][93] [VERDANT][94] [Samyang NC\n    Chem][95]\n  \n  *Food*\n    [Samyang Corp. (Food)][96]\n  \n  *Biopharmaceutical*\n    [Samyang Biopharm][97]\n  \n  *Packaging*\n    [Samyang Packaging][98]\n  \n  *Other*\n    [Samyang Data Systems][99] [Samyang Corp.(H&B)][100]\n* [ [Yotube] ][101]\n* [ [Instagram] ][102]\n[Samyang Group]\n\n31, Jongn