google.co.kr/chrome/?brand=FKPE&gclid=Cj0KCQiAmeKQBhDvARIsAHJ7mF5jwXSgKgzBPSJDCHd DEhK0JBAegMoNdwS7K8kvycq34u_R3coya84aArh3EALw_wcB&gclsrc=aw.ds [108]: https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/edge/server/download [109]: javascript:void(0) [110]: javascript:void(0); [111]: /en/guide/privacy [112]: javascript:void(0);", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "Samyang Corporation — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Produces PET films used in flexible packaging. | Produces PET films and other materials used in flexible packaging. | Chemicals; Food; Specialty materials | South Korea | South Korea", "role_description": "Brand / Marketer", "key_products": "Chemicals; Food; Specialty materials"}}, "X Score": "65", "Y Score": "68", "Overall Score": "66", "Industry Category": "Others / Packaging", "Quadrant": "Leaders"}, {"Company": "Schur Flexibles Group", "Website": "https://schur.com", "Founded": "2012", "Headquarters": "Baden", "Continent / Geography": "", "Operational Presence": "Austria; Germany; Poland; Czech Republic; Hungary; Romania; Italy; Spain; France; United Kingdom; United States; Mexico; Brazil; China; India; Russia; Ukraine; Turkey; Egypt; South Africa; Australia", "Ownership": "Private", "Employees": "2,200", "Core Categories": "high-barrier flexible packaging; made-to-measure packaging; protective packaging", "Specialty Focus": "Brand / Marketer; web_confirmed_flex_pack_player", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Brand / Marketer", "Contact Person": "Marek Pawlak", "Role": "Chief Sales Officer", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "https://www.linkedin.com/company/schur-flexibles-group", "Office No.": "+43 2252 266014", "Country Code": "AT", "Region Code": "EU", "Summary": "Schur Flexibles Group — channel participant (seed_file). Verify: Schur Flexibles specializes in flexible packaging, including high-barrier films and pouches.", "Data Sources": "google_ai; openai_sdk_residual", "_crawl": {"founded_year": 2012}, "Data Confidence": "High", "Quality Score": "4", "commercial_role": "Brand / Marketer", "verify_confidence": "95", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "schur.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "schur.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "Search\nSearch\n* [How we work][1]\n  * [Total solution provider][2]\n  * [Tailormade solutions][3]\n  * [Innovation][4]\n  * [Customer cases][5]\n* [What we do][6]\n  * [Carton packaging][7]\n  * [Flexible packaging][8]\n  * [Rollstock][9]\n  * [Automation][10]\n  * [Marking][11]\n    * [GSI][12]\n  * [Quality & Control][13]\n  * [Labels][14]\n  * [Software][15]\n* [Sustainability][16]\n  * [Our approach to sustainability][17]\n  * [Our footprint][18]\n* [Company][19]\n  * [Our history][20]\n  * [Careers][21]\n  * [News][22]\n* [Contact us][23]\n* [English][24]\n  * [English][25]\n  * [Dansk][26]\n  * [Swedish][27]\n* [How we work][28]\n  * [Total solution provider ›][29]\n  * [Tailormade solutions ›][30]\n  * [Innovation ›][31]\n  * [Customer cases ›][32]\n  * [View all][33]\n* [What we do][34]\n  * [Carton packaging ›][35]\n  * [Flexible packaging ›][36]\n  * [Rollstock ›][37]\n  * [Automation ›][38]\n  * [Marking ›][39]\n  * [Quality & Control ›][40]\n  * [Labels ›][41]\n  * [Software ›][42]\n  * [View all][43]\n  Marking\n  * [GSI][44]\n* [Sustainability][45]\n  * [Our approach to sustainability ›][46]\n  * [Our footprint ›][47]\n  * [View all][48]\n* [Company][49]\n  * [Our history ›][50]\n  * [Careers ›][51]\n  * [News ›][52]\n  * [View all][53]\n* [Contact us][54]\nSearch for pages, articles, etc.\nSearch\n[Contact us][55]\n[ [Language Switcher] ][56]\n* [English][57]\n* [Dansk][58]\n* [Swedish][59]\nMenu\n\n# Leader of\n# the pack\n\n#### Total solutions for your packaging needs\n\n[Learn more][60]\n\n### What we do\n\n[ [Karton emballage lodret, Schur] ][61]\n\n##### [Carton packaging][62]\n\nWe produce versatile packaging solutions in carton that both protects and promotes your product.\nWhen you choose carton as your packaging material your design options become almost endless. Both in\nterms of layout, color, how effectful it catches your attention, and other helpful attributes. Our\nteam of innovative constructors are ready to create a tailormade design that matches your product\nexactly.\n\nOur equipment and machines are based on the newest technology and, therefore, you are guaranteed a\nresult of the highest quality.  \n\n[Read more][63]\n[ [Flexible packaging, teaser] ][64]\n\n##### [Flexible packaging][65]\n\nFlexible packaging is the right choice for many reasons. It gives you bundles of opportunities no\nmatter what market or segment your product belongs to. Our universal bag formats require no tool\nchanges whilst offering a vast range of different solutions. Reclosable bags, stand-up bags,\ncompartment bags, and other innovative features are all options you can choose for your product.\n\nCombining our flexible packaging with our unique Schur®Star machines you will get a highly efficient\nand optimized packaging process - and a holistic solution to match your product.\n\n[Read more][66]\n[ [Schur Star light] ][67]\n\n##### [Machines & Automation][68]\n\nYour product and your production goals still remain the source to our innovation. We have many years\nof experience in developing and constructing machine solutions within packaging. Whether you need\ncarton packaging or flexible packaging or want automation in your production – we have a solution\nfor you.\n\nOur carton packaging machines offer solutions that span from endload, topload, sleeving, to vertical\nendload solutions. Our flexible packaging machines are a part of the innovative Schur®Star concept\nthat offers very short changeover times and impressively low waste levels.\n\n[Read more][69]\n[ [Videojet 1280, Marking and labeling] ][70]\n\n##### [Marking][71]\n\nThe marking demands of your products are increasingly getter more and more difficult to keep up\nwith. However, we provide you with security and the comfort in knowing that your product always\nmeets the requirements. Our technology also ensures high traceability on your markings.\n\nWe always start with your product and your production when advising you on your choice of marking\nequipment – whether it is a laser printer, inkjet printer or color ribbons. We are a Danish\ndistributor of equipment from VideoJet,"}}, "page_text": "Search Search * [How we work][1] * [Total solution provider][2] * [Tailormade solutions][3] * [Innovation][4] * [Customer cases][5] * [What we do][6] * [Carton packaging][7] * [Flexible packaging][8] * [Rollstock][9] * [Automation][10] * [Marking][11] * [GSI][12] * [Quality & Control][13] * [Labels][14] * [Software][15] * [Sustainability][16] * [Our approach to sustainability][17] * [Our footprint][18] * [Company][19] * [Our history][20] * [Careers][21] * [News][22] * [Contact us][23] * [English][24] * [English][25] * [Dansk][26] * [Swedish][27] * [How we work][28] * [Total solution provider ›][29] * [Tailormade solutions ›][30] * [Innovation ›][31] * [Customer cases ›][32] * [View all][33] * [What we do][34] * [Carton packaging ›][35] * [Flexible packaging ›][36] * [Rollstock ›][37] * [Automation ›][38] * [Marking ›][39] * [Quality & Control ›][40] * [Labels ›][41] * [Software ›][42] * [View all][43] Marking * [GSI][44] * [Sustainability][45] * [Our approach to sustainability ›][46] * [Our footprint ›][47] * [View all][48] * [Company][49] * [Our history ›][50] * [Careers ›][51] * [News ›][52] * [View all][53] * [Contact us][54] Search for pages, articles, etc. Search [Contact us][55] [ [Language Switcher] ][56] * [English][57] * [Dansk][58] * [Swedish][59] Menu # Leader of # the pack #### Total solutions for your packaging needs [Learn more][60] ### What we do [ [Karton emballage lodret, Schur] ][61] ##### [Carton packaging][62] We produce versatile packaging solutions in carton that both protects and promotes your product. When you choose carton as your packaging material your design options become almost endless. Both in terms of layout, color, how effectful it catches your attention, and other helpful attributes. Our team of innovative constructors are ready to create a tailormade design that matches your product exactly. Our equipment and machines are based on the newest technology and, therefore, you are guaranteed a result of the highest quality. [Read more][63] [ [Flexible packaging, teaser] ][64] ##### [Flexible packaging][65] Flexible packaging is the right choice for many reasons. It gives you bundles of opportunities no matter what market or segment your product belongs to. Our universal bag formats require no tool changes whilst offering a vast range of different solutions. Reclosable bags, stand-up bags, compartment bags, and other innovative features are all options you can choose for your product. Combining our flexible packaging with our unique Schur®Star machines you will get a highly efficient and optimized packaging process - and a holistic solution to match your product. [Read more][66] [ [Schur Star light] ][67] ##### [Machines & Automation][68] Your product and your production goals still remain the source to our innovation. We have many years of experience in developing and constructing machine solutions within packaging. Whether you need carton packaging or flexible packaging or want automation in your production – we have a solution for you. Our carton packaging machines offer solutions that span from endload, topload, sleeving, to vertical endload solutions. Our flexible packaging machines are a part of the innovative Schur®Star concept that offers very short changeover times and impressively low waste levels. [Read more][69] [ [Videojet 1280, Marking and labeling] ][70] ##### [Marking][71] The marking demands of your products are increasingly getter more and more difficult to keep up with. However, we provide you with security and the comfort in knowing that your product always meets the requirements. Our technology also ensures high traceability on your markings. We always start with your product and your production when advising you on your choice of marking equipment – whether it is a laser printer, inkjet printer or color ribbons. We are a Danish distributor of equipment from VideoJet, but we also offer equipment from Sato and Inkjet, among many others. [Read more][72] [ [Neutrale labels med baggrundsfarve, Schur] ][73] ##### [Labels][74] For your product to stand out among the other competing variants you need a recognizable label. We have years of experience developing labels that grasp the attention of the customers. It also takes know-how to ensure that your label can withstand different environments – whether it is cold or warm. Our full range of digital and flexo labelling solutions help you achieve all this. We offer everything from neutral labels to premium labels with extra features and our equipment makes it possible to produce a flexo plate in less than an hour. As a customer, you always get labels of high quality and with a fast delivery time. [Read more][75] [ [Rollstock teaser, Schur] ][76] ##### [Rollstock][77] Our wide range of rollstock materials are designed to improve your packaging performance in all markets. It is more than just rollstock. No matter the design, printing, or specs we can make your product eye-catching and user-friendly. Whether it includes barrier or non-barrier structures, metalized, or multiple layer structures we can provide you with the right solution. Our experience and know-how within rollstock walk perfectly hand-in-hand with our unique packaging concept Schur® Star system. This combination ensures a smooth and effective flexible packaging in any market or segment. [Read more][78] ### Thinking inside ### the box Your product is unique, and your packaging solution should reflect that. That’s why our approach is to start with you and your business challenge. Together, we’ll tailor an end-to-end packaging solution that delivers on your needs – from production line to pallet. [Learn more][79] [Skitser og noter omkring emballage til Taylormade golfbolde] ### A future-oriented tradition Our sustainability strategy is driven by a positive outlook for the future and a commitment to take action where we can make a difference. It’s part of our tradition to act with decency towards our customers, employees, partners, communities, and the environment. [Read more about sustainability][80] ## Celebrating 175 years of innovation Believing in the future and embracing change has been Schur’s philosophy and greatest strength, ever since we were established in 1846. As we turn 175, see how innovation has been a continuous strand in our DNA. [Get to know us][81] ### Subscribe to our Newsletter Sign up for our newsletter to get the latest news, cases, product launches, and so much more delivered right to your inbox! Full Name Email* Yes, I would like to receive marketing communication from Schur via. e-mail, post, or text.* Please verify your request* Submit * Policies * [Policies][82] * [Tax policy][83] * [Cookie policy][84] * [Privacy policy][85] * Shortcuts * [Exhibitions][86] * [Certificates][87] * [Downloads][88] * Contact us * [Contact us][89] * [Careers][90] ### Leader of the pack At Schur, it always starts with you and your product. You bring the challenge, and we’ll bring nearly two centuries of ingenuity, the latest technology, and a commitment to creating long-lasting value for businesses like yours. [Johan Wilhelm Schur] [Newsletter][91] • [SpeakUp Policy][92] • [SpeakUp System][93] [ [LinkedIn] ][94] Launch contact modal ### Get in touch Choose one of our locations Please select location Schur International Schur Pack Denmark Schur Pack Sweden Schur Pack Germany - Gallin Schur Star – Europe Schur Star - USA Schur Star - Australia Schur Automation Schur Marking Schur Software Schur Labels Name* Email* Phone* Messa