er of affordable, quality housing", "47,846 completed affordable homes", "Targeting 50,000 units by 2028", "38 prime locations across Malaysia, Thailand and Indonesia"]}], "services": [], "industries": ["Industrial", "Consumer", "Residential"], "key_markets": ["Malaysia", "Thailand", "Indonesia", "More than 60 countries worldwide (packaging exports)"]}, "financials": {"key_numbers": ["RM4.5 Billion Revenue", "3,710 Employees", "450,000 Metric Tons Manufacturing Capacity", "47,846 Completed Affordable Homes", "50,000 affordable homes target by 2028", "38 prime locations across Malaysia, Thailand and Indonesia", "Packaging exports to more than 60 countries worldwide"], "employee_count": "3,710 Employees"}, "relationships": {"customers": [], "investors": []}, "intel": "Scientex Berhad is a diversified Malaysian company with two core businesses: packaging and property development. The company is a leading producer of stretch film and flexible plastic packaging, exporting to over 60 countries, and a significant developer of affordable homes in Malaysia, Thailand, and Indonesia. With RM4.5 billion revenue and 3,710 employees, Scientex is scaling its affordable housing portfolio toward 50,000 units by 2028. Its strategic growth drivers are Capacity, Efficiency, and Product Value, supporting sustainable expansion in both segments. Actionable insight: monitor Scientex's continued regional expansion in Thailand and Indonesia, as well as capacity increases in packaging, to assess growth momentum.", "location": {"offices": [{"street": "No. 9, Persiaran Selangor, Seksyen 15, 40200 Shah Alam", "city": "Shah Alam", "state": "Selangor Darul Ehsan", "country": "Malaysia"}], "countries": ["Malaysia", "Thailand", "Indonesia"], "regions_served": ["More than 60 countries worldwide (packaging)"]}, "media": {"articles": [], "press_releases": [], "investor_presentations": []}}, "page_text": "", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "Scientex Berhad — channel participant (openai