on Our diverse portfolio of sealing, packaging, and material solutions instill confidence among brand owners and consumers alike. [ ][114] ## [Container Sealing][115] [ ][116] ## [Venting Technology][117] [ ][118] ## [Flexible Packaging][119] ## MaRkeTS We Serve ## Selig services the needs and challenges of a diverse array of products across the globe. ## Food ## Beverage ## Wine & Spirits ## Personal Care ## Healthcare ## Chemical & Industrial ## Ingenuity at Work ## WINE & SPIRITS ## Permeable Liners for Screwcap Wine Preservation OENOSEAL® is a range of liners specially designed for the wine market. These screwcap liners offer optimal oxygen transfer rates allowing for wine preservation. With Oenoseal, ensure freshness and flavor without concern of leakage. [ Learn More ][120] ## FOOD, BEVERAGE ## Lift 'n' Peel™: Consumer Preferred, Easy-to-Open Seals Engineered to prevent leaks, maintain product integrity and be consumer convenient, the breakthrough The Lift ‘n’ Peel™ sealing solution adds value to brands and distinguishes them from the competition. [ Learn More ][121] ## PERSONAL CARE ## Safe Solution for Consumer Aroma Sampling Let the product’s fragrance speak for itself with ScentVent™. Our proprietary venting technology allows the consumer to sample the fragrance of a product in a package that is induction sealed, without the need to remove the seal. [ Learn More ][122] ## WINE & SPIRITS ## Permeable Liners for Screwcap Wine Preservation OENOSEAL® is a range of liners specially designed for the wine market. These screwcap liners offer optimal oxygen transfer rates allowing for wine preservation. With Oenoseal, ensure freshness and flavor without concern of leakage. [ Learn More ][123] ## FOOD, BEVERAGE ## Lift 'n' Peel™: Consumer Preferred, Easy-to-Open Seals Engineered to prevent leaks, maintain product integrity and be consumer convenient, the breakthrough The Lift ‘n’ Peel™ sealing solution adds value to brands and distinguishes them from the competition