Materials That Make a Difference\n\n[Search Our Products][32]\n\n## What We Do\n\nAt Toray, we carefully design thoughtful materials that surround you; materials that help keep food\nfresh, provide protection against the sun’s rays, make cars more luxurious to the touch, add value\nto industrial applications, and much more.\n\nBut just as important as what we make is how we make it. And that’s always with you and your family,\nour families’, and everyone’s future in mind, because it’s the responsible thing to do.\n\n[View Films][33][View Foams][34]\n[ ][35]\n[Play Video]\n\n## Applications\n\nToray films and foams are used by a variety of converters and manufacturers to make a wide range of\nfinished goods for consumer and industrial applications.\n\nOur Torayfan® Division manufactures polypropylene and cast polypropylene films. The Lumirror®\nDivision manufactures polyester film. Metallized OPP and PET and bio-based PET films are available.\nToray’s PEF Division produces polyolefin, polypropylene, and polyethylene foams.\nPackaging\n[Learn More][36]\nLabels\n[Learn More][37]\nSolar Control Window\n[Learn More][38]\nTechnical\n[Learn More][39]\nHousing & Engineering\n[Learn More][40]\nAutomotive\n[Learn More][41]\nPackaging\n[ [Packaging] ][42]\n[Packaging][43]\nLabels\n[ [Labels] ][44]\n[Labels][45]\nSolar Control Window\n[ [Solar Control Window] ][46]\n[Solar Control Window][47]\nTechnical\n[ [Technical] ][48]\n[Technical][49]\nHousing & Engineering\n[ [Housing & Engineering] ][50]\n[Housing & Engineering][51]\nAutomotive\n[ [Automotive] ][52]\n[Automotive][53]\n\n## Find A Product For Your Industry\n\n[or Browse All Products][54]\n\n## Insights\n\nThe Toray team embodies the collaborative spirit. We’re happy to share our experience, product\nknowledge, and industry insights and hope you find these articles, news announcements, and videos\nhelpful, even inspiring.\n[Read More][55]\n[\n\n##### Paul McDevitt Promoted to Vice President of Finance & Supply Chain at Toray Plastics\n##### (America), Inc.\n\n][56]\n[Read More][57]\n[\n\n##### Franco Chicarella Appointed Senior Director of Sales, Marketing and R&D. Amanda Kirchoff\n##### Promoted to Director of Sales. Corbin Nichols Named Sales Manager.\n\n][58]\n[Read More][59]\n[\n\n##### Toray Plastics (America), Inc. Torayfan® Division Announces Craig Miller's Retirement. James\n##### Ota Named Account Manager. Josh Moniz Appointed Product Manager.\n\n][60]\n[Read More][61]\nNews\n[\n\n##### Toray Plastics (America), Inc., Expands International Sustainability and Carbon Certification\n\n][62]\n[View All Insights ][63]\n[Toray Plastics (America), Inc.]\nToray Plastics (America), Inc., is a subsidiary of Toray Industries Inc., the world leader in\nsynthetic fibers and textiles, carbon fibers, plastics, chemicals, pharmaceuticals and\nhigh-performance films.\nLocation\nToray Plastics (America), Inc. - Headquarters\n50 Belver Avenue\nNorth Kingstown, RI 02852\nContact Us\n[1-401-294-4511][64][RI-Marketing.tpa.ug@mail.toray][65]\nFollow Us\n[Cookie Policy][66] [Privacy Policy][67] [Terms of Use][68]\n\n2019 Toray Plastics (America), Inc. | [Designed by Digital Impulse][69]\n\nThis website uses cookies to ensure you get the best experience on our website.\n[Cookie Policy][70]\nOK\n\n[1]: https://www.toraytpa.com/products/\n[2]: tel:14012944511\n[3]: http://extranet.torayplasticsamerica.com/\n[4]: https://www.toraytpa.com\n[5]: https://www.toraytpa.com/about/\n[6]: https://www.toraytpa.com/about/\n[7]: ht"}}, "page_text": "[Product Selector][1][1-401-294-4511][2][Customer Login][3] [ [Toray Plastics (America), Inc.] ][4] Menu * [About][5] [About][6] [Mission][7] [CSR][8] [Sustainability][9] * [Applications][10] [Applications][11] [Packaging][12] [Labels][13] [Solar Control Window][14] [Technical][15] [Housing & Engineering][16] [Automotive][17] * [Products][18] [Products][19] [Films][20] [Torayfan® OPP][21] [Lumirror® PET][22] [Extrusion Coated][23] [Foams][24] [XLPE Foam][25] [ToraSoft® Foam][26] [TorayPEF® Foam][27] [ToraPRO™ Foam][28] * [Insights][29] * [Careers][30] * [Contact][31] # Materials That Make a Difference [Search Our Products][32] ## What We Do At Toray, we carefully design thoughtful materials that surround you; materials that help keep food fresh, provide protection against the sun’s rays, make cars more luxurious to the touch, add value to industrial applications, and much more. But just as important as what we make is how we make it. And that’s always with you and your family, our families’, and everyone’s future in mind, because it’s the responsible thing to do. [View Films][33][View Foams][34] [ ][35] [Play Video] ## Applications Toray films and foams are used by a variety of converters and manufacturers to make a wide range of finished goods for consumer and industrial applications. Our Torayfan® Division manufactures polypropylene and cast polypropylene films. The Lumirror® Division manufactures polyester film. Metallized OPP and PET and bio-based PET films are available. Toray’s PEF Division produces polyolefin, polypropylene, and polyethylene foams. Packaging [Learn More][36] Labels [Learn More][37] Solar Control Window [Learn More][38] Technical [Learn More][39] Housing & Engineering [Learn More][40] Automotive [Learn More][41] Packaging [ [Packaging] ][42] [Packaging][43] Labels [ [Labels] ][44] [Labels][45] Solar Control Window [ [Solar Control Window] ][46] [Solar Control Window][47] Technical [ [Technical] ][48] [Technical][49] Housing & Engineering [ [Housing & Engineering] ][50] [Housing & Engineering][51] Automotive [ [Automotive] ][52] [Automotive][53] ## Find A Product For Your Industry [or Browse All Products][54] ## Insights The Toray team embodies the collaborative spirit. We’re happy to share our experience, product knowledge, and industry insights and hope you find these articles, news announcements, and videos helpful, even inspiring. [Read More][55] [ ##### Paul McDevitt Promoted to Vice President of Fina