page_text": "[ Skip to main content ][1] [ [Home] ][2] ## Top menu * [About Us][3] * [Investors][4] * [Social Responsibility][5] * [Careers][6] * [Request Information][7] * [Newsroom][8] * [FR][9] * [EN][10] Home Search Section - Any -PackagingPrintingPremediaFlyer DistributionMedia & EducationIntegrated ServicesInvestorsCareersNews roomAbout Us Item language - Any -FrenchEnglish * [Retail Services & Printing][11] * [Retail Flyers][12] * [Newspapers][13] * [Marketing][14] * [Direct Mail][15] * [Marketing Products][16] * [Catalogues][17] * [Fulfillment Services][18] * [Print Essentials][19] * [Music & Entertainment][20] * [In-Store Marketing][21] * [Print Solutions][22] * [Campaign Management][23] * [Warehousing, Fulfillment & Co-Packing][24] * [Direct Marketing][25] * [raddar Flyers Solution][26] * [raddar][27] * [Targeo][28] * [Market Intelligence][29] * [Digital Service][30] * [Premedia][31] * [Think][32] * [Create][33] * [Produce][34] * [Manage][35] * [Books & Education][36] * [Education][37] * [School Québec][38] * [School Canada][39] * [CEGEP and University][40] * [Teacher Development Resources][41] * [Supplemental Materials][42] * [Trade Books][43] * [Book Printing][44] * [Books][45] * [Comic Books][46] * [Magazines][47] * [About Us][48] * [History][49] * [1976 to 1985][50] * [1986 to 1995][51] * [1996 to 2005][52] * [2006 to 2015][53] * [2016 to date][54] * [Management][55] * [Governance][56] * [Board of Directors and Committees][57] * [Policies][58] * [Code of Conduct and Ethics][59] * [Inclusion and Belonging][60] * [Organizational Documents][61] * [Values][62] * [Investors][63] * [Overview][64] * [Financial Information][65] * [Recent Quarterly Results][66] * [Archived Quarterly Disclosure][67] * [Annual Disclosure][68] * [Debt Maturity Schedule][69] * [Presentations and Events][70] * [Presentations][71] * [Events][72] * [Share Information][73] * [Share Class Structure][74] * [Dividends][75] * [Share Buyback][76] * [Quote][77] * [Resources][78] * [Contact][79] * [Auditors][80] * [Analyst Coverage][81] * [Forms][82] * [Tax Strategy][83] * [Social Responsibility][84] * [Publications and certifications][85] * [Sustainable Paper Procurement][86] * [CSR in Action][87] * [Careers][88] * [Working With Us][89] * [Why Us][90] * [Our People][91] * [Our Divisions][92] * [Search Careers][93] * [Request Information][94] * [Overview][95] * [Newsroom][96] * [Company Overview][97] * [About][98] * [Investors][99] * [Careers][100] * [Newsroom][101] * [Press Releases][102] * [Press kit][103] * [Services][104] * [Retail Services & Printing][105] * [In-Store Marketing][106] * [Premedia][107] * [raddar Flyers Solution][108] * [Books & Education][109] * [Contact][110] * [Contact Us][111] * [General Request][112] * [Privacy Policy][113] * [Sitemap][114] ## Navigation principale * [Retail Services & Printing][115] * [In-Store Marketing][116] * [raddar Flyers Solution][117] * [Premedia][118] * [Books & Education][119] # WE MAKE PRODUCTS FOR YOU Founded in 1976, TC Transcontinental is a Canadian retail marketing services company, Canada's largest printer, and the Canadian leader in French‑language educational publishing. Driven by the vision of a more informed, educated and prosperous society, TC Transcontinental propels its clients' success across the retail, education, book and information industries. With agility, creativity and boldness, we design and deliver innovative, high‑value products and services. Share * [ Facebook ][120] * [ Twitter ][121] * [ Linkedin ][122] * [ Email ][123] [ ## Retail Services & Printing ][124] TC Transcontinental offers innovative print solutions for flyers, in-store marketing products, newspapers, magazines, 4-colour books and personalized and mass marketing products. [ ## Books & Education ][125] TC Media publishes French-language educational resources. [ ## raddar flyers solution ][126] We offer turnkey services for the production, targeting and deployment of digital and printed advertising content through raddar® and Targeo. [ ## Newsroom ][127] Discover the latest news and announcements about TC Transcontinental. [ ## Sustainability ][128] TC Transcontinental has always diligently integrated best practices in sustainable development as part of its business activities and processes. [ ## CAREERS ][129] Every week, dozens of new jobs are posted in our sectors. Bring new momentum to your career! ## Footer * [Company Overview][130] * [About][131] * [Investors][132] * [Careers][133] * [Newsroom][134] * [Services][135] * [Retail Services & Printing][136] * [In-Store Marketing][137] * [Premedia][138] * [raddar Flyers Solution][139] * [Books & Education][140] * [Contact][141] * [Contact Us][142] * [General Request][143] * [Privacy Policy][144] * [Sitemap][145] Follow Us: -: - Last:- Variation: - - Volume:- [Share Information][146] Home All rights reserved © 2026 Transcontinental Inc. Realisation: [Camden][147] [1]: #main-content [2]: /en-ca [3]: /en-ca/about-us [4]: /en-ca/investors/overview [5]: /en-ca/social-responsibility [6]: https://wevegotitmade.com/ [7]: /en-ca/request-information [8]: /en-ca/company-overview/news-room/press-releases [9]: /fr-ca [10]: /en-ca [11]: /en-ca/retail-services-printing [12]: /en-ca/retail-services-printing/retail-flyers [13]: /en-ca/retail-services-printing/newspapers [14]: /en-ca/retail-services-printing/marketing [15]: /en-ca/retail-services-printing/marketing/direct-mail [16]: /en-ca/retail-services-printing/marketing/marketing-products [17]: /en-ca/retail-services-printing/marketing/catalogues [18]: /en-ca/retail-services-printing/marketing/fulfillment-services [19]: /en-ca/retail-services-printing/print-essentials [20]: /en-ca/retail-services-printing/music-entertainment [21]: /en-ca/in-store-marketing [22]: /en-ca/in-store-marketing/print-solutions [23]: /en-ca/in-store-marketing/campaign-management [24]: /en-ca/in-store-marketing/warehousing-fulfillment-co-packing [25]: /en-ca/in-store-marketing/direct-marketing [26]: /en-ca/raddar-fl