", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Flexible packaging films; laminates; printing solutions; halal-certified flexible packaging", "Specialty Focus": "Chinese producer of BOPP and CPP films used in flexible packaging.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Brand / Marketer", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "CN", "Region Code": "APAC", "Summary": "Zhongshan Hongsu Industrial Co., Ltd. — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Chinese producer of BOPP and CPP films used in flexible packaging.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Brand / Marketer", "verify_confidence": "85", "X Score": "58", "Y Score": "60", "Overall Score": "59", "Industry Category": "Others / Packaging", "Quadrant": "Challengers"}, {"Company": "Reynolds Consumer Products", "Website": "https://www.reynoldsconsumerproducts.com", "Founded": "2010", "Headquarters": "USA", "Continent / Geography": "NA(United States)", "Operational Presence": "United States", "Ownership": "Public (majority-owned by Rank Group Limited)", "Employees": "6000", "Core Categories": "Household products, food storage, cooking, baking, waste disposal", "Specialty Focus": "Known for aluminum foil and plastic wrap products used in household food storage.", "Key Brands Represented": "Reynolds Wrap", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Brand / Marketer", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "Chief Commercial Officer", "Email": "RCPCommunications@ReynoldsBrands.com", "LinkedIn": "https://www.linkedin.com/company/reynolds-consumer-products", "Office No.": "1 (224) 295-6800", "Country Code": "US", "Region Code": "NA", "Summary": "Reynolds Consumer Products — channel participant (chatgpt_recall). Verify: Manufactures aluminum foil and plastic wrap for food storage.", "Data Sources": "google_ai; openai_sdk_residual", "_crawl": {"founded_year": 2010}, "Data Confidence": "High", "Quality Score": "4", "commercial_role": "Brand / Marketer", "verify_confidence": "90", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "reynoldsconsumerproducts.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "reynoldsconsumerproducts.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "Toggle navigation [[Reynolds Consumer Products LLC]][1]\n[Contact][2] [Linkedin][3][Glassdoor][4]\n* [About][5]\n* [Brands][6]\n* [News][7]\n* [Sustainability][8]\n* [Investors][9]\n* [Careers][10]\n[We Create Products People Love]\n[banner-2]\n[Simplify Daily Life]\n[banner-3]\n[safety is our top priority]\n[banner-6]\nPreviousNext\n[ABOUT US][11]\n[[home-about]][12]\n[OUR BRANDS][13]\n[[home-brands]][14]\n[CAREERS][15]\n[[All Jobs]][16]\n\n## LATEST NEWS\n\n[Hefty Ultra Strong Fabuloso Watermelon]\n\n## The Hefty® Brand Brings Strength and Sweetness to Trash Day with New Hefty® Ultra Strong™ Trash\n## Bags with Fabuloso® Watermelon Scent\n\nThe Hefty® brand just made trash day a whole lot sweeter! In its latest collaboration with the\nbeloved cleaning brand, Fabuloso®, the Hefty® brand is introducing a fruity new scent to its trash\nbag portfolio: Hefty® Ultra Strong™ with Fabuloso Watermelon Scent.\n\nThese new scented trash bags combine trusted strength, effective odor control technology, and\nsix-in-one protection with the sweet scent of watermelon—making even the toughest cleanup\nsurprisingly refreshing.\n\nNow available in a variety of sizes, the Hefty® Ultra Strong™ with Fabuloso Watermelon Scent line\nincludes top-selling tall kitchen bags in classic white and vibrant pink, plus options for larger\nand smaller cleanup needs. All sizes feature break-resistant drawstrings and continuous odor control\ntechnology, keeping unpleasant smells away, whether tackling kitchen trash, yard work, or refreshing\nbathroom bins.\n\nThe full Hefty® Ultra Strong™ with Fabuloso Watermelon Scent lineup includes:\n\nHefty® Ultra Strong™ Tall Kitchen Trash Bags (13 Gallon, MSRP: $9.49) – Lift the heftiest loads with\npowerful odor neutralization technology to combat kitchen smells. Available in traditional white as\nwell as a pink version to add a splash of color to your kitchen.\n\nHefty® Ultra Strong™ Large Trash Bags (30 Gallon, MSRP: $9.49) – Built for heavy-duty messes with\nflexible strength and extra capacity.\n\nHefty® Medium Trash Bags (8 Gallon, MSRP: $4.99) – Just right for bathrooms, bedrooms, or office\nbins—tough on trash, easy on the nose.\n\nHefty® Small Trash Bags (4 Gallon, MSRP: $4.99) – Compact but powerful, perfect for quick cleanups\nand small spaces.\n\n\"We’re thrilled that we're taking scent and color to the next level with our new Hefty® Ultra\nStrong™ with Fabuloso Watermelon Scent line,” said Brian Lutz, Marketing Director with Hefty® Waste.\n“The bold, pink bags paired with the fresh and fruity scent of watermelon offers a fun, stylish way\nto bring personality to your everyday clean-up routines.”\n\nThis latest drop from the Hefty® team builds on the success of the brand’s ongoing partnership with\nFabuloso, which has already introduced best-selling scented bags in classic favorites like lavender\nand lemon. Bring even more freshness to your home with the strength you need and a scent you’ll\nlove.\n\nIn support of the new product launch, the Hefty® brand is also excited to continue partnering with\nJohn Cena who will star in an integrated advertising campaign. The campaign will roll out across\nplatforms over the course of the year showcasing the strength and sweetness of the new scent.\n\nHefty® Ultra Strong™ with Fabuloso Watermelon Scent trash bags are now available at retailers\nnationwide. To find them at a store near you, visit [Hefty.com][17] for more information and follow\n@HeftyBrands on social for updates, tips, and fresh content.\n\nAbout Fabuloso\nFabuloso Multi-Purpose Cleaner is the perfect solution for anyone looking for an effective way to\nkeep their home clean and smelling great. With a 2X concentrated formula vs. non-concentrated\nFabuloso Original and long lasting freshness, our cleaners will fill your entire home with joy -\nfrom the kitchen to the bathroom and beyond. Fabuloso 2X Watermelon has a bright watermelon, citrus,\nand fruity fragrance rounded out with soft musks and powdery notes. We have a wide variety of\nfragrances to try, including Lavender, Peach, Refr"}}, "page_text": "Toggle navigation [[Reynolds Consumer Products LLC]][1] [Contact][2] [Linkedin][3][Glassdoor][4] * [About][5] * [Brands][6] * [News][7] * [Sustainability][8] * [Investors][9] * [Careers][10] [We Create Products People Love] [banner-2] [Simplify Daily Life] [banner-3] [safety is our top priority] [banner-6] PreviousNext [ABOUT US][11] [[home-about]][12] [OUR BRANDS][13] [[home-brands]][14] [CAREERS][15] [[All Jobs]][16] ## LATEST NEWS [Hefty Ultra Strong Fabuloso Watermelon] ## The Hefty® Brand Brings Strength and Sweetness to Trash Day with New Hefty® Ultra Strong™ Trash ## Bags with Fabuloso® Watermelon Scent The Hefty® brand just made trash day a whole lot sweeter! In its latest collaboration with the beloved cleaning brand, Fabuloso®, the Hefty® brand is introducing a fruity new scent to its trash bag portfolio: Hefty® Ultra Strong™ with Fabuloso Watermelon Scent. These new scented trash bags combine trusted strength, effective odor control technology, and six-in-one protection with the sweet scent of watermelon—making even the toughest cleanup surprisingly refreshing. Now available in a variety of sizes, the Hefty® Ultra Strong™ with Fabuloso Watermelon Scent line includes top-selling tall kitchen bags in classic white and vibrant pink, plus options for larger and smaller cleanup needs. All sizes feature break-resistant drawstrings and continuous odor control technology, keeping unpleasant smells away, whether tackling kitchen trash, yard work, or refreshing bathroom bins. The full Hefty® Ultra Strong™ with Fabuloso Watermelon Scent lineup includes: Hefty® Ultra Strong™ Tall Kitchen Trash Bags (13 Gallon, MSRP: $9.49) – Lift the heftiest loads with powerful odor neutralization technology to combat kitchen smells. Available in traditional white as well as a pink version to add a splash of color to your kitchen. Hefty® Ultra Strong™ Large Trash Bags (30 Gallon, MSRP: $9.49) – Built for heavy-duty messes with flexible strength and extra capacity. Hefty® Medium Trash Bags (8 Gallon, MSRP: $4.99) – Just right for bathrooms, bedrooms, or office bins—tough on trash, easy on the nose. Hefty® Small Trash Bags (4 Gallon, MSRP: $4.99) – Compact but powerful, perfect for quick cleanups and small spaces. \"We’re thrilled that we're taking scent and color to the next level with our new Hefty® Ultra Strong™ with Fabuloso Watermelon Scent line,” said Brian Lutz, Marketing Director with Hefty® Waste. “The bold, pink bags paired with the fresh and fruity scent of watermelon offers a fun, stylish way to bring personality to your everyday clean-up routines.” This latest drop from the Hefty® team builds on the success of the brand’s ongoing partnership with Fabuloso, which has already introduced best-selling scented bags in classic favorites like lavender and lemon. Bring even more freshness to your home with the strength you need and a scent you’ll love. In support of the new product launch, the Hefty® brand is also excited to continue partnering with John Cena who will star in an integrated advertising campaign. The campaign will roll out across platforms over the course of the year showcasing the strength and sweetness of the new scent. Hefty® Ultra Strong™ with Fabuloso Watermelon Scent trash bags are now available at retailers nationwide. To find them at a store near you, visit [Hefty.com][17] for more information and follow @HeftyBrands on social for updates, tips, and fresh content. About Fabuloso Fabuloso Multi-Purpose Cleaner is the perfect solution for anyone looking for an effective way to keep their home clean and smelling great. With a 2X concentrated formula vs. non-concentrated Fabuloso Original and long lasting freshness, our cleaners will fill your entire home with joy - from the kitchen to the bathroom and beyond. Fabuloso 2X Watermelon has a bright watermelon, citrus, and fruity fragrance rounded out with soft musks and powdery notes. We have a wide variety of fragrances to try, including Lavender, Peach, Refreshing Lemon, Passion of Fruits, Tropical Spring, Spring Fresh & Citrus & Fruits. FABULOSO® and the FABULOSO Logo® are trademarks of Colgate-Palmolive Company and are manufactured and sold under license. [Read Full Article][18] Copyright© 2026 Reynolds Consumer Products [Equal opportunity][19] | [ETHICS][20] | [Privacy & Legal][21] | [CONTACT][22] | Cookie Preferences [1]: / [2]: /contact [3]: http://www.linkedin.com/company/reynolds-consumer-products-inc [4]: https://www.glassdoor.com/Overview/Working-at-Reynolds-Consumer-Products-EI_IE478496.11,37.htm [5]: /about [6]: /brands [7]: /news [8]: https://investors.reynoldsconsumerproducts.com/esg [9]: https://investors.reynoldsconsumerproducts.com/ [10]: /careers [11]: https://www.reynoldsconsumerproducts.com/about [12]: https://www.reynoldsconsumerproducts.com/about [13]: https://www.reynoldsconsumerproducts.com/brands [14]: https://www.reynoldsconsumerproducts.com/brands [15]: https://www.reynoldsconsumerproducts.com/careers [16]: https://www.reynoldsconsumerproducts.com/careers [17]: https://www.hefty.com/ [18]: /news [19]: /equal-opportunity [20]: /ethics [21]: /privacy [22]: /contact", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "Reynolds Consumer Products — channel participant (chatgpt_recall). Verify: Manufactures aluminum foil and plastic wrap for food storage. | Known for aluminum foil and plastic wrap products used in household food storage. | Household products, food storage, cooking, baking, waste disposal | Reynolds Wrap | United 